{"project":{"indexOriginal":0,"gameEngine":"APPUI","files":{"/addons/VNTextPatch/vntextpatch.js":{"data":[["I have extracted the game data","ゲームデータを抽出しました"],["Load game's data folder","ゲームのデータフォルダを読み込む"],["Select the game's data folder","ゲームのデータフォルダを選択"],["Engine Info","エンジン情報"],["Currently detected engine","現在検出されたエンジン"],["Manually Specify Format","形式を手動で指定"],["Manually specify the game format.<br />VNTranslationTools will automatically detect the format based on the file extension. However, if you encounter ambiguous file extensions, please provide the format explicitly.","ゲームの形式を手動で指定します。<br />VNTranslationToolsはファイル拡張子に基づいて形式を自動検出します。ただし、曖昧なファイル拡張子に遭遇した場合は、明示的に形式を指定してください。"],["Interface","インターフェース"],["VNTextPatch can parse the game into two formats: JSON or an XLSX spreadsheet. Please select the interface you want to use.","VNTextPatchはゲームをJSONまたはXLSXスプレッドシートの2つの形式に解析できます。使用したいインターフェースを選択してください。"],["Warning: There is a row limit if you're choosing XLSX spreadsheet.","警告：XLSXスプレッドシートを選択する場合、行数制限があります。"],["Create a new project","新規プロジェクトを作成"],["Invalid destination directory:","無効な宛先ディレクトリ："],["Close","閉じる"]],"context":[["tid/8164/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8228/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8233/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8246/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8251/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8256/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8261/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8266/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8271/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8276/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8455/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8516/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/11110/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"vntextpatch.js","dirname":"/addons/VNTextPatch","extension":".js","filename":"vntextpatch.js","path":"/addons/VNTextPatch/vntextpatch.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"I have extracted the game data":0,"Load game's data folder":1,"Select the game's data folder":2,"Engine Info":3,"Currently detected engine":4,"Manually Specify Format":5,"Manually specify the game format.<br />VNTranslationTools will automatically detect the format based on the file extension. However, if you encounter ambiguous file extensions, please provide the format explicitly.":6,"Interface":7,"VNTextPatch can parse the game into two formats: JSON or an XLSX spreadsheet. Please select the interface you want to use.":8,"Warning: There is a row limit if you're choosing XLSX spreadsheet.":9,"Create a new project":10,"Invalid destination directory:":11,"Close":12},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/actionEditorParser/ae4parser.js":{"data":[["Start translation from Action Editor 4 Game","アクションエディター4ゲームから翻訳を開始"],["Create Project","プロジェクトを作成"]],"context":[["tid/920/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/997/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"ae4parser.js","dirname":"/addons/actionEditorParser","extension":".js","filename":"ae4parser.js","path":"/addons/actionEditorParser/ae4parser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Start translation from Action Editor 4 Game":0,"Create Project":1},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/adminTools/!post.html":{"data":[["Actions","アクション"],["Build for 32bit system","32ビットシステム用にビルド"],["Build for non developer build too","非開発者ビルドもビルド"],["Custom Version","カスタムバージョン"],["Custom version (leave blank to autogenerate version)","カスタムバージョン（空白の場合は自動生成）"],["Generate minor versioning?","マイナーバージョニングを生成しますか？"],["Save patch to","パッチを保存先"],["Destination folder of generated patch","生成されたパッチの保存先フォルダ"],["Overider template","オーバーライダーテンプレート"],["Release template","リリーステンプレート"],["Select file to be available live and excluded from the package","ライブで利用可能でパッケージから除外するファイルを選択"],["The file will be excluded from package, but available online","ファイルはパッケージから除外されますが、オンラインで利用可能です"],["Make the process does not require user input","プロセスをユーザー入力なしで実行"],["Patch Type","パッチタイプ"],["The file will be excluded from package, but available online. Select the file you want to substitute.","ファイルはパッケージから除外されますが、オンラインで利用可能です。置換するファイルを選択してください。"],["Substitute trans.js with a fake one.","trans.jsを偽物に置き換える"],["Select Patch File","パッチファイルを選択"],["Select the generated patch file (*.tpch).","生成されたパッチファイル（*.tpch）を選択"],["Patches Links","パッチリンク"],["Autoupdate will download from these links. <b>Must be direct download!</b> Separate each download link with newline.","自動更新はこれらのリンクからダウンロードします。<b>直接ダウンロードである必要があります！</b> 各ダウンロードリンクは改行で区切ってください。"],["Download Links","ダウンロードリンク"],["Downloadable package for manual download. Separate each download link with newline.","手動ダウンロード用のダウンロード可能パッケージ。各ダウンロードリンクは改行で区切ってください。"],["Release Category","リリースカテゴリ"],["Category of the release.","リリースのカテゴリ。"],["Upload log along with this submission.","この提出と一緒にログをアップロードします。"],["Remove the same version found on database.","データベース上で見つかった同じバージョンを削除します。"],["Whether this release is enabled or not.","このリリースが有効かどうか。"],["Whether this release is hidden or not. If a release is hidden. Only Administrators and member with <code>view_hidden_releases</code> (Developer) capability can install the release via package installer.","このリリースが非表示かどうか。リリースが非表示の場合、管理者と<code>view_hidden_releases</code>（開発者）権限を持つメンバーのみがパッケージインストーラー経由でリリースをインストールできます。"],["Release Name","リリース名"],["Release Number","リリース番号"],["Release Date","リリース日"],["Release Key","リリースキー"],["Release Type","リリースタイプ"],["CRC","CRC"],["Required Version","必須バージョン"],["Minimum Version","最小バージョン"],["Release Note","リリースノート"],["Release Info","リリース情報"],["On Before Install","インストール前"],["On After Install","インストール後"],["Extra parameters","追加パラメータ"],["Remote file","リモートファイル"],["List of remote file, separate by new line","リモートファイルのリスト、改行で区切る"],["Patron Level","パトロンレベル"],["Post title","投稿タイトル"],["Release post","リリース投稿"],["Excerpt of the post","投稿の抜粋"]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText","idx/14/innerText","idx/29/innerText","idx/79/innerText"],["idx/2/innerText"],["idx/3/innerText"],["idx/4/innerText","idx/16/innerText"],["idx/5/innerText","idx/17/innerText"],["idx/6/innerText","idx/18/innerText"],["idx/7/innerText","idx/19/innerText"],["idx/8/innerText","idx/20/innerText"],["idx/9/innerText","idx/21/innerText"],["idx/10/innerText","idx/22/innerText"],["idx/11/innerText","idx/25/innerText"],["idx/12/innerText"],["idx/13/innerText","idx/28/innerText"],["idx/23/innerText"],["idx/26/innerText"],["idx/27/innerText"],["idx/31/innerText"],["idx/32/innerText"],["idx/33/innerText"],["idx/34/innerText"],["idx/35/innerText"],["idx/36/innerText"],["idx/37/innerText"],["idx/38/innerText"],["idx/39/innerText"],["idx/40/innerText"],["idx/41/innerText"],["idx/42/innerText"],["idx/43/innerText"],["idx/45/innerText"],["idx/47/innerText"],["idx/49/innerText"],["idx/51/innerText"],["idx/53/innerText"],["idx/55/innerText"],["idx/57/innerText"],["idx/59/innerText"],["idx/61/innerText"],["idx/63/innerText"],["idx/65/innerText"],["idx/67/innerText"],["idx/69/innerText"],["idx/70/innerText"],["idx/71/innerText"],["idx/73/innerText"],["idx/75/innerText"],["idx/77/innerText"]],"basename":"!post.html","dirname":"/addons/adminTools","extension":".html","filename":"!post.html","path":"/addons/adminTools/!post.html","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Actions":0,"":1,"Build for 32bit system":1,"Build for non developer build too":2,"Custom Version":3,"Custom version (leave blank to autogenerate version)":4,"Generate minor versioning?":5,"Save patch to":6,"Destination folder of generated patch":7,"Overider template":8,"Release template":9,"Select file to be available live and excluded from the package":10,"The file will be excluded from package, but available online":11,"Make the process does not require user input":12,"Patch Type":13,"The file will be excluded from package, but available online. Select the file you want to substitute.":14,"Substitute trans.js with a fake one.":15,"Select Patch File":16,"Select the generated patch file (*.tpch).":17,"Patches Links":18,"Autoupdate will download from these links. <b>Must be direct download!</b> Separate each download link with newline.":19,"Download Links":20,"Downloadable package for manual download. Separate each download link with newline.":21,"Release Category":22,"Category of the release.":23,"Upload log along with this submission.":24,"Remove the same version found on database.":25,"Whether this release is enabled or not.":26,"Whether this release is hidden or not. If a release is hidden. Only Administrators and member with <code>view_hidden_releases</code> (Developer) capability can install the release via package installer.":27,"Release Name":28,"Release Number":29,"Release Date":30,"Release Key":31,"Release Type":32,"CRC":33,"Required Version":34,"Minimum Version":35,"Release Note":36,"Release Info":37,"On Before Install":38,"On After Install":39,"Extra parameters":40,"Remote file":41,"List of remote file, separate by new line":42,"Patron Level":43,"Post title":44,"Release post":45,"Excerpt of the post":46},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/adminTools/!postPackage.html":{"data":[["Select package json file","package.jsonファイルを選択"],["Select the generated patch file","生成されたパッチファイルを選択"],["Or Select Destination File","または宛先ファイルを選択"],["Or Download location","またはダウンロード場所"],["Icon","アイコン"],["Author","作者"],["Name","名前"],["name of the package.","パッケージの名前。"],["Title","タイトル"],["Title of the package.","パッケージのタイトル。"],["Version","バージョン"],["Version of the package.","パッケージのバージョン"],["Description","説明"],["Description of the package.","パッケージの説明"],["Whether this release is active or not.","このリリースがアクティブかどうか"],["Whether this release is hidden or not.","このリリースが非表示かどうか"],["Patron Level","パトロンレベル"],["Current month's pledge in $","今月の寄付額（ドル）"],["Patron Points","パトロンポイント"],["100pts = 1$","100ポイント = 1ドル"],["Purchase type","購入タイプ"],["Type of the purchase.","購入の種類"],["On Before Install","インストール前"],["Javascript code to be run before install","インストール前に実行するJavaScriptコード"],["On After Install","インストール後"],["Javascript code to be run after install","インストール後に実行するJavaScriptコード"],["Manifest","マニフェスト"],["Manifest data","マニフェストデータ"],["Minimum version","最小バージョン"],["Minimum version of Translator++ to be able to insatall this addon.","このアドオンをインストールできるTranslator++の最小バージョン"],["Release Date","リリース日"],["Is parser changed?","パーサーは変更されましたか？"],["Mark as parser change. Would warn the user to backup their project before updating to this addon.","パーサー変更としてマーク。このアドオンに更新する前に、ユーザーにプロジェクトのバックアップを警告します。"],["Remove the same version found on database.","データベースで見つかった同じバージョンを削除します。"],["Excluded files","除外ファイル"],["Files listed here will be excluded from the distribution packages","ここにリストされたファイルは配布パッケージから除外されます"],["Script URL","スクリプトURL"],["Script of the URL.","URLのスクリプト。"],["Upload script","スクリプトをアップロード"],["This script will be uploaded to the back-end and will be processed with [php]Scripts template script.\n\t\t\t\t\tTo use this feature:\n\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Create a wordpress page with <b>[php]Scripts template</b> template.<br>You can also set the patreon's requirement to view the post.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Add the url to the page into the package.json file with <b>l</b> GET parameter point to the local file.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFor example : <u>https://dreamsavior.net/script/translation-proxy/?l=/sub.js</u>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t\t\t","このスクリプトはバックエンドにアップロードされ、[php]スクリプトテンプレートスクリプトで処理されます。\n\t\t\t\t\tこの機能を使用するには：\n\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><b>[php]スクリプトテンプレート</b>テンプレートでWordPressページを作成します。<br>投稿を表示するためのPatreon要件も設定できます。</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>パッケージ.jsonファイルに、ローカルファイルを指す<b>l</b> GETパラメータを持つページのURLを追加します。<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t例：<u>https://dreamsavior.net/script/translation-proxy/?l=/sub.js</u>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t\t\t"],["Actions","アクション"]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText"],["idx/1/innerText","idx/3/innerText"],["idx/2/innerText"],["idx/4/innerText"],["idx/6/innerText"],["idx/8/innerText"],["idx/10/innerText"],["idx/11/innerText"],["idx/12/innerText"],["idx/13/innerText"],["idx/14/innerText"],["idx/15/innerText"],["idx/16/innerText"],["idx/17/innerText"],["idx/18/innerText"],["idx/19/innerText"],["idx/20/innerText"],["idx/21/innerText"],["idx/22/innerText"],["idx/23/innerText"],["idx/24/innerText"],["idx/25/innerText"],["idx/26/innerText"],["idx/27/innerText"],["idx/28/innerText"],["idx/29/innerText"],["idx/30/innerText"],["idx/31/innerText"],["idx/32/innerText"],["idx/33/innerText"],["idx/34/innerText"],["idx/36/innerText"],["idx/37/innerText"],["idx/38/innerText"],["idx/39/innerText"],["idx/40/innerText"],["idx/41/innerText"],["idx/42/innerText"],["idx/43/innerText"],["idx/44/innerText"],["idx/47/innerText"]],"basename":"!postPackage.html","dirname":"/addons/adminTools","extension":".html","filename":"!postPackage.html","path":"/addons/adminTools/!postPackage.html","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Select package json file":0,"Select the generated patch file":1,"Or Select Destination File":2,"Or Download location":3,"":4,"Icon":4,"Author":5,"Name":6,"name of the package.":7,"Title":8,"Title of the package.":9,"Version":10,"Version of the package.":11,"Description":12,"Description of the package.":13,"Whether this release is active or not.":14,"Whether this release is hidden or not.":15,"Patron Level":16,"Current month's pledge in $":17,"Patron Points":18,"100pts = 1$":19,"Purchase type":20,"Type of the purchase.":21,"On Before Install":22,"Javascript code to be run before install":23,"On After Install":24,"Javascript code to be run after install":25,"Manifest":26,"Manifest data":27,"Minimum version":28,"Minimum version of Translator++ to be able to insatall this addon.":29,"Release Date":30,"Is parser changed?":31,"Mark as parser change. Would warn the user to backup their project before updating to this addon.":32,"Remove the same version found on database.":33,"Excluded files":34,"Files listed here will be excluded from the distribution packages":35,"Script URL":36,"Script of the URL.":37,"Upload script":38,"This script will be uploaded to the back-end and will be processed with [php]Scripts template script.\n\t\t\t\t\tTo use this feature:\n\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Create a wordpress page with <b>[php]Scripts template</b> template.<br>You can also set the patreon's requirement to view the post.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Add the url to the page into the package.json file with <b>l</b> GET parameter point to the local file.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFor example : <u>https://dreamsavior.net/script/translation-proxy/?l=/sub.js</u>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t\t\t":39,"Actions":40},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/adminTools/adminTools.js":{"data":[["Close","閉じる"]],"context":[["tid/588/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"adminTools.js","dirname":"/addons/adminTools","extension":".js","filename":"adminTools.js","path":"/addons/adminTools/adminTools.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Close":0},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/aec/aec.js":{"data":[["Universal Archive Unpacker","ユニバーサルアーカイブアンパッカー"]],"context":[["tid/1001/type/StringLiteral","tid/1239/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"aec.js","dirname":"/addons/aec","extension":".js","filename":"aec.js","path":"/addons/aec/aec.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Universal Archive Unpacker":0},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/bakinParser/bakin-proxy.js":{"data":[["Extract a Bakin game dictionary from data.rbpack, translate dic.txt, and patch the player automatically.","data.rbpackからBakinゲーム辞書を抽出し、dic.txtを翻訳し、プレイヤーを自動的にパッチします。"],["Create project","プロジェクトを作成"],["Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!","エラー：customFieldが定義されていません。これは起こるはずがありません！"],["Please select the Bakin game executable.","Bakinゲームの実行ファイルを選択してください。"],["<h2>Proxy workflow</h2>","<h2>プロキシワークフロー</h2>"],["Translator++ unpacks data.rbpack into a temporary folder.","Translator++はdata.rbpackを一時フォルダに解凍します。"],["Split Dictionary uses dump-split and creates one .txt file per source area by default.","分割辞書はデフォルトでdump-splitを使用し、ソース領域ごとに1つの.txtファイルを作成します。"],["Merge Dictionary uses a single dic.txt.","マージ辞書は単一のdic.txtを使用します。"],["Injection merges split dictionaries back into data/dic.txt and patches the player executable.","インジェクションは分割された辞書をデータ/dic.txtにマージし、プレイヤー実行ファイルにパッチを適用します。"],["Split Dictionary (default)","辞書を分割（デフォルト）"],["Merge Dictionary","辞書をマージ"]],"context":[["tid/2860/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2929/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2966/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3002/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3253/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3266/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3277/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3288/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3299/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3383/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3393/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"bakin-proxy.js","dirname":"/addons/bakinParser","extension":".js","filename":"bakin-proxy.js","path":"/addons/bakinParser/bakin-proxy.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Extract a Bakin game dictionary from data.rbpack, translate dic.txt, and patch the player automatically.":0,"Create project":1,"Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!":2,"Please select the Bakin game executable.":3,"<h2>Proxy workflow</h2>":4,"Translator++ unpacks data.rbpack into a temporary folder.":5,"Split Dictionary uses dump-split and creates one .txt file per source area by default.":6,"Merge Dictionary uses a single dic.txt.":7,"Injection merges split dictionaries back into data/dic.txt and patches the player executable.":8,"Split Dictionary (default)":9,"Merge Dictionary":10},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/bakinParser/bakin-xlsx.js":{"data":[["Start a translation project from RPG Developer Bakin localization sheet (xlsx).","RPG Developer Bakinのローカライゼーションシート（xlsx）から翻訳プロジェクトを開始します。"],["Create project","プロジェクトを作成"],["Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!","エラー：customFieldが定義されていません。これは起こるはずがありません！"],["Please select the entry point to translate.","翻訳するエントリーポイントを選択してください。"],["<h2>RPG Developer Bakin editor is required</h2>","<h2>RPG Developer Bakinエディターが必要です</h2>"],["RPG Developer Bakin editor is required to start the translation project.","翻訳プロジェクトを開始するにはRPG Developer Bakinエディターが必要です。"],["<h2>Before you start</h2>","<h2>開始前に</h2>"],["<a href=\"#\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.bakinParser.openDecompileForm()\">Unpack your game</a> into editable RPG Developer Bakin's project.","<a href=\"#\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.bakinParser.openDecompileForm()\">ゲームをアンパック</a>して編集可能なRPG Developer Bakinプロジェクトにします。"],["Export the localization strings by using RPG Developer Bakin application into a xlsx file. <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/docs/rpg-developer-bakin/how-to-translate-rpg-developer-bakin/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"true\">See the guide here on how to translate Bakin game</a>.","RPG Developer Bakinアプリケーションを使用してローカライゼーション文字列をxlsxファイルにエクスポートします。<a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/docs/rpg-developer-bakin/how-to-translate-rpg-developer-bakin/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"true\">Bakinゲームの翻訳方法についてはこちらのガイドをご覧ください</a>。"]],"context":[["tid/614/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/683/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/720/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/756/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1034/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1041/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1064/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1077/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1088/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"]],"basename":"bakin-xlsx.js","dirname":"/addons/bakinParser","extension":".js","filename":"bakin-xlsx.js","path":"/addons/bakinParser/bakin-xlsx.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Start a translation project from RPG Developer Bakin localization sheet (xlsx).":0,"Create project":1,"Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!":2,"Please select the entry point to translate.":3,"<h2>RPG Developer Bakin editor is required</h2>":4,"RPG Developer Bakin editor is required to start the translation project.":5,"<h2>Before you start</h2>":6,"<a href=\"#\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.bakinParser.openDecompileForm()\">Unpack your game</a> into editable RPG Developer Bakin's project.":7,"Export the localization strings by using RPG Developer Bakin application into a xlsx file. <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/docs/rpg-developer-bakin/how-to-translate-rpg-developer-bakin/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"true\">See the guide here on how to translate Bakin game</a>.":8},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/basicUtils.js":{"data":[["NWJS Version","NWJSバージョン"],["Change into this NWJS version","このNWJSバージョンに変更"],["Use Developer version","開発者バージョンを使用"],["Use the NWJS Developer version. The Developer version has developer tools available. Suitable for debugging and development.","NWJS開発者バージョンを使用します。開発者バージョンには開発者ツールが利用可能で、デバッグや開発に適しています。"],["In Developer version you can use <b>Developer Console</b>. Developer Console can be accessed by pressing F12 or right-clicking the app and selecting 'Inspect'.","開発者バージョンでは<b>開発者コンソール</b>を使用できます。開発者コンソールはF12を押すか、アプリを右クリックして「Inspect」を選択することでアクセスできます。"],["Use 32-bit version","32ビットバージョンを使用"],["Use the 32-bit version of NWJS. The 32-bit version is useful for compatibility with older systems. It is recommended to uncheck this option if possible (just upgrade your machine, dude).","NWJSの32ビットバージョンを使用します。32ビットバージョンは古いシステムとの互換性に役立ちます。可能であればこのオプションをオフにすることをお勧めします（マシンをアップグレードしましょう、おい）。"],["Some Translator++ feature may not work across NWJS version","一部のTranslator++機能はNWJSバージョン間で動作しない場合があります"],["Please be aware that some Translator++ feature may not work across NWJS version. Make sure to test your project after changing the NWJS version.","Translator++の一部機能はNWJSバージョン間で動作しない可能性がありますのでご注意ください。NWJSバージョンを変更した後は、プロジェクトを必ずテストしてください。"],["You're currently running on NWJS ver.","現在実行中のNWJSバージョン："],["Change Translator++ Core NWJS version","Translator++ CoreのNWJSバージョンを変更"],["You're already using the selected NWJS version.","選択されたNWJSバージョンは既に使用中です。"],["This operation will close Translator++ and change the current NW.js version into","この操作によりTranslator++が閉じられ、現在のNW.jsバージョンが次のように変更されます："],["If you have any unsaved changes, please select 'Cancel' and save your project first.\nDo you want to continue?","未保存の変更がある場合は、「キャンセル」を選択してプロジェクトを先に保存してください。\n続行しますか？"]],"context":[["tid/1342/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1352/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1428/type/StringLiteral","tid/1617/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1438/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1449/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1482/type/StringLiteral","tid/1641/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1492/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1532/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1537/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1542/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1669/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1745/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1769/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1782/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"]],"basename":"basicUtils.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils","extension":".js","filename":"basicUtils.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/basicUtils.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"NWJS Version":0,"Change into this NWJS version":1,"Use Developer version":2,"Use the NWJS Developer version. The Developer version has developer tools available. Suitable for debugging and development.":3,"In Developer version you can use <b>Developer Console</b>. Developer Console can be accessed by pressing F12 or right-clicking the app and selecting 'Inspect'.":4,"Use 32-bit version":5,"Use the 32-bit version of NWJS. The 32-bit version is useful for compatibility with older systems. It is recommended to uncheck this option if possible (just upgrade your machine, dude).":6,"Some Translator++ feature may not work across NWJS version":7,"Please be aware that some Translator++ feature may not work across NWJS version. Make sure to test your project after changing the NWJS version.":8,"You're currently running on NWJS ver.":9,"Change Translator++ Core NWJS version":10,"You're already using the selected NWJS version.":11,"This operation will close Translator++ and change the current NW.js version into":12,"If you have any unsaved changes, please select 'Cancel' and save your project first.\nDo you want to continue?":13},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/mainMenu.js":{"data":[["Change Language","言語を変更"],["No MTL available for this language pair","この言語ペアにはMTLが利用できません"],["Change default MTL for this project","このプロジェクトのデフォルトMTLを変更"],["???","???"],["Search in a folder","フォルダ内を検索"],["Search in Staging Files","ステージングファイル内を検索"],["Search in Original Files","オリジナルファイル内を検索"],["No original files path is set for this project.","このプロジェクトにはオリジナルファイルのパスが設定されていません。"],["Search in Translated Files","翻訳ファイル内を検索"],["No translated files path is set for this project.\nYou need to inject your translation once to set the translated files path.","このプロジェクトには翻訳ファイルのパスが設定されていません。\n翻訳ファイルのパスを設定するには、一度翻訳を注入する必要があります。"],["Chat with AI Assistant","AIアシスタントとチャット"],["AI Assistant is not available since the new features are not loaded.\nPlease reinstall or re-update Translator++.","新機能が読み込まれていないため、AIアシスタントは利用できません。\nTranslator++を再インストールまたは再更新してください。"]],"context":[["tid/442/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/729/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/974/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1182/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1339/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1404/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1501/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1539/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1624/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1662/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1777/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1812/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"mainMenu.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils","extension":".js","filename":"mainMenu.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/mainMenu.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Change Language":0,"No MTL available for this language pair":1,"Change default MTL for this project":2,"???":3,"Search in a folder":4,"Search in Staging Files":5,"Search in Original Files":6,"No original files path is set for this project.":7,"Search in Translated Files":8,"No translated files path is set for this project.\nYou need to inject your translation once to set the translated files path.":9,"Chat with AI Assistant":10,"AI Assistant is not available since the new features are not loaded.\nPlease reinstall or re-update Translator++.":11},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/utils/HTMLPacker.js":{"data":[["Path is not a file:","パスはファイルではありません："],["Icon path is not a file:","アイコンパスはファイルではありません："],["Path is not an exe file:","パスはexeファイルではありません："],["Icon path is not an ico file:","アイコンパスはicoファイルではありません："],["Html entry point","HTMLエントリーポイント"],["Select the html entry point file (usually index.html)","HTMLエントリーポイントファイルを選択してください（通常はindex.html）"],["Destination folder","出力先フォルダ"],["Select destination folder. The process will replace the existing files.","出力先フォルダを選択してください。既存のファイルは置き換えられます。"],["NWJS version","NWJSバージョン"],["Optional. Select NWJS version and architecture.<br />Latest version not always better, just use what works for you.","オプション。NWJSバージョンとアーキテクチャを選択してください。<br />最新バージョンが常に良いとは限りません、ご自身に合うものをお使いください。"],["Application ID","アプリケーションID"],["Set the application ID for the game. The ID must be in lowercase and can only contain letters, numbers, and underscores.","ゲームのアプリケーションIDを設定してください。IDは小文字で、英数字とアンダースコアのみ使用できます。"],["Application description","アプリケーション説明"],["Set the application description for the game.","ゲームのアプリケーション説明を設定してください。"],["Window title","ウィンドウタイトル"],["Set the default window title for the game.<br />This value may be overridden by the game engine.","ゲームのデフォルトウィンドウタイトルを設定してください。<br />この値はゲームエンジンによって上書きされる場合があります。"],["Window width","ウィンドウ幅"],["Set the default window width for the game.","ゲームのデフォルトウィンドウ幅を設定してください。"],["Window height","ウィンドウ高さ"],["Set the default window height for the game.","ゲームのデフォルトウィンドウ高さを設定してください。"],["Full screen","フルスクリーン"],["Set the game to start in full screen mode.","ゲームをフルスクリーンモードで起動するように設定します。"],["Resizable","サイズ変更可能"],["Set the game window to be resizable.","ゲームウィンドウをサイズ変更可能に設定します。"],["Game icon","ゲームアイコン"],["Select the icon file for the game executable. The icon file must be in .ico format. The icon will be embedded in the game executable.","ゲーム実行ファイルのアイコンファイルを選択します。アイコンファイルは .ico 形式である必要があります。アイコンはゲーム実行ファイルに埋め込まれます。"],["Through this form, you can create a playable package of your game. <br />The process will replace the existing files in the destination folder.","このフォームを通じて、ゲームのプレイ可能なパッケージを作成できます。<br />プロセスにより、宛先フォルダ内の既存ファイルが置き換えられます。"],["Start the application in full screen mode","アプリケーションをフルスクリーンモードで起動"],["Allow the application to be resizable","アプリケーションのサイズ変更を許可"],["HTML Compiler","HTMLコンパイラ"],["Compile","コンパイル"],["Source path can not empty","ソースパスは空にできません"],["Destination path can not empty","宛先パスは空にできません"]],"context":[["tid/86/type/StringLiteral","tid/4136/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/116/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/151/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/186/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2424/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2434/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2474/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2484/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2524/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2534/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2587/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2597/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2631/type/StringLiteral","tid/3795/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2641/type/StringLiteral","tid/3805/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2675/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2685/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2722/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2732/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2766/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2776/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2810/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2820/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2854/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2864/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2899/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2909/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2950/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3900/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3924/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4020/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4037/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4083/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4104/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"HTMLPacker.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils/utils","extension":".js","filename":"HTMLPacker.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/utils/HTMLPacker.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Path is not a file:":0,"Icon path is not a file:":1,"Path is not an exe file:":2,"Icon path is not an ico file:":3,"Html entry point":4,"Select the html entry point file (usually index.html)":5,"Destination folder":6,"Select destination folder. The process will replace the existing files.":7,"NWJS version":8,"Optional. Select NWJS version and architecture.<br />Latest version not always better, just use what works for you.":9,"Application ID":10,"Set the application ID for the game. The ID must be in lowercase and can only contain letters, numbers, and underscores.":11,"Application description":12,"Set the application description for the game.":13,"Window title":14,"Set the default window title for the game.<br />This value may be overridden by the game engine.":15,"Window width":16,"Set the default window width for the game.":17,"Window height":18,"Set the default window height for the game.":19,"Full screen":20,"Set the game to start in full screen mode.":21,"Resizable":22,"Set the game window to be resizable.":23,"Game icon":24,"Select the icon file for the game executable. The icon file must be in .ico format. The icon will be embedded in the game executable.":25,"Through this form, you can create a playable package of your game. <br />The process will replace the existing files in the destination folder.":26,"Start the application in full screen mode":27,"Allow the application to be resizable":28,"HTML Compiler":29,"Compile":30,"Source path can not empty":31,"Destination path can not empty":32},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/utils/Updater.js":{"data":[["An update is being installed. Please do not close the application until the installation is completed.","アップデートをインストール中です。インストールが完了するまでアプリケーションを閉じないでください。"],["Package Path","パッケージパス"],["Select the package file.","パッケージファイルを選択します。"],["Package Key","パッケージキー"],["If you have the key, please enter it here. If not, leave it empty.","キーをお持ちの場合は、ここに入力してください。ない場合は空のままにしてください。"],["Through this form, you can update Translator++ with the updater package file. You can download the updater package <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/translator-plusplus/translator-update-package/\" external>here</a>.","このフォームを通じて、アップデータパッケージファイルでTranslator++を更新できます。アップデータパッケージは<a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/translator-plusplus/translator-update-package/\" external>こちら</a>からダウンロードできます。"],["Update from package","パッケージから更新"],["Update","更新"],["Update Translator++","Translator++を更新"]],"context":[["tid/4918/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6562/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6572/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6612/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6622/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6661/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/6753/type/StringLiteral","tid/7195/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6770/type/StringLiteral","tid/7091/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7120/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"Updater.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils/utils","extension":".js","filename":"Updater.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/utils/Updater.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"An update is being installed. Please do not close the application until the installation is completed.":0,"Package Path":1,"Select the package file.":2,"Package Key":3,"If you have the key, please enter it here. If not, leave it empty.":4,"Through this form, you can update Translator++ with the updater package file. You can download the updater package <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/translator-plusplus/translator-update-package/\" external>here</a>.":5,"Update from package":6,"Update":7,"Update Translator++":8},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/utils/info.js":{"data":[["You have ","あなたは"],[" missed update(s)!"," 件の更新を見逃しました！"],["Translator++ will update itself if auto-update is enabled.","自動更新が有効な場合、Translator++は自身を更新します。"],["You can download the latest core version of Translator++ at","Translator++の最新コアバージョンは、以下からダウンロードできます："],["This update is available for all patrons.","この更新はすべてのパトロンに利用可能です。"],["This update is available for tier $","この更新はティア $"],[" patrons or greater."," 以上のパトロンに利用可能です。"],["You're up-to-date!","最新版です！"],["Thanks for staying up to date with Translator++! You're on the newest version, and we appreciate your support. Enjoy translating!","Translator++を最新版に保っていただきありがとうございます！ 最新バージョンをご利用中で、サポートに感謝します。翻訳をお楽しみください！"],["Some update information may be shown from cache. You can click <b>'Check for update'</b> to load the latest version details.","一部の更新情報はキャッシュから表示される場合があります。最新のバージョン詳細を読み込むには、<b>'更新を確認'</b>をクリックしてください。"],["When the same version is available","同じバージョンが利用可能な場合"],["Allow Translator++ to reinstall the same version of Translator++.","Translator++に同じバージョンを再インストールすることを許可します。"],["Allow reinstall the same version","同じバージョンの再インストールを許可"],["Update Settings","更新設定"],["Update Now","今すぐ更新"],["Updater is not available, please update Translator++ manually.","アップデータが利用できません。Translator++を手動で更新してください。"],["Updating Translator++","Translator++を更新中"],["Please don't close Translator++ until the update process is finished.","更新プロセスが完了するまで、Translator++を閉じないでください。"],["Can not update, reason :\n","更新できません。理由：\n"],["You may need to reconnect Translator++ with your Patreon account (logout and login again).","Translator++をPatreonアカウントと再接続する必要があるかもしれません（ログアウトして再ログインしてください）。"],["Also, it has been reported that some countries such as mainland China are blocking dropbox repository.","また、中国本土などの一部の国ではDropboxリポジトリがブロックされていると報告されています。"],["If for some reason you cannot access our repository, please manually download the update package (tpch file) using a proxy or VPN here:","何らかの理由で当社のリポジトリにアクセスできない場合は、プロキシまたはVPNを使用して手動で更新パッケージ（tpchファイル）をここからダウンロードしてください："],["After that, please use the \"Update from package\" feature to update your Translator++.","その後、「パッケージから更新」機能を使用してTranslator++を更新してください。"],["If you still have problems, please contact us at our Discord server : ","問題が解決しない場合は、Discordサーバーでお問い合わせください："],["Restart","再起動"],["Do you want to restart Translator++ now?\nIf you have unsaved work, cancel this dialog and save your work first.","Translator++を今すぐ再起動しますか？\n保存されていない作業がある場合は、このダイアログをキャンセルして作業を保存してください。"],["Check for Update","更新を確認"],["Close","閉じる"]],"context":[["tid/649/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/660/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/665/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/670/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1033/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1077/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1088/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1665/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1670/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1675/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1755/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1765/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1811/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1873/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2021/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2066/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2116/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2130/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2176/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2192/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2206/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2220/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2245/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2259/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2357/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2377/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2449/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2512/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"info.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils/utils","extension":".js","filename":"info.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/utils/info.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"You have ":0," missed update(s)!":1,"Translator++ will update itself if auto-update is enabled.":2,"You can download the latest core version of Translator++ at":3,"This update is available for all patrons.":4,"This update is available for tier $":5," patrons or greater.":6,"You're up-to-date!":7,"Thanks for staying up to date with Translator++! You're on the newest version, and we appreciate your support. Enjoy translating!":8,"Some update information may be shown from cache. You can click <b>'Check for update'</b> to load the latest version details.":9,"When the same version is available":10,"Allow Translator++ to reinstall the same version of Translator++.":11,"Allow reinstall the same version":12,"Update Settings":13,"Update Now":14,"Updater is not available, please update Translator++ manually.":15,"Updating Translator++":16,"Please don't close Translator++ until the update process is finished.":17,"Can not update, reason :\n":18,"You may need to reconnect Translator++ with your Patreon account (logout and login again).":19,"Also, it has been reported that some countries such as mainland China are blocking dropbox repository.":20,"If for some reason you cannot access our repository, please manually download the update package (tpch file) using a proxy or VPN here:":21,"After that, please use the \"Update from package\" feature to update your Translator++.":22,"If you still have problems, please contact us at our Discord server : ":23,"Restart":24,"Do you want to restart Translator++ now?\nIf you have unsaved work, cancel this dialog and save your work first.":25,"Check for Update":26,"Close":27},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/utils/uiTags.js":{"data":[["Do not process row with selected tag (blacklist)","選択したタグの行を処理しない（ブラックリスト）"],["Only process row with selected tag (whitelist)","選択したタグの行のみを処理する（ホワイトリスト）"],["Ignore tag","タグを無視"],["Load last selection","最後の選択を読み込む"],["Reset","リセット"],["Cancel","キャンセル"],["Confirm","確認"]],"context":[["tid/55/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/60/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/65/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/410/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/415/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2085/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2137/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"uiTags.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils/utils","extension":".js","filename":"uiTags.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/utils/uiTags.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Do not process row with selected tag (blacklist)":0,"Only process row with selected tag (whitelist)":1,"Ignore tag":2,"Load last selection":3,"Reset":4,"Cancel":5,"Confirm":6},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/customParser/CustomParserLoader.js":{"data":[["List of the possible character encodings. <b>Order does matter!</b>. Separate each value with a comma.<br />Translator++ will read the original file with the following encodings, patch the files and write with the <b>Write Character encoding</b> option. Leave blank to use the original character encoding when the project is created.","可能な文字エンコーディングのリスト。<b>順序が重要です！</b>各値をカンマで区切ってください。<br />Translator++は以下のエンコーディングで元のファイルを読み取り、ファイルを修正し、<b>書き込み文字エンコーディング</b>オプションで書き込みます。空白のままにすると、プロジェクト作成時の元の文字エンコーディングが使用されます。"],["For BOM support, add a space after the encoding. Example: <code>utf8 bom</code>","BOMサポートの場合は、エンコーディングの後にスペースを追加してください。例：<code>utf8 bom</code>"],["Example: utf8,utf8 bom,utf16le,ascii","例：utf8,utf8 bom,utf16le,ascii"],["Select the target character encoding.","ターゲット文字エンコーディングを選択してください。"]],"context":[["tid/3375/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3383/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3392/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4740/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"CustomParserLoader.js","dirname":"/addons/customParser","extension":".js","filename":"CustomParserLoader.js","path":"/addons/customParser/CustomParserLoader.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"List of the possible character encodings. <b>Order does matter!</b>. Separate each value with a comma.<br />Translator++ will read the original file with the following encodings, patch the files and write with the <b>Write Character encoding</b> option. Leave blank to use the original character encoding when the project is created.":0,"For BOM support, add a space after the encoding. Example: <code>utf8 bom</code>":1,"Example: utf8,utf8 bom,utf16le,ascii":2,"Select the target character encoding.":3},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/customParser/modelEditor/modelEditor.html":{"data":[["<i class=\"icon-edit\"></i>","<i class=\"icon-edit\"></i>"],["<i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">Add a new file group</label>","<i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">新しいファイルグループを追加</label>"],["Add a new file group","新しいファイルグループを追加"],["<i class=\"icon-cancel-circled red\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">Remove current file group</label>","<i class=\"icon-cancel-circled red\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">現在のファイルグループを削除</label>"],["Remove current file group","現在のファイルグループを削除"],["Rules","ルール"],["Hooks","フック"],["Options","オプション"],["Testing","テスト"],["Interpolate the strings before being displayed on the cells. <b>To Grid</b> is antithesis of <b>From Grid</b>","セルに表示される前に文字列を補間します。<b>To Grid</b>は<b>From Grid</b>の対義語です"],["Example","例"],["For example, the text obtained from the parser is as follows:","例えば、パーサーから得られたテキストは以下の通りです："],["In this grid it will look like this:","このグリッドでは次のように表示されます："],["That's not the easiest text to work with.<br>\n  We can fix that by declaring <span class=\"inlineCode\">To Grid hooks</span> as follows:\n","扱いやすいテキストではありません。<br>\n  <span class=\"inlineCode\">To Gridフック</span>を以下のように宣言することで修正できます：\n"],["With the hook above the text in the grid will be :","上記のフックにより、グリッド内のテキストは次のようになります："],["Interpolate the strings from the cells into the translation result. <b>From Grid</b> is antithesis of <b>To Grid</b>.","セルから文字列を補間して翻訳結果に変換します。<b>From Grid</b>は<b>To Grid</b>の対義語です。"],["\n  For example, the expected translated strings should be in JSON format.<br>\n  But writing translation in JSON format is not realy the easiest thing to do. <br>\n  So, instead of asking our translator to translate in JSON format, we can just ask them to type normally, and add a <span class=\"inlineCode\">From Grid hook</span> as follows:\n","\n  例えば、翻訳された文字列はJSON形式であることが期待されます。<br>\n  しかし、JSON形式で翻訳を書くことは実際には最も簡単なことではありません。<br>\n  そこで、翻訳者にJSON形式で翻訳するよう依頼する代わりに、通常通り入力してもらい、以下のように<span class=\"inlineCode\">From Gridフック</span>を追加できます：\n"],["\n  With the <span class=\"inlineCode\">From Grid hook</span> above, the following translation ...\n","\n  上記の<span class=\"inlineCode\">From Gridフック</span>により、以下の翻訳は...\n"],["...will be converted into desired format: ","...希望する形式に変換されます："],["Edit the translated text just before writing it into a file.","ファイルに書き込む直前に翻訳テキストを編集します。"],["Parameters","パラメータ"],["\n              <h3 data-tran=\"\">text</h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The text that is about to be written into a file.</p>\n            ","\n              <h3 data-tran=\"\">テキスト</h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">ファイルに書き込まれる予定のテキスト。</p>\n            "],["text","テキスト"],["The text that is about to be written into a file.","ファイルに書き込まれる予定のテキスト。"],["Return value","戻り値"],["\n              <h3><i>String</i></h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The text that will be written into a file.</p>\n            ","\n              <h3><i>文字列</i></h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">ファイルに書き込まれるテキスト。</p>\n            "],["The text that will be written into a file.","ファイルに書き込まれるテキスト。"],["General","一般"],["Read character encoding","文字エンコーディングを読み取る"],["Force parser to use the following character encoding when reading the file(s).","ファイルを読み取る際に、パーサーが次の文字エンコーディングを使用するように強制します。"],["Write character encoding","文字エンコーディングを書き込む"],["Force parser to use the following character encoding when writing the file(s).","ファイルを書き込む際に、パーサーが次の文字エンコーディングを使用するように強制します。"],["You are editing:","編集中:"],["Please select the mode of your pattern","パターンのモードを選択してください"],["Regular expression Pattern","正規表現パターン"],["A valid ECMA Script's regular expression along with the modifier.<br>You can use <a href=\"https://regex101.com/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"\">regex101.com</a> to create and test your pattern.","有効なECMA Scriptの正規表現と修飾子。<br><a href=\"https://regex101.com/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"\">regex101.com</a>を使用してパターンを作成およびテストできます。"],["Pay attention to the use of carriage return (\\r) in the text to be translated. regex101.com will strip out the carriage returns so your pattern may have a different effect than what you see on regex101. ","翻訳対象のテキストにおけるキャリッジリターン（\\r）の使用に注意してください。regex101.comはキャリッジリターンを除去するため、パターンの効果が異なる場合があります。"],["<strong>About quantifier that captures a zero length string.</strong><br>\n            <i>Null</i> strings will cause problems for the parser. Therefore, instead of using the <strong>*</strong> quantifier which will also capture <i>nulls</i>, it is highly recommended to use the <strong>+</strong> quantifier which will only capture strings if exist.","<strong>ゼロ長文字列をキャプチャする量指定子について。</strong><br>\n            <i>ヌル</i>文字列はパーサーに問題を引き起こします。したがって、<i>ヌル</i>もキャプチャする<strong>*</strong>量指定子の代わりに、文字列が存在する場合のみキャプチャする<strong>+</strong>量指定子の使用を強く推奨します。"],["Translatable Capture groups","翻訳可能なキャプチャグループ"],["Index of the regular expression's groups (Integer) for the translatable texts. Can be more than one. Separate with comma.","翻訳可能なテキストのための正規表現グループのインデックス（整数）。複数指定可能。カンマで区切ります。"],["Row Info Capture group","行情報キャプチャグループ"],["\n            Index of the regular expression's group (Integer) for the row info (e.g. character name). <b>Only one group</b> is allowed. <br>\n            The value of the Row info can be carried over to the child rules and will be overwritten by the child rule's Row info value if exist.\n          ","\n            行情報（例：キャラクター名）のための正規表現グループのインデックス（整数）。<b>グループは1つのみ</b>許可されます。<br>\n            行情報の値は子ルールに引き継がれ、子ルールの行情報値が存在する場合は上書きされます。\n          "],["Context template","コンテキストテンプレート"],["\n            Context is unique identifier for translatable texts. <br>\n            You can use Javascript's template literals to add information to the context.<br>\n            <b>Available variable:</b>\n            <ul>\n              <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">GROUP[<i>n</i>]</span> - Group capture.</li>\n              <!-- <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">RULE_ID</span> - The ID of the rule.</li> -->\n            </ul>\n            <br>\n            <b>Example:</b>\n            <pre>item/${GROUP[2]}</pre>\n          ","\n            コンテキストは翻訳可能テキストの一意の識別子です。<br>\n            JavaScriptのテンプレートリテラルを使用してコンテキストに情報を追加できます。<br>\n            <b>利用可能な変数:</b>\n            <ul>\n              <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">GROUP[<i>n</i>]</span> - グループキャプチャ。</li>\n              <!-- <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">RULE_ID</span> - ルールのID。</li> -->\n            </ul>\n            <br>\n            <b>例:</b>\n            <pre>item/${GROUP[2]}</pre>\n          "],["Action","アクション"],["Capture value","値をキャプチャ"],["Capture then mask value","値をキャプチャしてマスク"],["Mask value","値をマスク"],["Send to inner rule","内部ルールに送信"],["Edit inner rule <i class=\"icon-angle-double-right\"></i>","内部ルールを編集 <i class=\"icon-angle-double-right\"></i>"],["What action the pattern is going to do.","パターンが実行するアクション。"],["Javascript function","JavaScript関数"],["Guide","ガイド"],["\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Arguments</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">The code you write will be inside a function with 2 arguments that can be accessed anywhere in your code:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>\n              <h3>text</h3>\n              <p><b>String</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">A string of the entire content of the file.</p>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <h3>thisModel</h3>\n              <p><b>Object</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The rule object that is currently used by the file.</p>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\"><i>this</i> Keyword</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\"><b>this</b> will reffer to the instance of CustomParser class.</p>\n\n        ","\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">引数</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">記述するコードは、2つの引数を持つ関数内に配置され、コード内のどこからでもアクセスできます:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>\n              <h3>text</h3>\n              <p><b>文字列</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">ファイル全体の内容の文字列。</p>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <h3>thisModel</h3>\n              <p><b>オブジェクト</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">現在ファイルで使用されているルールオブジェクト。</p>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\"><i>this</i> キーワード</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\"><b>this</b> はCustomParserクラスのインスタンスを参照します。</p>\n\n        "],["Arguments","引数"],["The code you write will be inside a function with 2 arguments that can be accessed anywhere in your code:","記述するコードは、2つの引数を持つ関数内に配置され、コード内のどこからでもアクセスできます:"],["A string of the entire content of the file.","ファイル全体の内容の文字列。"],["The rule object that is currently used by the file.","現在ファイルで使用されているルールオブジェクト。"],["<i>this</i> Keyword","<i>this</i> キーワード"],["<b>this</b> will reffer to the instance of CustomParser class.","<b>this</b> はCustomParserクラスのインスタンスを参照します。"],["\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Expected Return Value</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">Your code must <b>return</b> one of the following value:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li><pre>undefined</pre></li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">Offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", // Character name. optional\n    context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"] // Context. optional\n  }\n</pre>\n            </li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">Array of the offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"Another Character\", context: [\"another\", \"context\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"Third Character\", context: [\"third\", \"context\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        ","\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">期待される戻り値</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">コードは以下のいずれかの値を<b>返す</b>必要があります:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li><pre>undefined</pre></li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">キャプチャされたテキストのオフセット、例:\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"キャラクター名\", // キャラクター名。オプション\n    context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"] // コンテキスト。オプション\n  }\n</pre>\n            </li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">キャプチャされたテキストのオフセットの配列、例:\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"キャラクター名\", context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"別のキャラクター\", context: [\"another\", \"context\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"3番目のキャラクター\", context: [\"third\", \"context\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        "],["Expected Return Value","期待される戻り値"],["Your code must <b>return</b> one of the following value:","コードは以下の値のいずれかを<b>返す</b>必要があります："],["Offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", // Character name. optional\n    context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"] // Context. optional\n  }\n</pre>\n            ","キャプチャされたテキストのオフセット、例：\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"キャラクター名\", // キャラクター名。オプション\n    context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"] // コンテキスト。オプション\n  }\n</pre>\n            "],["Array of the offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"Another Character\", context: [\"another\", \"context\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"Third Character\", context: [\"third\", \"context\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            ","キャプチャされたテキストのオフセットの配列、例：\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"キャラクター名\", context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"別のキャラクター\", context: [\"another\", \"context\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"三番目のキャラクター\", context: [\"third\", \"context\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            "],["\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Example</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">The following code is an example to parse srt subtitle.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">\n/*\n  Translator++ is using regexp-match-indices\n  by that all RegExp.exec() method will return their group offset\n  read more about Regular Expression Indices here: https://v8.dev/features/regexp-match-indices\n*/\n\nvar result \t\t\t= [];\nvar captureGroup \t= 1;\nvar regex \t\t\t= /\\d+[\\r\\n]+\\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+ --&gt; \\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+[\\r\\n]+((.+\\r?\\n)+(?=(\\r?\\n)?))/g;\nwhile(null != (matches=regex.exec(text))) {\n  console.log(matches);\n  if (!matches?.indices?.[captureGroup]) continue;\n  result.push({\n    start\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][0],\n    end\t\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][1]\n  })\n}\nreturn result;             \n</code>\n</pre>\n        ","\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">例</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">次のコードは、srt字幕を解析する例です。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">\n/*\n  Translator++はregexp-match-indicesを使用しています\n  これにより、すべてのRegExp.exec()メソッドはグループのオフセットを返します\n  正規表現インデックスの詳細はこちら：https://v8.dev/features/regexp-match-indices\n*/\n\nvar result \t\t\t= [];\nvar captureGroup \t= 1;\nvar regex \t\t\t= /\\d+[\\r\\n]+\\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+ --&gt; \\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+[\\r\\n]+((.+\\r?\\n)+(?=(\\r?\\n)?))/g;\nwhile(null != (matches=regex.exec(text))) {\n  console.log(matches);\n  if (!matches?.indices?.[captureGroup]) continue;\n  result.push({\n    start\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][0],\n    end\t\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][1]\n  })\n}\nreturn result;             \n</code>\n</pre>\n        "],["The following code is an example to parse srt subtitle.","次のコードは、srt字幕を解析する例です。"],["Welcome to the Custom Parser Model Creator","カスタムパーサーモデル作成へようこそ"],["Please start by creating a new File Group.","新しいファイルグループを作成することから始めてください。"],["Please define what kind of file you want to parse by clicking\n      <button class=\"addFileGroup\" onclick=\"addFileGroup(this)\"><i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i>Add a new file group</button> button.\n    ","解析したいファイルの種類を定義するには、\n      <button class=\"addFileGroup\" onclick=\"addFileGroup(this)\"><i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i>新しいファイルグループを追加</button> ボタンをクリックしてください。\n    "],["Press F1 to open the help dialog.","F1キーを押してヘルプダイアログを開きます。"],["New File","新規ファイル"],["Open file","ファイルを開く"],["Save file","ファイルを保存"],["Save As","名前を付けて保存"],["Open debugger (F12)","デバッガーを開く（F12）"],["Help","ヘルプ"],["Edit current file pattern","現在のファイルパターンを編集"],["Add a new file pattern","新しいファイルパターンを追加"],["Remove current file pattern","現在のファイルパターンを削除"],["Rule's order does matter, especially when you use masking! Drag to reorder.","ルールの順序は重要です、特にマスキングを使用する場合！ドラッグして並べ替え。"]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText"],["idx/1/innerText"],["idx/2/innerText"],["idx/3/innerText"],["idx/4/innerText"],["idx/5/innerText"],["idx/6/innerText"],["idx/7/innerText","idx/29/innerText"],["idx/8/innerText"],["idx/9/innerText"],["idx/10/innerText","idx/16/innerText","idx/28/innerText","idx/69/innerText"],["idx/11/innerText"],["idx/12/innerText"],["idx/13/innerText"],["idx/14/innerText"],["idx/15/innerText"],["idx/17/innerText"],["idx/18/innerText"],["idx/19/innerText"],["idx/20/innerText"],["idx/21/innerText"],["idx/22/innerText"],["idx/23/innerText"],["idx/24/innerText"],["idx/25/innerText"],["idx/26/innerText"],["idx/27/innerText"],["idx/30/innerText"],["idx/31/innerText"],["idx/32/innerText"],["idx/33/innerText"],["idx/34/innerText"],["idx/35/innerText"],["idx/36/innerText"],["idx/37/innerText"],["idx/38/innerText"],["idx/39/innerText"],["idx/40/innerText"],["idx/41/innerText"],["idx/42/innerText"],["idx/43/innerText"],["idx/44/innerText"],["idx/45/innerText"],["idx/46/innerText"],["idx/47/innerText"],["idx/48/innerText"],["idx/49/innerText"],["idx/50/innerText"],["idx/51/innerText"],["idx/52/innerText"],["idx/53/innerText"],["idx/54/innerText"],["idx/55/innerText"],["idx/56/innerText"],["idx/57/innerText"],["idx/58/innerText"],["idx/59/innerText"],["idx/60/innerText"],["idx/61/innerText"],["idx/62/innerText"],["idx/63/innerText"],["idx/64/innerText"],["idx/65/innerText"],["idx/66/innerText"],["idx/67/innerText"],["idx/68/innerText"],["idx/70/innerText"],["idx/71/innerText"],["idx/72/innerText"],["idx/73/innerText"],["idx/74/innerText"],["idx/0/attr/title"],["idx/1/attr/title"],["idx/2/attr/title"],["idx/3/attr/title"],["idx/4/attr/title"],["idx/5/attr/title"],["idx/6/attr/title"],["idx/7/attr/title"],["idx/8/attr/title"],["idx/9/attr/title"]],"basename":"modelEditor.html","dirname":"/addons/customParser/modelEditor","extension":".html","filename":"modelEditor.html","path":"/addons/customParser/modelEditor/modelEditor.html","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"<i class=\"icon-edit\"></i>":0,"<i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">Add a new file group</label>":1,"Add a new file group":2,"<i class=\"icon-cancel-circled red\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">Remove current file group</label>":3,"Remove current file group":4,"Rules":5,"Hooks":6,"Options":7,"Testing":8,"Interpolate the strings before being displayed on the cells. <b>To Grid</b> is antithesis of <b>From Grid</b>":9,"Example":10,"For example, the text obtained from the parser is as follows:":11,"In this grid it will look like this:":12,"That's not the easiest text to work with.<br>\n  We can fix that by declaring <span class=\"inlineCode\">To Grid hooks</span> as follows:\n":13,"With the hook above the text in the grid will be :":14,"Interpolate the strings from the cells into the translation result. <b>From Grid</b> is antithesis of <b>To Grid</b>.":15,"\n  For example, the expected translated strings should be in JSON format.<br>\n  But writing translation in JSON format is not realy the easiest thing to do. <br>\n  So, instead of asking our translator to translate in JSON format, we can just ask them to type normally, and add a <span class=\"inlineCode\">From Grid hook</span> as follows:\n":16,"\n  With the <span class=\"inlineCode\">From Grid hook</span> above, the following translation ...\n":17,"...will be converted into desired format: ":18,"Edit the translated text just before writing it into a file.":19,"Parameters":20,"\n              <h3 data-tran=\"\">text</h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The text that is about to be written into a file.</p>\n            ":21,"text":22,"The text that is about to be written into a file.":23,"Return value":24,"\n              <h3><i>String</i></h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The text that will be written into a file.</p>\n            ":25,"The text that will be written into a file.":26,"General":27,"Read character encoding":28,"Force parser to use the following character encoding when reading the file(s).":29,"Write character encoding":30,"Force parser to use the following character encoding when writing the file(s).":31,"You are editing:":32,"Please select the mode of your pattern":33,"Regular expression Pattern":34,"A valid ECMA Script's regular expression along with the modifier.<br>You can use <a href=\"https://regex101.com/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"\">regex101.com</a> to create and test your pattern.":35,"Pay attention to the use of carriage return (\\r) in the text to be translated. regex101.com will strip out the carriage returns so your pattern may have a different effect than what you see on regex101. ":36,"<strong>About quantifier that captures a zero length string.</strong><br>\n            <i>Null</i> strings will cause problems for the parser. Therefore, instead of using the <strong>*</strong> quantifier which will also capture <i>nulls</i>, it is highly recommended to use the <strong>+</strong> quantifier which will only capture strings if exist.":37,"Translatable Capture groups":38,"Index of the regular expression's groups (Integer) for the translatable texts. Can be more than one. Separate with comma.":39,"Row Info Capture group":40,"\n            Index of the regular expression's group (Integer) for the row info (e.g. character name). <b>Only one group</b> is allowed. <br>\n            The value of the Row info can be carried over to the child rules and will be overwritten by the child rule's Row info value if exist.\n          ":41,"Context template":42,"\n            Context is unique identifier for translatable texts. <br>\n            You can use Javascript's template literals to add information to the context.<br>\n            <b>Available variable:</b>\n            <ul>\n              <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">GROUP[<i>n</i>]</span> - Group capture.</li>\n              <!-- <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">RULE_ID</span> - The ID of the rule.</li> -->\n            </ul>\n            <br>\n            <b>Example:</b>\n            <pre>item/${GROUP[2]}</pre>\n          ":43,"Action":44,"Capture value":45,"Capture then mask value":46,"Mask value":47,"Send to inner rule":48,"Edit inner rule <i class=\"icon-angle-double-right\"></i>":49,"What action the pattern is going to do.":50,"Javascript function":51,"Guide":52,"\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Arguments</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">The code you write will be inside a function with 2 arguments that can be accessed anywhere in your code:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>\n              <h3>text</h3>\n              <p><b>String</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">A string of the entire content of the file.</p>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <h3>thisModel</h3>\n              <p><b>Object</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The rule object that is currently used by the file.</p>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\"><i>this</i> Keyword</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\"><b>this</b> will reffer to the instance of CustomParser class.</p>\n\n        ":53,"Arguments":54,"The code you write will be inside a function with 2 arguments that can be accessed anywhere in your code:":55,"A string of the entire content of the file.":56,"The rule object that is currently used by the file.":57,"<i>this</i> Keyword":58,"<b>this</b> will reffer to the instance of CustomParser class.":59,"\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Expected Return Value</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">Your code must <b>return</b> one of the following value:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li><pre>undefined</pre></li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">Offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", // Character name. optional\n    context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"] // Context. optional\n  }\n</pre>\n            </li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">Array of the offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"Another Character\", context: [\"another\", \"context\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"Third Character\", context: [\"third\", \"context\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        ":60,"Expected Return Value":61,"Your code must <b>return</b> one of the following value:":62,"Offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", // Character name. optional\n    context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"] // Context. optional\n  }\n</pre>\n            ":63,"Array of the offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"Another Character\", context: [\"another\", \"context\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"Third Character\", context: [\"third\", \"context\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            ":64,"\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Example</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">The following code is an example to parse srt subtitle.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">\n/*\n  Translator++ is using regexp-match-indices\n  by that all RegExp.exec() method will return their group offset\n  read more about Regular Expression Indices here: https://v8.dev/features/regexp-match-indices\n*/\n\nvar result \t\t\t= [];\nvar captureGroup \t= 1;\nvar regex \t\t\t= /\\d+[\\r\\n]+\\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+ --&gt; \\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+[\\r\\n]+((.+\\r?\\n)+(?=(\\r?\\n)?))/g;\nwhile(null != (matches=regex.exec(text))) {\n  console.log(matches);\n  if (!matches?.indices?.[captureGroup]) continue;\n  result.push({\n    start\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][0],\n    end\t\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][1]\n  })\n}\nreturn result;             \n</code>\n</pre>\n        ":65,"The following code is an example to parse srt subtitle.":66,"Welcome to the Custom Parser Model Creator":67,"Please start by creating a new File Group.":68,"Please define what kind of file you want to parse by clicking\n      <button class=\"addFileGroup\" onclick=\"addFileGroup(this)\"><i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i>Add a new file group</button> button.\n    ":69,"Press F1 to open the help dialog.":70,"New File":71,"Open file":72,"Save file":73,"Save As":74,"Open debugger (F12)":75,"Help":76,"Edit current file pattern":77,"Add a new file pattern":78,"Remove current file pattern":79,"Rule's order does matter, especially when you use masking! Drag to reorder.":80},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/customParser/modelEditor/modelEditor.js":{"data":[["Do you want to close Model editor?\rAll unsaved changes will be discarded.","モデルエディターを閉じますか？\rすべての未保存の変更は破棄されます。"],["Translate here using ","ここで翻訳するには "],["Do you want to discard your changes and open\n","変更を破棄して開きますか？\n"],["Error when trying to open file :","ファイルを開こうとした際のエラー："],["Parser Model Creator","パーサーモデルクリエーター"],["Please specify what kind of file you want to parse.\nYou can use semicolon separated glob pattens. For example: *.txt;*.js;*.json","解析したいファイルの種類を指定してください。\nセミコロン区切りのグロブパターンを使用できます。例：*.txt;*.js;*.json"],["Failed to create new file group. Please check your pattern!","新しいファイルグループの作成に失敗しました。パターンを確認してください！"],["Do you wish to remove current file group?\nYou can not undo this action!","現在のファイルグループを削除しますか？\nこの操作は元に戻せません！"],["Do you want to discard your changes and create a new blank model?","変更を破棄して新しい空白のモデルを作成しますか？"],["Do you want to discard your changes and open a file?","変更を破棄してファイルを開きますか？"],["Clear history","履歴をクリア"],["Open latest file","最新のファイルを開く"],["Open from history","履歴から開く"],["This feature only available if you are using Developer version of Translator++. You can switch into Developer version by using Basic Utilities -> Change Core NWJS.","この機能は、Translator++の開発者バージョンを使用している場合のみ利用可能です。開発者バージョンに切り替えるには、基本ユーティリティ -> コアNWJSの変更を使用してください。"]],"context":[["tid/156/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5647/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9760/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10037/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10099/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10622/type/StringLiteral","tid/10941/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10665/type/StringLiteral","tid/10987/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11026/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11104/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11174/type/StringLiteral","tid/12080/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11459/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11525/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11607/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11750/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"modelEditor.js","dirname":"/addons/customParser/modelEditor","extension":".js","filename":"modelEditor.js","path":"/addons/customParser/modelEditor/modelEditor.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Do you want to close Model editor?\rAll unsaved changes will be discarded.":0,"Translate here using ":1,"Do you want to discard your changes and open\n":2,"Error when trying to open file :":3,"Parser Model Creator":4,"Please specify what kind of file you want to parse.\nYou can use semicolon separated glob pattens. For example: *.txt;*.js;*.json":5,"Failed to create new file group. Please check your pattern!":6,"Do you wish to remove current file group?\nYou can not undo this action!":7,"Do you want to discard your changes and create a new blank model?":8,"Do you want to discard your changes and open a file?":9,"Clear history":10,"Open latest file":11,"Open from history":12,"This feature only available if you are using Developer version of Translator++. You can switch into Developer version by using Basic Utilities -> Change Core NWJS.":13},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/googleCloudV3/trans.googleCloudV3.js":{"data":[["Invalid language string","無効な言語文字列"],["Required field Project ID is blank!","必須フィールドのプロジェクトIDが空白です！"],["Required field Service Account Key is blank!","必須フィールドのサービスアカウントキーが空白です！"],["Required field Server Location is blank!","必須フィールドのサーバー場所が空白です！"],["Required field Location of the glossary file is blank!","必須フィールドの用語集ファイルの場所が空白です！"],["Required field Glossary Languages is blank!","必須フィールドの用語集言語が空白です！"],["Invalid glossary language value","無効な用語集言語の値"],["Currently active glossary on this project: ","このプロジェクトで現在アクティブな用語集: "],["Error when retreiving glossary info: ","用語集情報の取得中にエラーが発生しました: "],["Error when removing glossary : ","用語集の削除中にエラーが発生しました: "],["Glossary removed successfully.","用語集が正常に削除されました。"],["Error when creating glossary : ","用語集の作成中にエラーが発生しました: "],["Glossary created successfully.","用語集が正常に作成されました。"],["Configuration error:\r\n","設定エラー:\r\n"],["No error found!","エラーは見つかりませんでした！"],["Node JS is required to use Google Cloud Translate Advanced. Please download and install it from https://node.js","Google Cloud Translate Advancedを使用するにはNode JSが必要です。https://node.jsからダウンロードしてインストールしてください。"]],"context":[["tid/2012/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3382/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3437/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3499/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3554/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3609/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3640/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3738/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3819/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3903/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3932/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4007/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4036/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4510/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4546/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6155/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"trans.googleCloudV3.js","dirname":"/addons/googleCloudV3","extension":".js","filename":"trans.googleCloudV3.js","path":"/addons/googleCloudV3/trans.googleCloudV3.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Invalid language string":0,"Required field Project ID is blank!":1,"Required field Service Account Key is blank!":2,"Required field Server Location is blank!":3,"Required field Location of the glossary file is blank!":4,"Required field Glossary Languages is blank!":5,"Invalid glossary language value":6,"Currently active glossary on this project: ":7,"Error when retreiving glossary info: ":8,"Error when removing glossary : ":9,"Glossary removed successfully.":10,"Error when creating glossary : ":11,"Glossary created successfully.":12,"Configuration error:\r\n":13,"No error found!":14,"Node JS is required to use Google Cloud Translate Advanced. Please download and install it from https://node.js":15},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/jcap/jcap.js":{"data":[["JCap executable not found at the specified location. Do you want to install JCap?","指定された場所にJCap実行ファイルが見つかりません。JCapをインストールしますか？"],["JCap agent started successfully. Press ","JCapエージェントが正常に起動しました。"],["jcapKey","jcapKey"],["Please set the JCap executable path in the addon settings.","アドオン設定でJCap実行ファイルのパスを設定してください。"],["JCap executable already exists at the specified location.","指定された場所にJCap実行ファイルが既に存在します。"],["JCap executable downloaded successfully.","JCap実行ファイルが正常にダウンロードされました。"],["Failed to download JCap package. Please check the console for details.","JCapパッケージのダウンロードに失敗しました。詳細はコンソールを確認してください。"],["JCap executable unpacked successfully.","JCap実行ファイルが正常に解凍されました。"],["You can now start the JCap agent from the Main Menu - Tools - OCR Tools JCap - Start JCap Agent.","メインメニュー - ツール - OCRツール JCap - JCapエージェントを起動からJCapエージェントを起動できるようになりました。"],["Start JCap OCR Agent","JCap OCRエージェントを起動"],["Failed to unpack JCap package. Please check the console for details.","JCapパッケージの展開に失敗しました。詳細はコンソールを確認してください。"],["JCap executable not found at the specified location.","指定された場所にJCap実行ファイルが見つかりません。"],["Are you sure you want to uninstall JCap? This will delete the JCap executable and its configuration.","JCapをアンインストールしてもよろしいですか？これによりJCap実行ファイルとその設定が削除されます。"],["JCap uninstalled successfully.","JCapのアンインストールが正常に完了しました。"],["Failed to uninstall JCap. Please check the console for details.","JCapのアンインストールに失敗しました。詳細はコンソールを確認してください。"],["Help","ヘルプ"],["JCap OCR is an OCR tool that allows you to capture text from the screen and translate it using JCap. To use it start the JCap by clicking the OCR button on main menu.\nThen press the configured key (default: F9) to capture text.","JCap OCRは、画面からテキストをキャプチャし、JCapを使用して翻訳できるOCRツールです。使用するには、メインメニューのOCRボタンをクリックしてJCapを起動してください。\n次に、設定されたキー（デフォルト：F9）を押してテキストをキャプチャします。"]],"context":[["tid/736/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/854/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/862/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1005/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1038/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1392/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1442/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1554/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1566/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1591/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1647/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1732/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1755/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1828/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1861/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2350/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2371/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"jcap.js","dirname":"/addons/jcap","extension":".js","filename":"jcap.js","path":"/addons/jcap/jcap.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"JCap executable not found at the specified location. Do you want to install JCap?":0,"JCap agent started successfully. Press ":1,"jcapKey":2,"Please set the JCap executable path in the addon settings.":3,"JCap executable already exists at the specified location.":4,"JCap executable downloaded successfully.":5,"Failed to download JCap package. Please check the console for details.":6,"JCap executable unpacked successfully.":7,"You can now start the JCap agent from the Main Menu - Tools - OCR Tools JCap - Start JCap Agent.":8,"Start JCap OCR Agent":9,"Failed to unpack JCap package. Please check the console for details.":10,"JCap executable not found at the specified location.":11,"Are you sure you want to uninstall JCap? This will delete the JCap executable and its configuration.":12,"JCap uninstalled successfully.":13,"Failed to uninstall JCap. Please check the console for details.":14,"Help":15,"JCap OCR is an OCR tool that allows you to capture text from the screen and translate it using JCap. To use it start the JCap by clicking the OCR button on main menu.\nThen press the configured key (default: F9) to capture text.":16},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/jsonParser/json.js":{"data":[["Beautify JSON data","JSONデータを整形"],["When checked the generated data will be beautified.","チェックすると、生成されたデータが整形されます。"],["Start a new translation project from any JSON file.","任意のJSONファイルから新しい翻訳プロジェクトを開始します。"],["Translator++ will translate any translatable texts found in the JSON files.","Translator++は、JSONファイル内で見つかった翻訳可能なテキストをすべて翻訳します。"],["Read the guide on how to start a new JSON translation project here","新しいJSON翻訳プロジェクトの開始方法については、ガイドをお読みください"],["Translator++ will scan through this folder for any JSON files.","Translator++は、このフォルダ内のJSONファイルをスキャンします。"],["How do you want to get the data from the JSON object?","JSONオブジェクトからデータをどのように取得しますか？"],["Parser mode","パーサーモード"],["<h2>Simple Mode</h2><p>In simple mode, you can translate all strings value recursively inside the JSON object.<br />In simple mode, the original texts is always the value.</p>","<h2>シンプルモード</h2><p>シンプルモードでは、JSONオブジェクト内のすべての文字列値を再帰的に翻訳できます。<br />シンプルモードでは、元のテキストは常に値です。</p>"],["<h2>Advanced Mode</h2><p>In advanced mode you can query the JSON and handle key-value paired type translation table where the original text is the key.</p>","<h2>アドバンスドモード</h2><p>アドバンスドモードでは、JSONをクエリし、元のテキストがキーとなるキーと値のペアタイプの翻訳テーブルを処理できます。</p>"],["<h2>Info</h2><p>You can use the following query field to select a specific part of the JSON object. The result of the query must be an object or an array of texts.</p>","<h2>情報</h2><p>以下のクエリフィールドを使用して、JSONオブジェクトの特定の部分を選択できます。クエリの結果は、オブジェクトまたはテキストの配列である必要があります。</p>"],["<h3>For objects</h3><p>The <b>key will be used as the original text</b> and <b>the value as the default translation</b>.</p>","<h3>オブジェクトの場合</h3><p><b>キーは元のテキストとして使用され</b>、<b>値はデフォルトの翻訳として使用されます</b>。</p>"],["Parser will automatically register if the value is a string, null, or undefined.<br />","値が文字列、null、またはundefinedの場合、パーサーは自動的に登録します。<br />"],["<h3>For arrays</h3><p>The parser will register all string values in the array as translatable texts.</p>","<h3>配列の場合</h3><p>パーサーは配列内のすべての文字列値を翻訳可能なテキストとして登録します。</p>"],["Start project","プロジェクト開始"],["`Invalid destination directory:\\n${","`無効な宛先ディレクトリ:\\n${"],["}`","}`"]],"context":[["tid/92/type/StringLiteral","tid/119/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/102/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2826/type/StringLiteral","tid/2879/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2831/type/StringLiteral","tid/2884/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2836/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2998/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3038/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3214/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3293/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3346/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3446/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3451/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3456/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3461/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3615/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4070/type/TemplateHead"],["tid/4072/type/TemplateTail"]],"basename":"json.js","dirname":"/addons/jsonParser","extension":".js","filename":"json.js","path":"/addons/jsonParser/json.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Beautify JSON data":0,"When checked the generated data will be beautified.":1,"Start a new translation project from any JSON file.":2,"Translator++ will translate any translatable texts found in the JSON files.":3,"Read the guide on how to start a new JSON translation project here":4,"Translator++ will scan through this folder for any JSON files.":5,"How do you want to get the data from the JSON object?":6,"Parser mode":7,"<h2>Simple Mode</h2><p>In simple mode, you can translate all strings value recursively inside the JSON object.<br />In simple mode, the original texts is always the value.</p>":8,"<h2>Advanced Mode</h2><p>In advanced mode you can query the JSON and handle key-value paired type translation table where the original text is the key.</p>":9,"<h2>Info</h2><p>You can use the following query field to select a specific part of the JSON object. The result of the query must be an object or an array of texts.</p>":10,"<h3>For objects</h3><p>The <b>key will be used as the original text</b> and <b>the value as the default translation</b>.</p>":11,"Parser will automatically register if the value is a string, null, or undefined.<br />":12,"<h3>For arrays</h3><p>The parser will register all string values in the array as translatable texts.</p>":13,"Start project":14,"`Invalid destination directory:\\n${":15,"}`":16},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/kagParser/TyranoParser.js":{"data":[["label","ラベル"],["is duplicated in the same scenario file","同じシナリオファイル内で重複しています"]],"context":[["tid/2372/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2390/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"TyranoParser.js","dirname":"/addons/kagParser","extension":".js","filename":"TyranoParser.js","path":"/addons/kagParser/TyranoParser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"label":0,"is duplicated in the same scenario file":1},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/kagParser/kagParser.js":{"data":[["Select directory","ディレクトリ選択"],["Select a directory to repack","再パックするディレクトリを選択"],["Target xp3","ターゲット xp3"],["Select filename. Special filename such as <b>patch.xp3</b>, <b>patch2.xp3</b>...etc get priority over data.xp3 when loaded.","ファイル名を選択。特別なファイル名（例: <b>patch.xp3</b>、<b>patch2.xp3</b>...など）は読み込み時にdata.xp3よりも優先されます。"],["Patch to allow folder structure","フォルダ構造を許可するパッチ"],["By default KAG engine do not read files inside a folder within xp3 files. This option will automatically add folder structure definition to Config.tjs. Has no effect if no Config.tjs file is found.","デフォルトでは、KAGエンジンはxp3ファイル内のフォルダ内のファイルを読み取りません。このオプションは、Config.tjsにフォルダ構造定義を自動的に追加します。Config.tjsファイルが見つからない場合は効果がありません。"],["Repack into xp3","xp3に再パック"],["Close","閉じる"],["Process","処理"],["<b>Order does matter</b> if you unpack multiple files at once! The files will be unpacked in ordered manner. If the files exist it will be overwritten.","<b>順序は重要です</b>複数のファイルを一度に解凍する場合！ファイルは順番に解凍されます。ファイルが存在する場合は上書きされます。"],["Unpack XP3 files","XP3ファイルを解凍"],["Repack a folder to xp3","フォルダをxp3に再パック"],["Unpack xp3 file","xp3ファイルを解凍"],["Before you create a new project, please make sure that :","新しいプロジェクトを作成する前に、以下を確認してください："],["All .ks & .tjs files are in plain text (uncompiled, unscrambled, and unencrypted)","すべての .ks および .tjs ファイルはプレーンテキスト（未コンパイル、スクランブルなし、暗号化なし）です"],["KAG Games should be playable even without being repacked. So you should check whether your game is playable or not after being extracted.","KAG ゲームは再パックしなくてもプレイ可能であるべきです。そのため、抽出後にゲームがプレイ可能かどうかを確認してください。"],["Some of the actions will modify your game. <b>So make sure to create a backup of your game!</b>","一部の操作はゲームを変更します。<b>必ずゲームのバックアップを作成してください！</b>"],["Select the game executable file. This file is the main game file that will be used to extract the game data.","ゲームの実行ファイルを選択してください。このファイルはゲームデータを抽出するために使用されるメインのゲームファイルです。"],["Translator++ can extract XP3 files with AEC addon. <b>But the extractor is not a surefire solution for all kind XP3</b>.","Translator++ は AEC アドオンで XP3 ファイルを抽出できます。<b>ただし、抽出器はすべての種類の XP3 に対する確実な解決策ではありません</b>。"],["Some scenario files are encrypted. Check this option if you wish Translator++ to try to decrypt them.","一部のシナリオファイルは暗号化されています。Translator++ に復号を試みさせたい場合は、このオプションをチェックしてください。"],["This may not work on some projects.","これは一部のプロジェクトでは機能しない可能性があります。"],["List of the possible character encodings. <b>Order does matter!</b>. You can drag to sort the list.","可能な文字エンコーディングのリストです。<b>順序が重要です！</b>。リストをドラッグして並べ替えることができます。"],["Literal tags are the tags that will be escaped into Translator++ editor.","リテラルタグは、Translator++ エディタでエスケープされるタグです。"],["<b>ruby l r</b> are mandatory.","<b>ruby l r</b> は必須です。"],["<b>[r]</b> Tags will be interpolated by Translator++ into a new line. So you don't need to write <b>[r]</b> explicitly.","<b>[r]</b> タグは Translator++ によって新しい行に補間されます。そのため、<b>[r]</b> を明示的に書く必要はありません。"],["Kirikiri script (.ks) is heavily customizable and allows developers to create their own tags.","Kirikiri スクリプト (.ks) は高度にカスタマイズ可能で、開発者が独自のタグを作成できます。"],["Translator++ can handle standard tags such as character names that start with a sharp (#).","Translator++ は、シャープ (#) で始まるキャラクター名などの標準タグを処理できます。"],["However, Translator++ cannot handle custom tags created by developers.","ただし、Translator++ は開発者が作成したカスタムタグを処理できません。"],["Therefore, you may need to define the tags and attributes that need to be translated and those that need to be marked as actor names.","そのため、翻訳が必要なタグと属性、およびアクター名としてマークする必要があるものを定義する必要があるかもしれません。"],["You might need to <input type=\"button\" value=\"extract your xp3 game\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.kagParser.utils.unpackXP3Dialog()\" /> and analyze the ks script inside it before starting the project.","プロジェクトを開始する前に、<input type=\"button\" value=\"xp3 ゲームを抽出\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.kagParser.utils.unpackXP3Dialog()\" /> して、その中の ks スクリプトを分析する必要があるかもしれません。"],["Create Project","プロジェクトを作成"],["Pack a folder into xp3","フォルダを xp3 にパック"],["Select the target character encoding.<br />Most Japanese KAG games are written with SHIFT-JIS, but KAG actually has support for UTF16LE unicode. Many translators set the character encoding to UTF16LE so that the game is playable non-Japanese windows without locale emulator. And most importantly, can displays characters outside SHIFT-JIS such as \"café\".<br />By default Translator++ will write to its original character encoding.","ターゲットの文字エンコーディングを選択してください。<br />ほとんどの日本語 KAG ゲームは SHIFT-JIS で書かれていますが、KAG は実際に UTF16LE ユニコードをサポートしています。多くの翻訳者は、ロケールエミュレータなしで非日本語 Windows でゲームがプレイ可能であり、最も重要なことに、「café」などの SHIFT-JIS 外の文字を表示できるように、文字エンコーディングを UTF16LE に設定します。<br />デフォルトでは、Translator++ は元の文字エンコーディングに書き込みます。"],["There are several ways to produce playable localized game for KAG. Please select one that suit your preference.","KAG のローカライズされたプレイ可能ゲームを生成する方法はいくつかあります。ご希望に合ったものを選択してください。"]],"context":[["tid/2913/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2918/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2925/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2930/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2937/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2942/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3173/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3274/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3325/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3558/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3684/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3872/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3929/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4297/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4302/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4307/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4312/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4468/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4508/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4542/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4549/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4583/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4631/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4640/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4649/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5046/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5053/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5060/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5067/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5078/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5389/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6942/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7218/type/StringLiteral","tid/7397/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7462/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"kagParser.js","dirname":"/addons/kagParser","extension":".js","filename":"kagParser.js","path":"/addons/kagParser/kagParser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Select directory":0,"Select a directory to repack":1,"Target xp3":2,"Select filename. Special filename such as <b>patch.xp3</b>, <b>patch2.xp3</b>...etc get priority over data.xp3 when loaded.":3,"Patch to allow folder structure":4,"By default KAG engine do not read files inside a folder within xp3 files. This option will automatically add folder structure definition to Config.tjs. Has no effect if no Config.tjs file is found.":5,"Repack into xp3":6,"Close":7,"Process":8,"<b>Order does matter</b> if you unpack multiple files at once! The files will be unpacked in ordered manner. If the files exist it will be overwritten.":9,"Unpack XP3 files":10,"Repack a folder to xp3":11,"Unpack xp3 file":12,"Before you create a new project, please make sure that :":13,"All .ks & .tjs files are in plain text (uncompiled, unscrambled, and unencrypted)":14,"KAG Games should be playable even without being repacked. So you should check whether your game is playable or not after being extracted.":15,"Some of the actions will modify your game. <b>So make sure to create a backup of your game!</b>":16,"Select the game executable file. This file is the main game file that will be used to extract the game data.":17,"Translator++ can extract XP3 files with AEC addon. <b>But the extractor is not a surefire solution for all kind XP3</b>.":18,"Some scenario files are encrypted. Check this option if you wish Translator++ to try to decrypt them.":19,"This may not work on some projects.":20,"List of the possible character encodings. <b>Order does matter!</b>. You can drag to sort the list.":21,"Literal tags are the tags that will be escaped into Translator++ editor.":22,"<b>ruby l r</b> are mandatory.":23,"<b>[r]</b> Tags will be interpolated by Translator++ into a new line. So you don't need to write <b>[r]</b> explicitly.":24,"Kirikiri script (.ks) is heavily customizable and allows developers to create their own tags.":25,"Translator++ can handle standard tags such as character names that start with a sharp (#).":26,"However, Translator++ cannot handle custom tags created by developers.":27,"Therefore, you may need to define the tags and attributes that need to be translated and those that need to be marked as actor names.":28,"You might need to <input type=\"button\" value=\"extract your xp3 game\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.kagParser.utils.unpackXP3Dialog()\" /> and analyze the ks script inside it before starting the project.":29,"Create Project":30,"Pack a folder into xp3":31,"Select the target character encoding.<br />Most Japanese KAG games are written with SHIFT-JIS, but KAG actually has support for UTF16LE unicode. Many translators set the character encoding to UTF16LE so that the game is playable non-Japanese windows without locale emulator. And most importantly, can displays characters outside SHIFT-JIS such as \"café\".<br />By default Translator++ will write to its original character encoding.":32,"There are several ways to produce playable localized game for KAG. Please select one that suit your preference.":33},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/po/ExportImport.js":{"data":[["Select mode","モードを選択"],["Select how do you want to start your project. By selecting files or folders.","プロジェクトをどのように開始するかを選択します。ファイルまたはフォルダを選択します。"],["Select Folder","フォルダを選択"],["Select the folder for processing. Translator++ will recursively retrieve the PO files from the specified folder.","処理するフォルダを選択します。Translator++は指定されたフォルダからPOファイルを再帰的に取得します。"],["Select File","ファイルを選択"],["Select the files you want to process.","処理したいファイルを選択します。"],["Filters","フィルター"],["Filter the file name with glob pattern. Default is <code>**/*.{po,mo}</code>","ファイル名をグロブパターンでフィルタリングします。デフォルトは<code>**/*.{po,mo}</code>です。"],["All .po files in the selected folder and its subfolders.","選択したフォルダとそのサブフォルダ内のすべての.poファイル。"],["All .mo files in the selected folder and its subfolders.","選択したフォルダとそのサブフォルダ内のすべての.moファイル。"],["PO Files","POファイル"],["MO Files","MOファイル"],["You are about to export the translations as MO files.\n","翻訳をMOファイルとしてエクスポートしようとしています。\n"],["- MO files are binary files that cannot be edited manually.\n","- MOファイルはバイナリファイルで、手動で編集できません。\n"],["- Only translated entries are stored in MO files.\n","- MOファイルには翻訳済みのエントリのみが保存されます。\n"],["Are you sure you want to proceed?","続行してもよろしいですか？"],["PO / MO Files","PO / MOファイル"]],"context":[["tid/1174/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1196/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1223/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1233/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1267/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1277/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1317/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1327/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1335/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1340/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2342/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2509/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2534/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2542/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2550/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2558/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2747/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"ExportImport.js","dirname":"/addons/po","extension":".js","filename":"ExportImport.js","path":"/addons/po/ExportImport.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Select mode":0,"Select how do you want to start your project. By selecting files or folders.":1,"Select Folder":2,"Select the folder for processing. Translator++ will recursively retrieve the PO files from the specified folder.":3,"Select File":4,"Select the files you want to process.":5,"Filters":6,"Filter the file name with glob pattern. Default is <code>**/*.{po,mo}</code>":7,"All .po files in the selected folder and its subfolders.":8,"All .mo files in the selected folder and its subfolders.":9,"PO Files":10,"MO Files":11,"You are about to export the translations as MO files.\n":12,"- MO files are binary files that cannot be edited manually.\n":13,"- Only translated entries are stored in MO files.\n":14,"Are you sure you want to proceed?":15,"PO / MO Files":16},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/po/PoParser.js":{"data":[[".po and .mo files are standard text-based and binary file formats used together for software localization, particularly in WordPress, to translate themes and plugins. The PO (Portable Object) file is human-readable text containing translations, while the MO (Machine Object) file is a compiled, machine-readable binary file used by software for faster loading.",".poファイルと.moファイルは、ソフトウェアのローカライゼーション、特にWordPressのテーマやプラグインの翻訳に使用される標準的なテキストベースおよびバイナリファイル形式です。PO（Portable Object）ファイルは翻訳を含む人間が読めるテキストであり、MO（Machine Object）ファイルはソフトウェアが高速に読み込むために使用されるコンパイルされた機械可読バイナリファイルです。"],["Start translation from PO (Portable Object) and MO (Machine Object) translation scripts","PO（Portable Object）およびMO（Machine Object）翻訳スクリプトから翻訳を開始"],["Create Project","プロジェクトを作成"],["Select mode","モードを選択"],["Select how do you want to start your project. By selecting files or folders.","プロジェクトをどのように開始するかを選択します。ファイルまたはフォルダを選択します。"],["Select Folder","フォルダを選択"],["Select the folder for processing. Translator++ will recursively retrieve the PO files from the specified folder.","処理するフォルダを選択します。Translator++は指定されたフォルダからPOファイルを再帰的に取得します。"],["Select File","ファイルを選択"],["Select the files you want to process.","処理したいファイルを選択します。"],["Filters","フィルター"],["Filter the file name with glob pattern. Default is <code>**/*.{po,mo}</code>","ファイル名をグロブパターンでフィルタリングします。デフォルトは<code>**/*.{po,mo}</code>です。"],["All .po files in the selected folder and its subfolders.","選択したフォルダとそのサブフォルダ内のすべての.poファイル。"],["All .mo files in the selected folder and its subfolders.","選択したフォルダとそのサブフォルダ内のすべての.moファイル。"],["ProjectTitle","プロジェクトタイトル"],["Your project title","プロジェクトのタイトル"]],"context":[["tid/907/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/951/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1028/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1488/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1510/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1537/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1547/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1580/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1590/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1623/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1633/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1641/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1646/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1681/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1691/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"PoParser.js","dirname":"/addons/po","extension":".js","filename":"PoParser.js","path":"/addons/po/PoParser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{".po and .mo files are standard text-based and binary file formats used together for software localization, particularly in WordPress, to translate themes and plugins. The PO (Portable Object) file is human-readable text containing translations, while the MO (Machine Object) file is a compiled, machine-readable binary file used by software for faster loading.":0,"Start translation from PO (Portable Object) and MO (Machine Object) translation scripts":1,"Create Project":2,"Select mode":3,"Select how do you want to start your project. By selecting files or folders.":4,"Select Folder":5,"Select the folder for processing. Translator++ will recursively retrieve the PO files from the specified folder.":6,"Select File":7,"Select the files you want to process.":8,"Filters":9,"Filter the file name with glob pattern. Default is <code>**/*.{po,mo}</code>":10,"All .po files in the selected folder and its subfolders.":11,"All .mo files in the selected folder and its subfolders.":12,"ProjectTitle":13,"Your project title":14},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/pylivemakerParser/plmUtils.js":{"data":[["Livemaker Game Extractor","Livemaker ゲーム抽出ツール"],["Half width character patch","半角文字パッチ"],["Patch half-width character","半角文字をパッチ"]],"context":[["tid/347/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/809/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate","tid/870/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1061/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"plmUtils.js","dirname":"/addons/pylivemakerParser","extension":".js","filename":"plmUtils.js","path":"/addons/pylivemakerParser/plmUtils.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Livemaker Game Extractor":0,"Half width character patch":1,"Patch half-width character":2},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/pylivemakerParser/pylivemakerparser.js":{"data":[["Livemaker engine has limitations regarding language support. It requires setting the Windows non-unicode system locale to Japanese to run LiveMaker and LiveNovel applications. Additionally, the engine is hardcoded to only use installed Windows system fonts that support Windows Shift-JIS (MS CP932), which means it may not supports other locales or encodings","Livemakerエンジンには言語サポートに関する制限があります。LiveMakerおよびLiveNovelアプリケーションを実行するには、Windowsの非Unicodeシステムロケールを日本語に設定する必要があります。さらに、エンジンはWindows Shift-JIS（MS CP932）をサポートするインストール済みのWindowsシステムフォントのみを使用するようにハードコードされているため、他のロケールやエンコーディングをサポートしない場合があります。"],["Next","次へ"],["Unable to detect RPG Maker type!\nAre you sure the game is RPG Maker XP, VX or VX Ace?","RPG Makerのタイプを検出できません！\nゲームがRPG Maker XP、VX、またはVX Aceであることを確認していますか？"],["Create a new project","新しいプロジェクトを作成"],["Invalid destination file:","無効な宛先ファイル："],[" doesn't seems to be a LiveMaker game.","LiveMakerゲームではないようです。"]],"context":[["tid/5574/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/5684/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6243/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6541/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6626/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/6662/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"]],"basename":"pylivemakerparser.js","dirname":"/addons/pylivemakerParser","extension":".js","filename":"pylivemakerparser.js","path":"/addons/pylivemakerParser/pylivemakerparser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Livemaker engine has limitations regarding language support. It requires setting the Windows non-unicode system locale to Japanese to run LiveMaker and LiveNovel applications. Additionally, the engine is hardcoded to only use installed Windows system fonts that support Windows Shift-JIS (MS CP932), which means it may not supports other locales or encodings":0,"Next":1,"Unable to detect RPG Maker type!\nAre you sure the game is RPG Maker XP, VX or VX Ace?":2,"Create a new project":3,"Invalid destination file:":4," doesn't seems to be a LiveMaker game.":5},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/renParser/renParser.js":{"data":[["Dev path is not defined.\nYou should inject your game once to generate dev path.","開発パスが定義されていません。\n開発パスを生成するには、ゲームを一度インジェクトしてください。"],["Decompile all rpyc files","すべてのrpycファイルを逆コンパイル"],["Attempt to decompile all rpyc files into .rpy.<br />Translator++ has its own decompiler. But it is reported that sometimes it fails to decompile some of the games created with Renpy 7. You can leave this field unchecked and decompile the game yourself with your own tools before starting a project.","すべてのrpycファイルを.rpyに逆コンパイルしようとします。<br />Translator++には独自の逆コンパイラがありますが、Renpy 7で作成された一部のゲームでは逆コンパイルに失敗することが報告されています。このチェックボックスをオフにして、プロジェクトを開始する前に独自のツールでゲームを逆コンパイルすることもできます。"],["Overwrite rpy","rpyを上書き"],["If checked then the decompiler <b>will overwrite the existing uncompiled rpy files</b>.","チェックすると、逆コンパイラは<b>既存の非コンパイル済みrpyファイルを上書きします</b>。"],["Exclude command","コマンドを除外"],["This option will allow us to skip some command for being processed and translated","このオプションにより、処理や翻訳から一部のコマンドをスキップできます"],["Separate entries with a space","エントリをスペースで区切る"],["For example, if you put <b>old</b> then all lines in rpy that started with <b>old</b> will be ignored","例えば、<b>old</b>と入力すると、rpy内で<b>old</b>で始まるすべての行が無視されます"],["Are you sure want to start a project without decompiling the rpyc files?","rpycファイルを逆コンパイルせずにプロジェクトを開始してもよろしいですか？"],["The file you're selected is not a Ren'Py game executable file.\nDo you want to continue anyway?","選択したファイルはRen'Pyゲームの実行ファイルではありません。\nそれでも続行しますか？"],["Play last build","最後のビルドを再生"],["Open Ren'Py documentation","Ren'Pyドキュメントを開く"],["The option has been set to use the legacy parser.\nYou can switch back to the new parser anytime via option menu.","レガシーパーサーを使用するように設定されました。\nオプションメニューからいつでも新しいパーサーに切り替えられます。"]],"context":[["tid/6255/type/StringLiteral","tid/11918/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10916/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10921/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10926/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10931/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10936/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10941/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10946/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10951/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11291/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11456/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11869/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11970/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/12146/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"renParser.js","dirname":"/addons/renParser","extension":".js","filename":"renParser.js","path":"/addons/renParser/renParser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Dev path is not defined.\nYou should inject your game once to generate dev path.":0,"Decompile all rpyc files":1,"Attempt to decompile all rpyc files into .rpy.<br />Translator++ has its own decompiler. But it is reported that sometimes it fails to decompile some of the games created with Renpy 7. You can leave this field unchecked and decompile the game yourself with your own tools before starting a project.":2,"Overwrite rpy":3,"If checked then the decompiler <b>will overwrite the existing uncompiled rpy files</b>.":4,"Exclude command":5,"This option will allow us to skip some command for being processed and translated":6,"Separate entries with a space":7,"For example, if you put <b>old</b> then all lines in rpy that started with <b>old</b> will be ignored":8,"Are you sure want to start a project without decompiling the rpyc files?":9,"The file you're selected is not a Ren'Py game executable file.\nDo you want to continue anyway?":10,"Play last build":11,"Open Ren'Py documentation":12,"The option has been set to use the legacy parser.\nYou can switch back to the new parser anytime via option menu.":13},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/resourceParser/ResourceParser.js":{"data":[["Windows binary file translator","Windowsバイナリファイル翻訳者"],["Parsing Windows binary file with","Windowsバイナリファイルを解析中"],["Sellect supported files","サポートファイルを選択"],["Select supported file type to translate.","翻訳するサポートファイルタイプを選択してください。"],["Create a new project","新しいプロジェクトを作成"],["Please select a supported file to parse","解析するサポートファイルを選択してください"],["Please enter your project title!","プロジェクトタイトルを入力してください！"]],"context":[["tid/4109/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4114/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4127/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4132/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4469/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4550/type/StringLiteral","tid/4600/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4661/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"ResourceParser.js","dirname":"/addons/resourceParser","extension":".js","filename":"ResourceParser.js","path":"/addons/resourceParser/ResourceParser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Windows binary file translator":0,"Parsing Windows binary file with":1,"Sellect supported files":2,"Select supported file type to translate.":3,"Create a new project":4,"Please select a supported file to parse":5,"Please enter your project title!":6},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rm2k2k3/2k.js":{"data":[["Use Native RPG Player","ネイティブ RPG プレイヤーを使用"],["Use native RPG Player instead of Easy RPG Player","Easy RPG プレイヤーの代わりにネイティブ RPG プレイヤーを使用"],["Use native RPG Player","ネイティブ RPG プレイヤーを使用"],["Target folder","ターゲットフォルダ"],["Select destination folder.","保存先フォルダを選択してください。"],["Install Easy RPG Player","Easy RPG プレイヤーをインストール"],["Close","閉じる"],["Install","インストール"],["Process completed!","処理が完了しました！"],["RPG Maker 2000 & 2003 Parser with xmlTrans plugin.","xmlTrans プラグイン付き RPG Maker 2000 & 2003 パーサー。"],["Play last build","最後のビルドを再生"],["Apply translation then play","翻訳を適用して再生"],["Setup Easy RPG in the current directory","現在のディレクトリに Easy RPG をセットアップ"]],"context":[["tid/164/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/174/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/184/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5955/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5960/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6034/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6151/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6202/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6393/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7198/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/8288/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8344/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8395/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"2k.js","dirname":"/addons/rm2k2k3","extension":".js","filename":"2k.js","path":"/addons/rm2k2k3/2k.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Use Native RPG Player":0,"Use native RPG Player instead of Easy RPG Player":1,"Use native RPG Player":2,"Target folder":3,"Select destination folder.":4,"Install Easy RPG Player":5,"Close":6,"Install":7,"Process completed!":8,"RPG Maker 2000 & 2003 Parser with xmlTrans plugin.":9,"Play last build":10,"Apply translation then play":11,"Setup Easy RPG in the current directory":12},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rm2k2k3/2knew.js":{"data":[["Start translation from RM2k / RM2k3 engine","RM2k / RM2k3 エンジンから翻訳を開始"],["Create project","プロジェクトを作成"],["Please select RPG Maker 2000/2003 game!","RPG Maker 2000/2003 ゲームを選択してください！"],["Unable to detect RPG Maker type!\nAre you sure the game is RPG Maker 2000 / 2003?","RPG Maker のタイプを検出できません！\nゲームが RPG Maker 2000 / 2003 であることを確認してください。"]],"context":[["tid/3902/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3971/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4041/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4450/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"2knew.js","dirname":"/addons/rm2k2k3","extension":".js","filename":"2knew.js","path":"/addons/rm2k2k3/2knew.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Start translation from RM2k / RM2k3 engine":0,"Create project":1,"Please select RPG Maker 2000/2003 game!":2,"Unable to detect RPG Maker type!\nAre you sure the game is RPG Maker 2000 / 2003?":3},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rm2k2k3/utils.js":{"data":[["Target folder","ターゲットフォルダ"],["Select destination folder.","保存先フォルダを選択"],["Install Easy RPG Player","Easy RPG Playerをインストール"],["Close","閉じる"],["Install","インストール"],["How to add a custom font.\n\nThe fonts must be placed in the Font folder of the game directory and must be named Font.ttf or Font2.ttf. Which font file is used depends on the system graphic font setting. Besides ttf, fon and many other fonts are supported (anything supported by FreeType, the best open source library available for font rendering).\n\nSource: https://blog.easyrpg.org/2023/04/easyrpg-player-0-8-paralyze/","カスタムフォントの追加方法。\n\nフォントはゲームディレクトリのFontフォルダに配置し、Font.ttfまたはFont2.ttfという名前にする必要があります。使用されるフォントファイルは、システムのグラフィックフォント設定に依存します。ttf以外にも、fonやその他多くのフォントがサポートされています（FreeType、利用可能な最高のオープンソースフォントレンダリングライブラリでサポートされているものすべて）。\n\n出典: https://blog.easyrpg.org/2023/04/easyrpg-player-0-8-paralyze/"],["Process completed!","処理完了！"],["Play last build","最後のビルドをプレイ"],["Apply translation then play","翻訳を適用してプレイ"],["Setup Easy RPG in the current directory","現在のディレクトリにEasy RPGをセットアップ"]],"context":[["tid/934/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/939/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1013/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1130/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1181/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1402/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1450/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1685/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1743/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1796/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"utils.js","dirname":"/addons/rm2k2k3","extension":".js","filename":"utils.js","path":"/addons/rm2k2k3/utils.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Target folder":0,"Select destination folder.":1,"Install Easy RPG Player":2,"Close":3,"Install":4,"How to add a custom font.\n\nThe fonts must be placed in the Font folder of the game directory and must be named Font.ttf or Font2.ttf. Which font file is used depends on the system graphic font setting. Besides ttf, fon and many other fonts are supported (anything supported by FreeType, the best open source library available for font rendering).\n\nSource: https://blog.easyrpg.org/2023/04/easyrpg-player-0-8-paralyze/":5,"Process completed!":6,"Play last build":7,"Apply translation then play":8,"Setup Easy RPG in the current directory":9},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rmmv/rmmv.js":{"data":[["Beautify JSON data","JSONデータを整形"],["When checked the generated data will be beautified.","チェックすると、生成されたデータが整形されます。"],["Error loading system.json","system.jsonの読み込みエラー"],["Loading","読み込み中"],["index.html not found in","${dat[n]}にindex.htmlが見つかりません"],["Encrypted game","暗号化されたゲーム"],["Select the index.html of your encrypted game.","暗号化されたゲームのindex.htmlを選択"],["Target folder","ターゲットフォルダ"],["Select destination folder. The process will replace the existing files.","保存先フォルダを選択。処理により既存ファイルが置き換えられます。"],["Decrypt Resources","リソースを復号"],["Close","閉じる"],["Process","処理"],["Source path can not empty","ソースパスは空にできません"],["Destination path can not empty","宛先パスは空にできません"],["Path is not a file:","パスはファイルではありません:"],["Invalid directory:","無効なディレクトリ:"],["Extract enigma","エニグマを抽出"],["Select enigma file.","エニグマファイルを選択してください。"],["Extract Enigma","エニグマを抽出"],["Selected file is not an Enigma Virtual Box package.","選択されたファイルはエニグマバーチャルボックスパッケージではありません。"],["Plugins are already fetched for this project. Want to re-fetch the plugins?","このプロジェクトのプラグインは既に取得されています。プラグインを再取得しますか？"],["Translate Javascript File?","JavaScriptファイルを翻訳しますか？"],["Cancel","キャンセル"],["I know the risk, Proceed!","リスクを理解しています、進めてください！"],["Game Executable Path","ゲーム実行ファイルパス"],["Path to the game executable file (.exe)","ゲーム実行ファイル（.exe）へのパス"],["NWJS Version","NWJSバージョン"],["Change into this NWJS version","このNWJSバージョンに変更"],["Use Developer version","開発者バージョンを使用"],["Use the NWJS Developer version. The Developer version has developer tools available. Suitable for debugging and development.","NWJS開発者バージョンを使用します。開発者バージョンには開発者ツールが利用可能です。デバッグや開発に適しています。"],["In Developer version you can use <b>Developer Console</b>. Developer Console can be accessed by pressing F12 or right-clicking the app and selecting 'Inspect'.","開発者バージョンでは<b>開発者コンソール</b>を使用できます。開発者コンソールはF12を押すか、アプリを右クリックして「検査」を選択することでアクセスできます。"],["Use 32-bit version","32ビット版を使用"],["Use the 32-bit version of NWJS. The 32-bit version is useful for compatibility with older systems. It is recommended to uncheck this option if possible (just upgrade your machine, dude).","NWJSの32ビット版を使用します。32ビット版は古いシステムとの互換性に役立ちます。可能であればこのオプションをオフにすることをお勧めします（マシンをアップグレードしてくださいね）。"],["Some game feature may not work across NWJS version","一部のゲーム機能はNWJSバージョン間で動作しない可能性があります"],["Please be aware that some game feature may not work across NWJS version.","一部のゲーム機能はNWJSバージョン間で動作しない可能性があることにご注意ください。"],["Change RPG Maker MV / RPG Maker MZ / NWJS version","RPG Maker MV / RPG Maker MZ / NWJSバージョンを変更"],["This operation will change the NW.js version into","この操作によりNW.jsバージョンが変更されます"],["Please close the application first before continuing.\nDo you want to continue?","続行する前にアプリケーションを閉じてください。\n続行しますか？"],["The selected file is not a valid NW.js application.","選択したファイルは有効なNW.jsアプリケーションではありません。"],["Could not find index.html in the game directory.","ゲームディレクトリにindex.htmlが見つかりませんでした。"],["Debug menu script not found in addon directory.","アドオンディレクトリにデバッグメニュースクリプトが見つかりませんでした。"],["Debug menu script is already installed in index.html.","デバッグメニュースクリプトは既にindex.htmlにインストールされています。"],["Debug options installed successfully!","デバッグオプションが正常にインストールされました！"],["The selected game is not running in NW.js Developer Mode (SDK).\n\n","選択したゲームはNW.js開発者モード（SDK）で実行されていません。\n\n"],["Developer Mode provides additional debugging features:\n","開発者モードは追加のデバッグ機能を提供します：\n"],["• Developer Console (F12)\n","• 開発者コンソール（F12）\n"],["• Inspect Element (Right-click)\n","• 要素の検査（右クリック）\n"],["• Network Monitor\n","• ネットワークモニター\n"],["• Performance Profiler\n\n","• パフォーマンスプロファイラー\n\n"],["Do you want to upgrade to NW.js Developer Mode?\n","NW.js開発者モードにアップグレードしますか？\n"],["(Recommended for better debugging experience)","（より良いデバッグ体験のために推奨）"],["The game will be upgraded to NW.js SDK version","ゲームはNW.js SDKバージョンにアップグレードされます"],["This may take a few minutes. Please wait...","数分かかる場合があります。お待ちください..."],["NW.js has been upgraded to Developer Mode successfully!","NW.jsがDeveloper Modeに正常にアップグレードされました！"],["Failed to upgrade to Developer Mode:\n","Developer Modeへのアップグレードに失敗しました:\n"],["Error installing debug options: ","デバッグオプションのインストールエラー: "],["Install Debug Options","デバッグオプションをインストール"],["This will install a debug menu into your RPG Maker MV/MZ game.","これにより、RPG Maker MV/MZゲームにデバッグメニューがインストールされます。"],["Select the game executable file to install debug options.","デバッグオプションをインストールするゲーム実行ファイルを選択してください。"],["Compile HTML to Executable","HTMLを実行ファイルにコンパイル"],["Change Existing NWJS Version","既存のNWJSバージョンを変更"],["Install debug options","デバッグオプションをインストール"],["Find next","次を検索"],["Open folder","フォルダを開く"],["Open with external application","外部アプリケーションで開く"],["Raw JSON data. Right click to open menu.","生のJSONデータ。右クリックでメニューを開きます。"],["Patch is available for this trans data. This patch will make your trans data compatible with the current version of Translator++.\nDo you want to patch your Trans data?\n(Some feature may not work properly if you don't patch your trans data)","この翻訳データにはパッチが利用可能です。このパッチを適用すると、翻訳データがTranslator++の現在のバージョンと互換性を持つようになります。\n翻訳データにパッチを適用しますか？\n（パッチを適用しない場合、一部の機能が正常に動作しない可能性があります）"],["Unable to locate executable to install debug options. Make sure your game is packaged for Windows with NW.js.","デバッグオプションをインストールする実行ファイルが見つかりません。ゲームがNW.js用にWindows向けにパッケージ化されていることを確認してください。"],["Error while installing debug options: ","デバッグオプションのインストール中にエラーが発生しました: "],["Play last build","最後のビルドを再生"],["Dev path is not defined.\nYou should inject your game once to generate dev path.","開発パスが定義されていません。\n開発パスを生成するには、ゲームを一度インジェクトしてください。"],["Open editor","エディターを開く"],["Load Plugins Into Project","プロジェクトにプラグインを読み込む"],["Compile Game","ゲームをコンパイルする"],["The option has been set to use the legacy parser.\nYou can switch back to the new parser anytime via option menu.","オプションがレガシーパーサーを使用するように設定されました。\nオプションメニューからいつでも新しいパーサーに切り替えることができます。"],["Unable to find the file related to the data","データに関連するファイルが見つかりません"],["To fix this correct the <b>Raw material location</b> field at the <a href=\"#\" class=\"openProjectProperties\">Project properties</a>","これを修正するには、<a href=\"#\" class=\"openProjectProperties\">プロジェクトプロパティ</a>の<b>素材の場所</b>フィールドを正しく設定してください"],["Maximum dialog line","最大ダイアログ行数"],["Maximum line in the dialog box. Default is 4.","ダイアログボックスの最大行数。デフォルトは4です。"],["Add debug options","デバッグオプションを追加"],["Add debug options into the game to help testing.","テストを支援するためにゲームにデバッグオプションを追加します。"],["Enable this option to add debugging tools to the game. These features can help you test your translation.<br/><b>⚠️ Note: This option is only available if your game is packaged with NWJS for Windows.</b>","このオプションを有効にすると、ゲームにデバッグツールが追加されます。これらの機能は翻訳のテストに役立ちます。<br/><b>⚠️ 注意: このオプションは、ゲームがWindows用NWJSでパッケージ化されている場合のみ利用可能です。</b>"]],"context":[["tid/125/type/StringLiteral","tid/152/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/135/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/16151/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/19426/type/StringLiteral","tid/19469/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20448/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20619/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20624/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20635/type/StringLiteral","tid/21231/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20640/type/StringLiteral","tid/21236/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20713/type/StringLiteral","tid/30541/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20814/type/StringLiteral","tid/21410/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20865/type/StringLiteral","tid/21461/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20925/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20962/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20992/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21023/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21215/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21220/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21309/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21564/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21678/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22062/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22163/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22214/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22424/type/StringLiteral","tid/24166/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22434/type/StringLiteral","tid/24176/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22468/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22478/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22512/type/StringLiteral","tid/22962/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22522/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22533/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22560/type/StringLiteral","tid/22986/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22570/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22605/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/22610/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/23014/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/23119/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/23148/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/23298/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23453/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23555/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23696/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23770/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23812/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23820/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23828/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23836/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23844/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23852/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23860/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23868/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23922/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/23931/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/23972/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24005/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24068/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24217/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate","tid/24282/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/24222/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/24227/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/24482/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24546/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24598/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24781/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24891/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24981/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/25166/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/26021/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/29743/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/29779/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/30242/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/30291/type/StringLiteral","tid/30388/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/30339/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/30443/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/30705/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/30891/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/31622/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/31627/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/32659/type/StringLiteral","tid/32882/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/32669/type/StringLiteral","tid/32892/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/32935/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/32945/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/33021/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"rmmv.js","dirname":"/addons/rmmv","extension":".js","filename":"rmmv.js","path":"/addons/rmmv/rmmv.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Beautify JSON data":0,"When checked the generated data will be beautified.":1,"Error loading system.json":2,"Loading":3,"index.html not found in":4,"Encrypted game":5,"Select the index.html of your encrypted game.":6,"Target folder":7,"Select destination folder. The process will replace the existing files.":8,"Decrypt Resources":9,"Close":10,"Process":11,"Source path can not empty":12,"Destination path can not empty":13,"Path is not a file:":14,"Invalid directory:":15,"Extract enigma":16,"Select enigma file.":17,"Extract Enigma":18,"Selected file is not an Enigma Virtual Box package.":19,"Plugins are already fetched for this project. Want to re-fetch the plugins?":20,"Translate Javascript File?":21,"Cancel":22,"I know the risk, Proceed!":23,"Game Executable Path":24,"Path to the game executable file (.exe)":25,"NWJS Version":26,"Change into this NWJS version":27,"Use Developer version":28,"Use the NWJS Developer version. The Developer version has developer tools available. Suitable for debugging and development.":29,"In Developer version you can use <b>Developer Console</b>. Developer Console can be accessed by pressing F12 or right-clicking the app and selecting 'Inspect'.":30,"Use 32-bit version":31,"Use the 32-bit version of NWJS. The 32-bit version is useful for compatibility with older systems. It is recommended to uncheck this option if possible (just upgrade your machine, dude).":32,"Some game feature may not work across NWJS version":33,"Please be aware that some game feature may not work across NWJS version.":34,"Change RPG Maker MV / RPG Maker MZ / NWJS version":35,"This operation will change the NW.js version into":36,"Please close the application first before continuing.\nDo you want to continue?":37,"The selected file is not a valid NW.js application.":38,"Could not find index.html in the game directory.":39,"Debug menu script not found in addon directory.":40,"Debug menu script is already installed in index.html.":41,"Debug options installed successfully!":42,"The selected game is not running in NW.js Developer Mode (SDK).\n\n":43,"Developer Mode provides additional debugging features:\n":44,"• Developer Console (F12)\n":45,"• Inspect Element (Right-click)\n":46,"• Network Monitor\n":47,"• Performance Profiler\n\n":48,"Do you want to upgrade to NW.js Developer Mode?\n":49,"(Recommended for better debugging experience)":50,"The game will be upgraded to NW.js SDK version":51,"This may take a few minutes. Please wait...":52,"NW.js has been upgraded to Developer Mode successfully!":53,"Failed to upgrade to Developer Mode:\n":54,"Error installing debug options: ":55,"Install Debug Options":56,"This will install a debug menu into your RPG Maker MV/MZ game.":57,"Select the game executable file to install debug options.":58,"Compile HTML to Executable":59,"Change Existing NWJS Version":60,"Install debug options":61,"Find next":62,"Open folder":63,"Open with external application":64,"Raw JSON data. Right click to open menu.":65,"Patch is available for this trans data. This patch will make your trans data compatible with the current version of Translator++.\nDo you want to patch your Trans data?\n(Some feature may not work properly if you don't patch your trans data)":66,"Unable to locate executable to install debug options. Make sure your game is packaged for Windows with NW.js.":67,"Error while installing debug options: ":68,"Play last build":69,"Dev path is not defined.\nYou should inject your game once to generate dev path.":70,"Open editor":71,"Load Plugins Into Project":72,"Compile Game":73,"The option has been set to use the legacy parser.\nYou can switch back to the new parser anytime via option menu.":74,"Unable to find the file related to the data":75,"To fix this correct the <b>Raw material location</b> field at the <a href=\"#\" class=\"openProjectProperties\">Project properties</a>":76,"Maximum dialog line":77,"Maximum line in the dialog box. Default is 4.":78,"Add debug options":79,"Add debug options into the game to help testing.":80,"Enable this option to add debugging tools to the game. These features can help you test your translation.<br/><b>⚠️ Note: This option is only available if your game is packaged with NWJS for Windows.</b>":81},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rmmv/src/dv-debugmenu-map-preview.js":{"data":[["This feature only available if you are using Developer version of NWJS.","この機能は、NWJSの開発者バージョンを使用している場合のみ利用可能です。"]],"context":[["tid/19679/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"dv-debugmenu-map-preview.js","dirname":"/addons/rmmv/src","extension":".js","filename":"dv-debugmenu-map-preview.js","path":"/addons/rmmv/src/dv-debugmenu-map-preview.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"This feature only available if you are using Developer version of NWJS.":0},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rmmv/src/dv-debugmenu.js":{"data":[["This feature only available if you are using developer version of NW.js.","この機能は、NW.jsの開発者バージョンを使用している場合のみ利用可能です。"]],"context":[["tid/22924/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"dv-debugmenu.js","dirname":"/addons/rmmv/src","extension":".js","filename":"dv-debugmenu.js","path":"/addons/rmmv/src/dv-debugmenu.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"This feature only available if you are using developer version of NW.js.":0},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rmrgss/RMUtil.js":{"data":[["Use legacy parser","レガシーパーサーを使用"],["Use the old parser prior to (Translator++ ver. 3.8.12). The old parser doesn't support some newly added features.","(Translator++ ver. 3.8.12以前の) 古いパーサーを使用します。古いパーサーは一部の新機能をサポートしていません。"],["Use old parser","古いパーサーを使用"],["Event's thread concurrency","イベントのスレッド同時実行数"],["<b>Warning! Experimental feature!</b><br />This option determines the maximum number of worker threads that can concurrently parse event data on the Map and CommonEvents. <b>Set to 0 to disable worker thread</b>. <br />This option has the potential to accelerate the parsing process in larger games. However, it is important to note that in smaller games, enabling this option may actually slow down the parsing process due to the higher execution overhead compared to the parsing time for each data.","<b>警告！実験的機能です！</b><br />このオプションは、マップと共通イベントのイベントデータを同時に解析できるワーカースレッドの最大数を決定します。<b>0に設定するとワーカースレッドを無効化します</b>。<br />このオプションは、大規模なゲームで解析プロセスを加速させる可能性があります。ただし、小規模なゲームでは、各データの解析時間と比較して実行オーバーヘッドが高いため、このオプションを有効にすると解析プロセスが遅くなる可能性があることに注意してください。"],["The minimum number of command in an event that allowed in thread worker","スレッドワーカーで許可されるイベント内の最小コマンド数"],["<b>Warning! Experimental feature!</b><br />Thread workers incur overhead during execution, which means that processing blank events or events with a low number of commands can actually hinder the overall process. This option enables you to specify the minimum number of commands an event must have in order to be parsed in a worker thread. <br />It is important to note that even blank events contain one command, and it is more efficient to process such events in the main thread rather than in a worker thread. Therefore, it is recommended to set this number to a value <b>greater than 1</b>.<br />Set to 0 to disable splitting task based on commands.","<b>警告！実験的機能です！</b><br />スレッドワーカーは実行中にオーバーヘッドが発生するため、空白のイベントやコマンド数が少ないイベントを処理すると、全体のプロセスを妨げる可能性があります。このオプションでは、イベントがワーカースレッドで解析されるために必要な最小コマンド数を指定できます。<br />空白のイベントでも1つのコマンドを含むことに注意してください。そのようなイベントは、ワーカースレッドではなくメインスレッドで処理する方が効率的です。したがって、この数値を<b>1より大きい値</b>に設定することをお勧めします。<br />コマンドに基づくタスク分割を無効にするには0に設定してください。"],["Note that a blank event actually contains one command, and you definitely want to process blank events in the main thread instead of a worker thread. You should set this number to a value greater than 1.","空白のイベントには実際に1つのコマンドが含まれていることに注意してください。ワーカースレッドではなくメインスレッドで空白イベントを処理することを強く推奨します。この数値を1より大きい値に設定してください。"],["RPG Maker XP, VX, Ace, MV & MZ Parser V.3","RPG Maker XP、VX、Ace、MV & MZ パーサー V.3"],["Start translation from RPG Maker game using the latest parser.","最新のパーサーを使用してRPG Makerゲームから翻訳を開始します。"],["Error!\r\nTranslator++ is unable to detect the type of ","エラー！\r\nTranslator++はの種類を検出できませんでした"],["You should change the path!\r\nThe Dev directory should not inside the original game's directory, as this will cause problem if you inject the game latter.","パスを変更してください！\r\n開発ディレクトリは元のゲームディレクトリ内に配置しないでください。後でゲームを注入する際に問題が発生する可能性があります。"],["The game is packed with Enigma.\r\nDo you want to extract the package?\r\nThis will take minutes, depend on the size of your game.","ゲームはEnigmaでパックされています。\r\nパッケージを抽出しますか？\r\nゲームのサイズによって数分かかることがあります。"],["Unable to extract the Enigma package!","Enigmaパッケージを抽出できませんでした！"],["Copy & extract data into ","データをコピーしてに抽出します"]],"context":[["tid/263/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/273/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/290/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/344/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/354/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/424/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/434/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/438/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21951/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21956/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22453/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22989/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23038/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23126/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23333/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"RMUtil.js","dirname":"/addons/rmrgss","extension":".js","filename":"RMUtil.js","path":"/addons/rmrgss/RMUtil.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Use legacy parser":0,"Use the old parser prior to (Translator++ ver. 3.8.12). The old parser doesn't support some newly added features.":1,"Use old parser":2,"Event's thread concurrency":3,"<b>Warning! Experimental feature!</b><br />This option determines the maximum number of worker threads that can concurrently parse event data on the Map and CommonEvents. <b>Set to 0 to disable worker thread</b>. <br />This option has the potential to accelerate the parsing process in larger games. However, it is important to note that in smaller games, enabling this option may actually slow down the parsing process due to the higher execution overhead compared to the parsing time for each data.":4,"The minimum number of command in an event that allowed in thread worker":5,"<b>Warning! Experimental feature!</b><br />Thread workers incur overhead during execution, which means that processing blank events or events with a low number of commands can actually hinder the overall process. This option enables you to specify the minimum number of commands an event must have in order to be parsed in a worker thread. <br />It is important to note that even blank events contain one command, and it is more efficient to process such events in the main thread rather than in a worker thread. Therefore, it is recommended to set this number to a value <b>greater than 1</b>.<br />Set to 0 to disable splitting task based on commands.":6,"Note that a blank event actually contains one command, and you definitely want to process blank events in the main thread instead of a worker thread. You should set this number to a value greater than 1.":7,"RPG Maker XP, VX, Ace, MV & MZ Parser V.3":8,"Start translation from RPG Maker game using the latest parser.":9,"Error!\r\nTranslator++ is unable to detect the type of ":10,"You should change the path!\r\nThe Dev directory should not inside the original game's directory, as this will cause problem if you inject the game latter.":11,"The game is packed with Enigma.\r\nDo you want to extract the package?\r\nThis will take minutes, depend on the size of your game.":12,"Unable to extract the Enigma package!":13,"Copy & extract data into ":14},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rmrgss/legacyHandler.js":{"data":[["RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway is needed to run this action.\nRPGMakertrans CLI Gateway is licensed under GPL-3 and cannot be distributed along with the program.\nBut Translator++ can set it up on your behalf.\n\nDo you wan't Translator++ to install RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway for you?","このアクションを実行するにはRPGMakertrans CLI Gatewayが必要です。\nRPGMakertrans CLI GatewayはGPL-3でライセンスされており、プログラムと一緒に配布することはできません。\nただし、Translator++は代わりに設定することができます。\n\nTranslator++にRPGMakertrans CLI Gatewayをインストールしてもらいますか？"],["RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway is need to be updated.\nDo you wan't Translator++ to update the RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway for you?","RPGMakertrans CLI Gatewayを更新する必要があります。\nTranslator++にRPGMakertrans CLI Gatewayを更新してもらいますか？"],["Maximum dialog line","最大ダイアログ行数"],["Maximum line in the dialog box. Default is 4.","ダイアログボックスの最大行数。デフォルトは4です。"]],"context":[["tid/569/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/644/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4420/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4430/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"legacyHandler.js","dirname":"/addons/rmrgss","extension":".js","filename":"legacyHandler.js","path":"/addons/rmrgss/legacyHandler.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway is needed to run this action.\nRPGMakertrans CLI Gateway is licensed under GPL-3 and cannot be distributed along with the program.\nBut Translator++ can set it up on your behalf.\n\nDo you wan't Translator++ to install RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway for you?":0,"RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway is need to be updated.\nDo you wan't Translator++ to update the RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway for you?":1,"Maximum dialog line":2,"Maximum line in the dialog box. Default is 4.":3},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/srpgStudioParser/srpgstudio.js":{"data":[["Start a translation project from SRPG Studio Engine.","SRPG Studioエンジンから翻訳プロジェクトを開始します。"],["The parser can handle translation from <b>data.dts</b> (srpgs file); the <b>localization.dat</b> file and localization files (.json, .txt, .js) generated by SRPG Studio's localization tool introduced in version 1.253..","このパーサーは<b>data.dts</b>（srpgsファイル）からの翻訳を処理できます。<b>localization.dat</b>ファイルと、SRPG Studioのローカライゼーションツール（バージョン1.253で導入）によって生成されたローカライゼーションファイル（.json、.txt、.js）も対応しています。"],["Create project","プロジェクトを作成"],["Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!","エラー：customFieldが定義されていません。これは発生すべきではありません！"],["Please select the entry point to translate.","翻訳するエントリーポイントを選択してください。"],["There are currently two known locations of translatable text within the SRPG Studio game. <br />","現在、SRPG Studioゲーム内で翻訳可能なテキストの既知の場所は2つあります。<br />"],["The first is directly written inside the .srpgs file, and the second is in the localization.dat file. This parser can currently can handle both.","1つ目は.srpgsファイル内に直接書き込まれており、2つ目はlocalization.datファイル内にあります。このパーサーは現在、両方を処理できます。"],["<br />In addition to that, you can also translate the localization files generated by SRPG Studio's localization tool. These files are in JSON, TXT, and JS format.","<br />さらに、SRPG Studioのローカライゼーションツールによって生成されたローカライゼーションファイルも翻訳できます。これらのファイルはJSON、TXT、JS形式です。"]],"context":[["tid/2574/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2579/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2648/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2685/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2745/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3047/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3054/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3061/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"]],"basename":"srpgstudio.js","dirname":"/addons/srpgStudioParser","extension":".js","filename":"srpgstudio.js","path":"/addons/srpgStudioParser/srpgstudio.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Start a translation project from SRPG Studio Engine.":0,"The parser can handle translation from <b>data.dts</b> (srpgs file); the <b>localization.dat</b> file and localization files (.json, .txt, .js) generated by SRPG Studio's localization tool introduced in version 1.253..":1,"Create project":2,"Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!":3,"Please select the entry point to translate.":4,"There are currently two known locations of translatable text within the SRPG Studio game. <br />":5,"The first is directly written inside the .srpgs file, and the second is in the localization.dat file. This parser can currently can handle both.":6,"<br />In addition to that, you can also translate the localization files generated by SRPG Studio's localization tool. These files are in JSON, TXT, and JS format.":7},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/srpgStudioParserAlt/srpgstudio-alt.js":{"data":[["Parse SRPG Studio archives and translation dump JSON generated by SRPG_Unpacker.exe.","SRPG StudioのアーカイブとSRPG_Unpacker.exeで生成された翻訳ダンプJSONを解析します。"],["Start translation from SRPG Studio data.dts, project.dat, or translation dump JSON.<br />This is the latest parser—significantly faster and more stable—which will replace the previous version.","SRPG Studioのdata.dts、project.dat、または翻訳ダンプJSONから翻訳を開始します。<br />これは最新のパーサーで、大幅に高速かつ安定しており、以前のバージョンを置き換えます。"],["Create Project","プロジェクトを作成"],["Source mode","ソースモード"],["Choose EXE mode to start from the game executable, archive mode for data.dts / project.dat, or dump mode for translation dump JSON.","ゲーム実行ファイルから開始するにはEXEモード、data.dts / project.datにはアーカイブモード、翻訳ダンプJSONにはダンプモードを選択します。"],["Select executable","実行ファイルを選択"],["Select the game executable. Translator++ will look for data.dts in the same folder.","ゲームの実行ファイルを選択します。Translator++は同じフォルダ内のdata.dtsを探します。"],["Select archive file","アーカイブファイルを選択"],["Select data.dts directly.","data.dtsを直接選択します。"],["Select dump folder","ダンプフォルダを選択"],["Select the translation dump folder generated by SRPG_Unpacker.exe.","SRPG_Unpacker.exeで生成された翻訳ダンプフォルダを選択します。"],["Filters","フィルター"],["Glob pattern used to select JSON files from the dump folder.","ダンプフォルダからJSONファイルを選択するためのグロブパターン。"],["ProjectTitle","プロジェクトタイトル"],["Your project title","プロジェクトのタイトル"]],"context":[["tid/4165/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4208/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4279/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4550/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4582/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4608/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4618/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4651/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4661/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4694/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4704/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4737/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4747/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4780/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4790/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"srpgstudio-alt.js","dirname":"/addons/srpgStudioParserAlt","extension":".js","filename":"srpgstudio-alt.js","path":"/addons/srpgStudioParserAlt/srpgstudio-alt.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Parse SRPG Studio archives and translation dump JSON generated by SRPG_Unpacker.exe.":0,"Start translation from SRPG Studio data.dts, project.dat, or translation dump JSON.<br />This is the latest parser—significantly faster and more stable—which will replace the previous version.":1,"Create Project":2,"Source mode":3,"Choose EXE mode to start from the game executable, archive mode for data.dts / project.dat, or dump mode for translation dump JSON.":4,"Select executable":5,"Select the game executable. Translator++ will look for data.dts in the same folder.":6,"Select archive file":7,"Select data.dts directly.":8,"Select dump folder":9,"Select the translation dump folder generated by SRPG_Unpacker.exe.":10,"Filters":11,"Glob pattern used to select JSON files from the dump folder.":12,"ProjectTitle":13,"Your project title":14},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/sugoiTrans/serverManager.html":{"data":[["Sugoi translator location <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Point to the .bat file or .exe file on the root directory of the application.\"></i>","Sugoi翻訳機の場所 <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"アプリケーションのルートディレクトリにある.batファイルまたは.exeファイルを指定してください。\"></i>"],["<i class=\"icon-attention red\"></i> Invalid path.<br>Some features will be disabled until this is fixed.","<i class=\"icon-attention red\"></i> 無効なパスです。<br>これが修正されるまで、一部の機能は無効になります。"],["Server Type :","サーバータイプ："],["Installed Model :","インストール済みモデル："],["Install Sugoi Translator","Sugoi翻訳機をインストール"],["Don't have Sugoi Translator?\n            Install customized &amp; optimized Sugoi Translator server now!\n        ","素晴らしい翻訳者をお持ちでないですか？\n            カスタマイズ＆最適化された素晴らしい翻訳者サーバーを今すぐインストールしましょう！\n        "],["Number of server to start (CPU) <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Number of server started simultaneously\"></i>","起動するサーバー数（CPU） <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"同時に起動するサーバー数\"></i>"],["Number of server to be started simultaneously.<br>More process desn't always means more speed, be mindful of your RAM &amp; CPU capacity.<br>You may won't get the benefit if by running just one server the CPU usage has reached 100%","同時に起動するサーバー数。<br>プロセスが多いほど必ずしも速度が上がるわけではなく、RAMとCPU容量に注意してください。<br>1つのサーバーを実行しただけでCPU使用率が100％に達した場合、メリットを得られない可能性があります。"],["\n                    Your Sugoi Translator doesn't support GPU processing.<br>\n                    You need to patch your server to support GPU processing.<br>\n                    <h3 data-tran=\"\">Select the following option to install the suitable patch for your system</h3>\n                    <div>\n                        <span data-tran=\"\">Your GPU is:</span>\n                        <ul class=\"gpuList\"></ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"gpuPatchOptions\">\n                        <button class=\"patchGPU\" data-tran=\"\">Install patch For NVIDIA series 30xx or greater</button>\n                        <button class=\"patchGPULegacy\" data-tran=\"\">Install patch For NVIDIA series 20xx or lower</button>\n    \n                    </div>\n                ","\n                    あなたの素晴らしい翻訳者はGPU処理をサポートしていません。<br>\n                    GPU処理をサポートするにはサーバーにパッチを適用する必要があります。<br>\n                    <h3 data-tran=\"\">以下のオプションを選択して、あなたのシステムに適したパッチをインストールしてください</h3>\n                    <div>\n                        <span data-tran=\"\">あなたのGPUは：</span>\n                        <ul class=\"gpuList\"></ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"gpuPatchOptions\">\n                        <button class=\"patchGPU\" data-tran=\"\">NVIDIAシリーズ30xx以上用パッチをインストール</button>\n                        <button class=\"patchGPULegacy\" data-tran=\"\">NVIDIAシリーズ20xx以下用パッチをインストール</button>\n    \n                    </div>\n                "],["Select the following option to install the suitable patch for your system","以下のオプションを選択して、あなたのシステムに適したパッチをインストールしてください"],["Your GPU is:","あなたのGPUは："],["Install patch For NVIDIA series 30xx or greater","NVIDIAシリーズ30xx以上用パッチをインストール"],["Install patch For NVIDIA series 20xx or lower","NVIDIAシリーズ20xx以下用パッチをインストール"],["Number of server to start (GPU) <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Number of server started simultaneously using GPU. Your server must be patched to enable GPU processing.\"></i>","起動するサーバー数（GPU） <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"GPUを使用して同時に起動するサーバー数。GPU処理を有効にするにはサーバーにパッチを適用する必要があります。\"></i>"],["How many server do you want to start on your <b>GPU</b>. It is possible to run both CPU and GPU based service simultaneously. But please keep in mind that if your CPU usage is high it may hinder the GPU performance.<br>Your server must be patched to enable this mode.","あなたの<b>GPU</b>上で起動したいサーバー数。CPUベースとGPUベースのサービスを同時に実行することは可能ですが、CPU使用率が高いとGPU性能を妨げる可能性があることに注意してください。<br>このモードを有効にするにはサーバーにパッチを適用する必要があります。"],["Starting port number","開始ポート番号"],["The port numbers will be generated incrementaly starting from the value below","ポート番号は以下の値から順次生成されます"],["Keep console window open","コンソールウィンドウを開いたままにする"],["prevent console window from closing when the server closes. This option is useful for checking for errors that caused the server to crash.","サーバーが閉じたときにコンソールウィンドウが閉じるのを防ぎます。このオプションは、サーバーがクラッシュした原因のエラーを確認するのに役立ちます。"],["Action","アクション"],["Set Sugoi Trans config based on this setting","この設定に基づいて素晴らしい翻訳者設定を設定"],["Start All Server","すべてのサーバーを起動"]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText"],["idx/1/innerText"],["idx/2/innerText"],["idx/3/innerText"],["idx/4/innerText","idx/6/innerText"],["idx/5/innerText"],["idx/7/innerText"],["idx/8/innerText"],["idx/9/innerText"],["idx/10/innerText"],["idx/11/innerText"],["idx/12/innerText"],["idx/13/innerText"],["idx/14/innerText"],["idx/15/innerText"],["idx/16/innerText"],["idx/17/innerText"],["idx/18/innerText"],["idx/19/innerText"],["idx/20/innerText"],["idx/21/innerText"],["idx/22/innerText"]],"basename":"serverManager.html","dirname":"/addons/sugoiTrans","extension":".html","filename":"serverManager.html","path":"/addons/sugoiTrans/serverManager.html","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Sugoi translator location <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Point to the .bat file or .exe file on the root directory of the application.\"></i>":0,"<i class=\"icon-attention red\"></i> Invalid path.<br>Some features will be disabled until this is fixed.":1,"Server Type :":2,"Installed Model :":3,"Install Sugoi Translator":4,"Don't have Sugoi Translator?\n            Install customized &amp; optimized Sugoi Translator server now!\n        ":5,"Number of server to start (CPU) <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Number of server started simultaneously\"></i>":6,"Number of server to be started simultaneously.<br>More process desn't always means more speed, be mindful of your RAM &amp; CPU capacity.<br>You may won't get the benefit if by running just one server the CPU usage has reached 100%":7,"\n                    Your Sugoi Translator doesn't support GPU processing.<br>\n                    You need to patch your server to support GPU processing.<br>\n                    <h3 data-tran=\"\">Select the following option to install the suitable patch for your system</h3>\n                    <div>\n                        <span data-tran=\"\">Your GPU is:</span>\n                        <ul class=\"gpuList\"></ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"gpuPatchOptions\">\n                        <button class=\"patchGPU\" data-tran=\"\">Install patch For NVIDIA series 30xx or greater</button>\n                        <button class=\"patchGPULegacy\" data-tran=\"\">Install patch For NVIDIA series 20xx or lower</button>\n    \n                    </div>\n                ":8,"Select the following option to install the suitable patch for your system":9,"Your GPU is:":10,"Install patch For NVIDIA series 30xx or greater":11,"Install patch For NVIDIA series 20xx or lower":12,"Number of server to start (GPU) <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Number of server started simultaneously using GPU. Your server must be patched to enable GPU processing.\"></i>":13,"How many server do you want to start on your <b>GPU</b>. It is possible to run both CPU and GPU based service simultaneously. But please keep in mind that if your CPU usage is high it may hinder the GPU performance.<br>Your server must be patched to enable this mode.":14,"Starting port number":15,"The port numbers will be generated incrementaly starting from the value below":16,"Keep console window open":17,"prevent console window from closing when the server closes. This option is useful for checking for errors that caused the server to crash.":18,"Action":19,"Set Sugoi Trans config based on this setting":20,"Start All Server":21},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/sugoiTrans/serverManager.js":{"data":[["Select installation folder","インストールフォルダを選択"],["Where do you want to install the CT2 Sugoi Translator into?","CT2素晴らしい翻訳者をどこにインストールしますか？"],["Cancel","キャンセル"],["Install now!","今すぐインストール！"],["Path to the directory can not be empty!","ディレクトリへのパスは空にできません！"],["Invalid directory:","無効なディレクトリ："],["Failed to download file. Repository do not exist. Please see the console log for more information.","ファイルのダウンロードに失敗しました。リポジトリが存在しません。詳細はコンソールログを参照してください。"],["Are you sure want to update your server?\nThis update script will work for NVIDIA 3XXX series","サーバーを更新してもよろしいですか？\nこの更新スクリプトはNVIDIA 3XXXシリーズ用です"],["Are you sure want to update your server?\nThis update script will work for NVIDIA 2XXX series and earlier","サーバーを更新してもよろしいですか？\nこの更新スクリプトはNVIDIA 2XXXシリーズ以前用です"],["Install CT2 Sugoi Translator","CT2 Sugoi Translatorをインストール"],["Installation completed\nDo you want to set the Server Manager with this installed server?","インストール完了\nこのインストール済みサーバーでServer Managerを設定しますか？"],["Sugoi Translator Installed","Sugoi Translatorがインストールされました"],["Server started\nPlease wait until the server(s) are ready before you translate things.","サーバー起動\n翻訳を行う前に、サーバーが準備完了するまでお待ちください。"],["This action will overwrite the current value of Sugoi Trans Addon's settings.\nAre you sure?","この操作はSugoi Trans Addonの設定の現在の値を上書きします。\nよろしいですか？"],["Do you want to reset the current configuration?","現在の設定をリセットしますか？"],["Configuration refreshed!","設定が更新されました！"]],"context":[["tid/528/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate","tid/635/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/533/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/766/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/817/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/900/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/929/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1552/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6226/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/6296/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/8731/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8957/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9003/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9606/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9643/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/9713/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9778/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"serverManager.js","dirname":"/addons/sugoiTrans","extension":".js","filename":"serverManager.js","path":"/addons/sugoiTrans/serverManager.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Select installation folder":0,"Where do you want to install the CT2 Sugoi Translator into?":1,"Cancel":2,"Install now!":3,"Path to the directory can not be empty!":4,"Invalid directory:":5,"Failed to download file. Repository do not exist. Please see the console log for more information.":6,"Are you sure want to update your server?\nThis update script will work for NVIDIA 3XXX series":7,"Are you sure want to update your server?\nThis update script will work for NVIDIA 2XXX series and earlier":8,"Install CT2 Sugoi Translator":9,"Installation completed\nDo you want to set the Server Manager with this installed server?":10,"Sugoi Translator Installed":11,"Server started\nPlease wait until the server(s) are ready before you translate things.":12,"This action will overwrite the current value of Sugoi Trans Addon's settings.\nAre you sure?":13,"Do you want to reset the current configuration?":14,"Configuration refreshed!":15},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/sugoiTrans/sugoiTrans.js":{"data":[["Line delimiter","行区切り文字"],["Fill in with the characters or phrases that will be escaped by the translator (the original phrase and the translation will always be the same). This will guarantee that the number of lines of the translated text is the same as the number of lines of the original text. \nThere are currently no phrases/characters that Sugoi will escape with a 100% success rate.\nYou can try using &#x3C;br&#x3E; with decent amount of success rate.\nLeave blank if you want to concatenate the lines into a single line.","翻訳機によってエスケープされる文字やフレーズを入力してください（元のフレーズと翻訳は常に同じになります）。これにより、翻訳テキストの行数が元のテキストの行数と同じであることが保証されます。\n現在、Sugoiが100%の成功率でエスケープするフレーズ/文字はありません。\n&#x3C;br&#x3E;を使用すると、ある程度の成功率が得られます。\n行を1行に連結したい場合は空白のままにしてください。"],["Target URL(s)","ターゲットURL"],["Translator target URL. You can enter one ore more Sugoi Translator back-end URL. Translator++ will load balance the request across all instance of the services. Separate each entry with a new line.","翻訳機のターゲットURL。1つ以上のSugoi TranslatorバックエンドURLを入力できます。Translator++は、すべてのサービスインスタンス間でリクエストを負荷分散します。各エントリは改行で区切ってください。"],["Max Parallel job","最大並列ジョブ数"],["Maximum parallel job that run simultaneously.","同時に実行される最大並列ジョブ数。"],["Send requests in batch","バッチでリクエストを送信"],["Send several texts (by Max Parallel job) in array.\nFaster and can cut the execution overhead significantly. You must run the server from server manager to enable this option.","複数のテキストを配列で送信（最大並列ジョブ数）。\nより高速で、実行オーバーヘッドを大幅に削減できます。このオプションを有効にするには、サーバーマネージャーからサーバーを実行する必要があります。"],["Check First Line in Common Reference","共通参照で最初の行を確認"],["Do not include first line in the payload if the first line is found at Common Reference.\nThis is very useful if the character name is at the first line.","最初の行が共通参照で見つかった場合、ペイロードに最初の行を含めないでください。\nキャラクター名が最初の行にある場合に非常に便利です。"],["Check Last Line in Common Reference","共通参照で最後の行を確認"],["Do not include last line in the payload if the last line is found at Common Reference.\nThis is very useful if the character name is at the last line.","最後の行が共通参照で見つかった場合、ペイロードに最後の行を含めないでください。\nキャラクター名が最後の行にある場合に非常に便利です。"],["Automatic splitting","自動分割"],["Automatically split the translation into the number of lines matching the original. The length of each line will be of a similar size.","翻訳を、元の行数に一致する行数に自動的に分割します。各行の長さは同程度になります。"],["Code Escaping Algorithm","コードエスケープアルゴリズム"],["Escaping algorithm for inline code inside dialogues (not yet implemented, please wait for the future updates)","ダイアログ内のインラインコードのためのエスケープアルゴリズム（まだ実装されていません。今後のアップデートをお待ちください）"]],"context":[["tid/161/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/171/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/203/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/213/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/257/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/267/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/305/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/315/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/347/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/357/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/389/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/399/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/431/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/441/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/473/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/483/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"sugoiTrans.js","dirname":"/addons/sugoiTrans","extension":".js","filename":"sugoiTrans.js","path":"/addons/sugoiTrans/sugoiTrans.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Line delimiter":0,"Fill in with the characters or phrases that will be escaped by the translator (the original phrase and the translation will always be the same). This will guarantee that the number of lines of the translated text is the same as the number of lines of the original text. \nThere are currently no phrases/characters that Sugoi will escape with a 100% success rate.\nYou can try using &#x3C;br&#x3E; with decent amount of success rate.\nLeave blank if you want to concatenate the lines into a single line.":1,"Target URL(s)":2,"Translator target URL. You can enter one ore more Sugoi Translator back-end URL. Translator++ will load balance the request across all instance of the services. Separate each entry with a new line.":3,"Max Parallel job":4,"Maximum parallel job that run simultaneously.":5,"Send requests in batch":6,"Send several texts (by Max Parallel job) in array.\nFaster and can cut the execution overhead significantly. You must run the server from server manager to enable this option.":7,"Check First Line in Common Reference":8,"Do not include first line in the payload if the first line is found at Common Reference.\nThis is very useful if the character name is at the first line.":9,"Check Last Line in Common Reference":10,"Do not include last line in the payload if the last line is found at Common Reference.\nThis is very useful if the character name is at the last line.":11,"Automatic splitting":12,"Automatically split the translation into the number of lines matching the original. The length of each line will be of a similar size.":13,"Code Escaping Algorithm":14,"Escaping algorithm for inline code inside dialogues (not yet implemented, please wait for the future updates)":15},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/testAddon/emoji.js":{"data":[["Load Actor Reference as Glossary","アクター参照を用語集として読み込む"],["If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.","チェックすると、Translator++はアクター参照を用語集として読み込みます。これにより、翻訳者が会話の文脈を理解するのに役立ちます。アクター参照はダイアログ内のアクターの名前です。これは用語集として翻訳者に読み込まれます。これにより翻訳コストが増加します。"],["Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.","会話に存在するキャラクターのみが、各バッチアイテムの用語集として読み込まれます。プロンプトメッセージでアクター参照を読み込むには、テンプレートコマンドを使用してください。"],["Actor Reference Translation Column","アクター参照翻訳列"],["The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.","アクター名の翻訳の列。この列はアクター参照の翻訳として使用されます。これにより、会話内でのアクター名の翻訳の一貫性が向上します。"],["Actor's Information Column","アクター情報列"],["The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.","アクターの追加情報を含む列。性別、年齢などの詳細情報を入力できます。これにより、会話内の代名詞の翻訳が向上します。"],["System Message Template","システムメッセージテンプレート"],["System message is the header of the message that will tell what is the role of your chatGPT assistant. This message will be sent as the very first message of every batch you send to chatGPT.","システムメッセージは、chatGPTアシスタントの役割を伝えるメッセージのヘッダーです。このメッセージは、chatGPTに送信するすべてのバッチの最初のメッセージとして送信されます。"],["You can include the following variables with JavaScript's Template Literal style <span class='inlineCode'><b>${</b>VARIABLE<b>}</b></span><br>","JavaScriptのテンプレートリテラルスタイルで以下の変数を含めることができます <span class='inlineCode'><b>${</b>VARIABLE<b>}</b></span><br>"],["Variables:<br>","変数:<br>"],["<li>LANG_FROM : Source language</li>","<li>LANG_FROM : ソース言語</li>"],["<li>LANG_TO : Target language</li>","<li>LANG_TO : ターゲット言語</li>"],["<li>LANG_FROM_FULL : Full source language name</li>","<li>LANG_FROM_FULL : ソース言語の正式名</li>"],["<li>LANG_TO_FULL : Full target language name</li>","<li>LANG_TO_FULL : ターゲット言語の正式名</li>"],["<li>SOURCE_TEXT : Source text</li>","<li>SOURCE_TEXT : ソーステキスト</li>"],["<li>ESCAPE_ALGORITHM_PROMPT : Pre-defined message of escape algorithm.</li>","<li>ESCAPE_ALGORITHM_PROMPT : エスケープアルゴリズムの事前定義メッセージ。</li>"],["<li>NEWLINE_STRING : String represents new line (Line substitute).</li>","<li>NEWLINE_STRING : 改行を表す文字列（行の代替）。</li>"],["<li>MESSAGE_COUNT : Number of messages in the batch.</li>","<li>MESSAGE_COUNT : バッチ内のメッセージ数。</li>"],["<li>ACTOR_INFO : Add information of the actors.</li>","<li>ACTOR_INFO : アクターの情報を追加します。</li>"],["<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>","<li>TITLE : ゲームのタイトル</li>"],["<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>","<li>ENGINE : ゲームのエンジン</li>"],["<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>","<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Translator++オブジェクトから参照を生成します。<br />例 : <code>REFERENCE[共通参照]</code></li>"],["Body Message Template","本文メッセージテンプレート"],["Template of the body of your chat.","チャットの本文のテンプレート。"],["Sample conversation","サンプル会話"],["The ChatGPT Batch API allows you to translate your project asynchronously at 50% lower costs, meaning you will receive the results of your translation <b style=\"color:red\">within 24 hours</b> at <b style=\"color:red\">half the normal cost</b>. This is particularly useful for large projects that do not require immediate translation results.","ChatGPT Batch APIを使用すると、プロジェクトを非同期で翻訳でき、コストを50%削減できます。つまり、翻訳結果を<b style=\"color:red\">24時間以内</b>に<b style=\"color:red\">通常の半額</b>で受け取ることができます。これは、即時の翻訳結果を必要としない大規模プロジェクトに特に役立ちます。"],[" <br />Read more about the ChatGPT Batch API: https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/batch ."," <br />ChatGPT Batch APIの詳細はこちら: https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/batch 。"],["Glossary","用語集"],["<h2>Glossary</h2>","<h2>用語集</h2>"],["<p>You may or may not use the glossary. The glossary will be loaded for each batch items to improve the quality of the translation.</p>","<p>用語集は使用しても使用しなくても構いません。用語集は各バッチアイテムに読み込まれ、翻訳の品質向上に役立ちます。</p>"],["The Column of Actor's Additional Information","アクター追加情報の列"],["Prompt Template","プロンプトテンプレート"],["<h2>1. System Message</h2>","<h2>1. システムメッセージ</h2>"],["<p>Here you can explain to the assistant, what is their role.</p>","<p>ここでアシスタントに、彼らの役割を説明できます。</p>"],["<h2>2. Sample dialogue</h2>","<h2>2. サンプル対話</h2>"],["<p>Sample existing dialog. You can write a sample of good or bad responses to help the translator understand your aim and the context of the conversation.</p>","<p>既存の対話のサンプル。良い応答や悪い応答のサンプルを書いて、翻訳者が目的と会話の文脈を理解するのを助けることができます。</p>"],["<h2>3. Your actual prompt</h2>","<h2>3. 実際のプロンプト</h2>"],["<p>This is the actual prompt to the assistant.</p>","<p>これはアシスタントへの実際のプロンプトです。</p>"],["<h3>Overhead cost</h3>\n                        Overhead cost is the cost of the prompt message that you send to the assistant without the actual translation texts. The cost is calculated based on the number of tokens in the prompt message. The more tokens you have, the higher the cost will be.<br>\n                        <b>Current overhead cost:</b> <span class=\"overheadCost\">0</span> tokens / request.","<h3>オーバーヘッドコスト</h3>\n                        オーバーヘッドコストは、実際の翻訳テキストなしでアシスタントに送信するプロンプトメッセージのコストです。コストはプロンプトメッセージのトークン数に基づいて計算されます。トークンが多いほど、コストは高くなります。<br>\n                        <b>現在のオーバーヘッドコスト：</b> <span class=\"overheadCost\">0</span> トークン / リクエスト。"]],"context":[["tid/1555/type/StringLiteral","tid/2095/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1565/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1572/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1606/type/StringLiteral","tid/2126/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1616/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1643/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1653/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1685/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1695/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1703/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1711/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1724/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1732/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1740/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1748/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1756/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1764/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1772/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1780/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1788/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1796/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1804/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1812/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1850/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1860/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1906/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2001/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2013/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2039/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2065/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2072/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2157/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2189/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2215/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2222/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2266/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2273/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2399/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2406/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2459/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"]],"basename":"emoji.js","dirname":"/addons/testAddon","extension":".js","filename":"emoji.js","path":"/addons/testAddon/emoji.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Load Actor Reference as Glossary":0,"If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.":1,"Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.":2,"Actor Reference Translation Column":3,"The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.":4,"Actor's Information Column":5,"The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.":6,"System Message Template":7,"System message is the header of the message that will tell what is the role of your chatGPT assistant. This message will be sent as the very first message of every batch you send to chatGPT.":8,"You can include the following variables with JavaScript's Template Literal style <span class='inlineCode'><b>${</b>VARIABLE<b>}</b></span><br>":9,"Variables:<br>":10,"<li>LANG_FROM : Source language</li>":11,"<li>LANG_TO : Target language</li>":12,"<li>LANG_FROM_FULL : Full source language name</li>":13,"<li>LANG_TO_FULL : Full target language name</li>":14,"<li>SOURCE_TEXT : Source text</li>":15,"<li>ESCAPE_ALGORITHM_PROMPT : Pre-defined message of escape algorithm.</li>":16,"<li>NEWLINE_STRING : String represents new line (Line substitute).</li>":17,"<li>MESSAGE_COUNT : Number of messages in the batch.</li>":18,"<li>ACTOR_INFO : Add information of the actors.</li>":19,"<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>":20,"<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>":21,"<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>":22,"Body Message Template":23,"Template of the body of your chat.":24,"Sample conversation":25,"The ChatGPT Batch API allows you to translate your project asynchronously at 50% lower costs, meaning you will receive the results of your translation <b style=\"color:red\">within 24 hours</b> at <b style=\"color:red\">half the normal cost</b>. This is particularly useful for large projects that do not require immediate translation results.":26," <br />Read more about the ChatGPT Batch API: https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/batch .":27,"Glossary":28,"<h2>Glossary</h2>":29,"<p>You may or may not use the glossary. The glossary will be loaded for each batch items to improve the quality of the translation.</p>":30,"The Column of Actor's Additional Information":31,"Prompt Template":32,"<h2>1. System Message</h2>":33,"<p>Here you can explain to the assistant, what is their role.</p>":34,"<h2>2. Sample dialogue</h2>":35,"<p>Sample existing dialog. You can write a sample of good or bad responses to help the translator understand your aim and the context of the conversation.</p>":36,"<h2>3. Your actual prompt</h2>":37,"<p>This is the actual prompt to the assistant.</p>":38,"<h3>Overhead cost</h3>\n                        Overhead cost is the cost of the prompt message that you send to the assistant without the actual translation texts. The cost is calculated based on the number of tokens in the prompt message. The more tokens you have, the higher the cost will be.<br>\n                        <b>Current overhead cost:</b> <span class=\"overheadCost\">0</span> tokens / request.":39},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/tinyrpa/util.js":{"data":[["TinyRPA server is not installed. Do you want to install it now?","TinyRPAサーバーがインストールされていません。今すぐインストールしますか？"]],"context":[["tid/854/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"util.js","dirname":"/addons/tinyrpa","extension":".js","filename":"util.js","path":"/addons/tinyrpa/util.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"TinyRPA server is not installed. Do you want to install it now?":0},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/tm/tm.js":{"data":[["Automatic organic translation memorization","自動有機翻訳記憶"],["If checked, all organic translation (manually inputted translation) will be memorized automatically.","チェックすると、すべての有機翻訳（手動入力された翻訳）が自動的に記憶されます。"],["Memorize translation by automation script","自動化スクリプトによる翻訳記憶"],["If checked, Translator++ will remember the translation created from automation scripts. \nAll changes via 'this.cells' will be memorized. But it is possible for us to modify the contents of the grid directly using the trans API, such changes will not trigger the automatic memorization.","チェックすると、Translator++は自動化スクリプトから作成された翻訳を記憶します。\n'this.cells'を介したすべての変更は記憶されますが、trans APIを使用してグリッドの内容を直接変更することも可能で、そのような変更は自動記憶をトリガーしません。"],["Remind translation on cell translate","セル翻訳時に翻訳をリマインド"],["If checked, Translator++ will load translation from translation memory first before performing automatic translation on selected cell.","チェックすると、Translator++は選択したセルで自動翻訳を実行する前に、翻訳メモリから最初に翻訳を読み込みます。"],["Default memorization behavior","デフォルトの記憶動作"],["Overwrite previous record when performing organic translation. If unchecked, TM will not memorize the new translation for existing record.","有機翻訳を実行する際に以前の記録を上書きします。チェックを外すと、TMは既存の記録に対して新しい翻訳を記憶しません。"],["MySQL host","MySQLホスト"],["The host name or IP address of your MySQL server","MySQLサーバーのホスト名またはIPアドレス"],["MySQL port","MySQLポート"],["MySQL Port. Default is 3306.","MySQLポート。デフォルトは3306です。"],["MySQL user name","MySQLユーザー名"],["Username to access the DB.","データベースにアクセスするためのユーザー名。"],["MySQL password","MySQLパスワード"],["Password to access the DB.","データベースにアクセスするためのパスワード。"],["Database Name","データベース名"],["Database name. Translator++ will try to create database if not exist. But the success is depend on the privilege of the given credential.","データベース名。Translator++は、存在しない場合、データベースの作成を試みます。ただし、成功は指定された認証情報の権限に依存します。"],["Database Type","データベースタイプ"],["Automatically memorize manually inputted translations?","手動で入力された翻訳を自動的に記憶しますか？"],["Sorry, this addon is only available for active patrons only.\nYou can unlock this feature by becoming a $1 patron.","申し訳ありませんが、このアドオンはアクティブなパトロンのみ利用可能です。\nこの機能をアンロックするには、$1のパトロンになってください。"],["Automatically memorize translation made by automation scripts?","自動化スクリプトによる翻訳を自動的に記憶しますか？"],["Remind translations when performing translate selection?","翻訳選択時に翻訳をリマインドしますか？"],["Use rememorize in organic translation","有機翻訳で再記憶を使用する"],["default","デフォルト"],["Indexed DB (experimental)","Indexed DB（実験的）"],["MySQL","MySQL"],["Database Setting","データベース設定"],["IndexedDB","IndexedDB"],["Generate","生成"],["Escaping algorithm for inline code inside dialogues","ダイアログ内のインラインコードのエスケープアルゴリズム"],["Test connection","接続テスト"],["Connection success!","接続成功！"],["MySql","MySql"],["Connection failed!\nError:","接続失敗！\nエラー："],["Install MySQL Server","MySQLサーバーのインストール"],["How to setup MySQL Server","MySQLサーバーのセットアップ方法"],["Multiple translations for one key sentence is detected.\nOnly the last found translation will be memorized by the Translation Memory.\nDo you want to continue?","1つのキー文に対して複数の翻訳が検出されました。\n翻訳メモリには最後に見つかった翻訳のみが記憶されます。\n続行しますか？"],["Your database structure need to be updated.","データベース構造を更新する必要があります。"],["Upgrade database","データベースのアップグレード"],["This action will upgrade your database.\nDo you want to upgrade your translation memory database?","この操作によりデータベースがアップグレードされます。\n翻訳メモリデータベースをアップグレードしますか？"],["The translation memory database has been upgraded!\nPlease restart Translator++!","翻訳メモリデータベースがアップグレードされました！\nTranslator++を再起動してください！"]],"context":[["tid/292/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/302/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/340/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/350/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/388/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/398/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/436/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/446/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/484/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/494/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/532/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/542/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/588/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/598/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/643/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/653/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/698/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/708/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/754/type/StringLiteral","tid/764/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/835/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/878/type/StringLiteral","tid/1008/type/StringLiteral","tid/1138/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/965/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1095/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1225/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1290/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1300/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1310/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1390/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1428/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1459/type/StringLiteral","tid/1938/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1469/type/StringLiteral","tid/1948/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1500/type/StringLiteral","tid/1979/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1523/type/StringLiteral","tid/2093/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1557/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2114/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2153/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2201/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3362/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4084/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4095/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4123/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4203/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"tm.js","dirname":"/addons/tm","extension":".js","filename":"tm.js","path":"/addons/tm/tm.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Automatic organic translation memorization":0,"If checked, all organic translation (manually inputted translation) will be memorized automatically.":1,"Memorize translation by automation script":2,"If checked, Translator++ will remember the translation created from automation scripts. \nAll changes via 'this.cells' will be memorized. But it is possible for us to modify the contents of the grid directly using the trans API, such changes will not trigger the automatic memorization.":3,"Remind translation on cell translate":4,"If checked, Translator++ will load translation from translation memory first before performing automatic translation on selected cell.":5,"Default memorization behavior":6,"Overwrite previous record when performing organic translation. If unchecked, TM will not memorize the new translation for existing record.":7,"MySQL host":8,"The host name or IP address of your MySQL server":9,"MySQL port":10,"MySQL Port. Default is 3306.":11,"MySQL user name":12,"Username to access the DB.":13,"MySQL password":14,"Password to access the DB.":15,"Database Name":16,"Database name. Translator++ will try to create database if not exist. But the success is depend on the privilege of the given credential.":17,"Database Type":18,"Automatically memorize manually inputted translations?":19,"Sorry, this addon is only available for active patrons only.\nYou can unlock this feature by becoming a $1 patron.":20,"Automatically memorize translation made by automation scripts?":21,"Remind translations when performing translate selection?":22,"Use rememorize in organic translation":23,"default":24,"Indexed DB (experimental)":25,"MySQL":26,"Database Setting":27,"IndexedDB":28,"Generate":29,"Escaping algorithm for inline code inside dialogues":30,"Test connection":31,"Connection success!":32,"MySql":33,"Connection failed!\nError:":34,"Install MySQL Server":35,"How to setup MySQL Server":36,"Multiple translations for one key sentence is detected.\nOnly the last found translation will be memorized by the Translation Memory.\nDo you want to continue?":37,"Your database structure need to be updated.":38,"Upgrade database":39,"This action will upgrade your database.\nDo you want to upgrade your translation memory database?":40,"The translation memory database has been upgraded!\nPlease restart Translator++!":41},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/tm/tmUI.js":{"data":[["Memory","メモリ"],["Fix the problem!","問題を修正！"],["No exact matches found!","完全一致は見つかりませんでした！"],["Original","原文"],["Translation","翻訳"],["Do you want Translator++ to forget the selected cell(s)?","Translator++に選択したセルを忘れさせますか？"],["Auto recall","自動リコール"],["Auto memorize organic translation","有機翻訳の自動記憶"],["Auto memorize automation","自動記憶オートメーション"],["Use rememorize in organic translation","有機翻訳で再記憶を使用"]],"context":[["tid/47/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/534/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/591/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1126/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1131/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1804/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2391/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2543/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2686/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2838/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"tmUI.js","dirname":"/addons/tm","extension":".js","filename":"tmUI.js","path":"/addons/tm/tmUI.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Memory":0,"Fix the problem!":1,"No exact matches found!":2,"Original":3,"Translation":4,"Do you want Translator++ to forget the selected cell(s)?":5,"Auto recall":6,"Auto memorize organic translation":7,"Auto memorize automation":8,"Use rememorize in organic translation":9},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/tpp-localizationTool/fetchtrans.js":{"data":[["Preparing download file...","ダウンロードファイルを準備中..."],["Translation template downloaded successfully!","翻訳テンプレートが正常にダウンロードされました！"],["Building translation data...","翻訳データを構築中..."],["Processing: ","処理中："],["Fetching directory content...","ディレクトリ内容を取得中..."],["Parsing: ","解析中："],["Localization Tools"],["Generate UI Translation Template"],["Update Translation Table"],["This will overwrite www/lang/template.trans and update all localization files listed in www/lang/options.json.\n\nExisting translations will be preserved. New strings from the current source will be added.\n\nContinue?"],["Saving template.trans..."],["Loading language options..."],["Updating: "],["Failed to update: "],["Translation tables updated successfully!"]],"context":[["tid/2001/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2228/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2286/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2439/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2623/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2825/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3098/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3131/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3208/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3244/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3358/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3402/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3651/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3800/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3840/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"fetchtrans.js","dirname":"/addons/tpp-localizationTool","extension":".js","filename":"fetchtrans.js","path":"/addons/tpp-localizationTool/fetchtrans.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Preparing download file...":0,"Translation template downloaded successfully!":1,"Building translation data...":2,"Processing: ":3,"Fetching directory content...":4,"Parsing: ":5,"Localization Tools":6,"Generate UI Translation Template":7,"Update Translation Table":8,"This will overwrite www/lang/template.trans and update all localization files listed in www/lang/options.json.\n\nExisting translations will be preserved. New strings from the current source will be added.\n\nContinue?":9,"Saving template.trans...":10,"Loading language options...":11,"Updating: ":12,"Failed to update: ":13,"Translation tables updated successfully!":14},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/transChatGPT/BetterChatGPT/dist/assets/index-05e7d66a.js":{"data":[["customModels.customLabel","カスタムモデル.カスタムラベル"],["model","モデル"],["|","|"],["promptLibrary","プロンプトライ