column":104,"Are you sure want to trim the whitespaces on selected column?\nThis action can not be undone!":105,"Are you sure want commit autopadding on selected column?\nThis action can not be undone!":106,"Markers":107,"Markers are visual guidelines for the number of characters in a line.":108,"The marker will only be visible if wordwrap in the text area is disabled.":109,"Add":110,"Clear all":111,"Enable suggestion":112,"Speech Synthesizer":113,"Reading speed:":114,"Pitch:":115,"Volume:":116,"Mark at":117,"Units":118,"Half width character (ie. Alphabet, etc)":119,"Full width character (ie. Hiragana, Kanji, 漢字, etc)":120,"Color":121,"Remove":122,"Current Cell's Editor Options":123,"Auto Padding":124,"Create":125,"Unable to open that file!":126,"Are you sure want to close the project?\nYou will lost any unsaved changes!":127,"Are you sure want to exit Translator++?\nYou will lost any unsaved changes!":128,"Do not show this message again!":129,"Back":130,"Are you sure want to execute the following script?":131,"No script found":132,"Open Script Editor":133,"How to add Automation here":134,"Clear Quick Launch":135,"Are you sure want to clear all quick launch scripts?":136,"Remove selected objects?":137,"Do you wish to remove related staging files too?\nWarning: This is can not be undone!":138,"Error!\r\nTranslator++ is unable to detect the type of ":139,"`Required application to parse ${":140,"} is not installed.\\nPlease install it through Third party application installer.\\nDo you want to open Third Party Application Installer window?`":141,"The game is packed with Enigma.\r\nDo you want to extract the package?\r\nThis will take minutes, depend on the size of your game.":142,"Copy & extract data into ":143,"Are you realy sure want to delete all translation on current page?\nWarning: this is irreversible action!":144,"Are you realy sure want to delete current file?\nWarning: this is irreversible action!":145,"Please enter the title":146,"Do you want to remove the currently selected row(s)?":147},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/js/ui.legacylog.js":{"data":[["You can view the more detailed information on console log (F12)","詳細情報はコンソールログ（F12）で確認できます"],["Close","閉じる"]],"context":[["tid/496/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/777/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"ui.legacylog.js","dirname":"/js","extension":".js","filename":"ui.legacylog.js","path":"/js/ui.legacylog.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"You can view the more detailed information on console log (F12)":0,"Close":1},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/js/ui.log.js":{"data":[["You can view the more detailed information on console log (F12)","詳細情報はコンソールログ（F12）で確認できます"],["Close","閉じる"]],"context":[["tid/946/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1227/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"ui.log.js","dirname":"/js","extension":".js","filename":"ui.log.js","path":"/js/ui.log.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"You can view the more detailed information on console log (F12)":0,"Close":1},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/js/ui.parts.js":{"data":[["Form","フォーム"],["Cancel","キャンセル"],["Ok","OK"]],"context":[["tid/514/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/784/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/841/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"ui.parts.js","dirname":"/js","extension":".js","filename":"ui.parts.js","path":"/js/ui.parts.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Form":0,"Cancel":1,"Ok":2},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/jsoneditor.html":{"data":[["Remove note","ノートを削除"]],"context":[["idx/0/attr/title"]],"basename":"jsoneditor.html","dirname":"/","extension":".html","filename":"jsoneditor.html","path":"/jsoneditor.html","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Remove note":0},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/login.html":{"data":[["working","作業中"]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText"]],"basename":"login.html","dirname":"/","extension":".html","filename":"login.html","path":"/login.html","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"working":0},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/note.html":{"data":[["Remove note","ノートを削除"]],"context":[["idx/0/attr/title"]],"basename":"note.html","dirname":"/","extension":".html","filename":"note.html","path":"/note.html","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Remove note":0},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/options.html":{"data":[["Click to login","クリックしてログイン"],["Translator &amp; Language","翻訳者 &amp; 言語"],["Proofreader","校正者"],["Assistant","アシスタント"],["General","一般"],["Preferences","設定"],["Add-ons","アドオン"],["About","バージョン情報"],["User Information","ユーザー情報"],["Login to your Patreon account to get access to the latest features and updates.","Patreonアカウントにログインして最新機能とアップデートにアクセスしましょう。"],["<i class=\"icon-login\"></i> Login","<i class=\"icon-login\"></i> ログイン"],["<i class=\"icon-login\"></i> Login with browser","<i class=\"icon-login\"></i> ブラウザでログイン"],["Welcome,","ようこそ、"],["Name","名前"],["Email","メール"],["Level <div class=\"infoHeadNote\">(Current subscription in USD cents)</div>","レベル <div class=\"infoHeadNote\">（現在のサブスクリプション額、米ドルセント）</div>"],["Points <div class=\"infoHeadNote\">(Total lifetime subscription in USD cents)</div>","ポイント <div class=\"infoHeadNote\">（生涯サブスクリプション合計額、米ドルセント）</div>"],["Payment status <div class=\"infoHeadNote\">(Current payment status)</div>","支払い状況 <div class=\"infoHeadNote\">（現在の支払い状況）</div>"],["\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 data-tran=\"\"><span class=\"blue\">Don't panic!</span></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5>And please read the following information.</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-tran=\"\">This flag indicates that Patreon has not yet successfully received the funds for your pledge. It's normal for the payment system to experience delays. Depending on your payment method and country of origin, delays can occur for up to 24 hours.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-tran=\"\">During this delay, you might see a debit from your credit card. Don’t worry—Patreon will retry at regular intervals to check if they have received your payment. This usually resolves itself within 24 hours.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-tran=\"\">If the issue persists beyond this period, please post in the <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/870491016891883570/1122329902637650010\" external=\"\">account-problem</a> thread on the Translator++ server on Discord. I will assist you as much as possible.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-tran=\"\">Please understand that to prevent fraud, <b><span class=\"userInfoPoints\">points</span> and <span class=\"userInfoLevel\">Level</span> will not be counted until your payment has been successfully received by Patreon</b>.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t","\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 data-tran=\"\"><span class=\"blue\">慌てないで！</span></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5>以下の情報をお読みください。</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-tran=\"\">このフラグは、Patreonがまだあなたの寄付金を正常に受け取っていないことを示しています。支払いシステムの遅延は通常のことです。支払い方法や出身国によっては、最大24時間の遅延が発生することがあります。</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-tran=\"\">この遅延中、クレジットカードから引き落としが表示される場合があります。心配しないでください—Patreonは定期的に再試行して支払いを受け取ったか確認します。これは通常24時間以内に解決します。</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-tran=\"\">この期間を過ぎても問題が続く場合は、DiscordのTranslator++サーバーの<a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/870491016891883570/1122329902637650010\" external=\"\">account-problem</a>スレッドに投稿してください。できる限りサポートします。</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-tran=\"\">詐欺防止のため、<b><span class=\"userInfoPoints\">ポイント</span>と<span class=\"userInfoLevel\">レベル</span>は、Patreonが支払いを正常に受け取るまでカウントされません</b>ことをご理解ください。</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t"],["<span class=\"blue\">Don't panic!</span>","<span class=\"blue\">慌てないで！</span>"],["This flag indicates that Patreon has not yet successfully received the funds for your pledge. It's normal for the payment system to experience delays. Depending on your payment method and country of origin, delays can occur for up to 24 hours.","このフラグは、Patreonがまだあなたの寄付金を正常に受け取っていないことを示しています。支払いシステムの遅延は通常のことです。支払い方法や出身国によっては、最大24時間の遅延が発生することがあります。"],["During this delay, you might see a debit from your credit card. Don’t worry—Patreon will retry at regular intervals to check if they have received your payment. This usually resolves itself within 24 hours.","この遅延中、クレジットカードから引き落としが表示される場合があります。心配しないでください—Patreonは定期的に再試行して支払いを受け取ったか確認します。これは通常24時間以内に解決します。"],["If the issue persists beyond this period, please post in the <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/870491016891883570/1122329902637650010\" external=\"\">account-problem</a> thread on the Translator++ server on Discord. I will assist you as much as possible.","この期間を過ぎても問題が続く場合は、DiscordのTranslator++サーバーの<a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/870491016891883570/1122329902637650010\" external=\"\">account-problem</a>スレッドに投稿してください。できる限りサポートします。"],["Please understand that to prevent fraud, <b><span class=\"userInfoPoints\">points</span> and <span class=\"userInfoLevel\">Level</span> will not be counted until your payment has been successfully received by Patreon</b>.","詐欺防止のため、<b><span class=\"userInfoPoints\">ポイント</span>と<span class=\"userInfoLevel\">レベル</span>は、Patreonが支払いを正常に受け取るまでカウントされません</b>ことをご理解ください。"],["<i class=\"icon-logout\"></i> Logout","<i class=\"icon-logout\"></i> ログアウト"],["Primary Translator","プライマリ翻訳者"],["Default Translator Engine","デフォルト翻訳エンジン"],["\n\t\t\t\t\tThis Translator Engine will be used when you press <span class=\"keyboardHint\">Ctrl+g</span> at the selected cell(s) to <strong>g</strong>enerate translation at selected cell.\n\t\t\t\t","\n\t\t\t\t\tこの翻訳エンジンは、選択したセルで<span class=\"keyboardHint\">Ctrl+g</span>を押して<strong>g</strong>enerate translation（選択セルで翻訳を生成）する際に使用されます。\n\t\t\t\t"],["Default Language","デフォルト言語"],["\n\t\t\t\tThe default language settings across projects!<br>\n\t\t\t\tThe settings in the project's properties will override this value.\n\t\t\t","\n\t\t\t\tプロジェクト全体のデフォルト言語設定です！<br>\n\t\t\t\tプロジェクトのプロパティ設定がこの値を上書きします。\n\t\t\t"],["Default Source Language","デフォルトソース言語"],["Default Target Language","デフォルトターゲット言語"],["Custom escape","カスタムエスケープ"],["Patterns","パターン"],["\n\t\t\t\t\t\tAll words that match the pattern below will not be translated by machine translators. \n\t\t\t\t\t\tThis section is suitable for hiding tags and scripts from translation engines. <br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tEach entry is a valid javaScript's of regular expression, function, or literal string that separated by a <b>comma</b>.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tCustom escape only worked for supported <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/docs/translator/code-escaping-algorithm/custom-pattern/\" class=\"externalLink\">escape algorithm</a>.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>Hint:</b>You can also ask ChatGPT to generate you regular expression. <br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPlease write the regex pattern along with its modifier.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tfor example :\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<code>/(\\\\[a-zA-Z0-9]+\\[.*\\])+/gi</code>\n\t\t\t\t\t","\n\t\t\t\t\t\t以下のパターンに一致するすべての単語は、機械翻訳では翻訳されません。\n\t\t\t\t\t\tこのセクションは、翻訳エンジンからタグやスクリプトを隠すのに適しています。<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t各エントリは、有効なJavaScriptの正規表現、関数、または<b>カンマ</b>で区切られたliteral stringです。<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tカスタムエスケープは、サポートされている<a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/docs/translator/code-escaping-algorithm/custom-pattern/\" class=\"externalLink\">エスケープアルゴリズム</a>でのみ機能します。\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>ヒント：</b>ChatGPTに正規表現を生成させることもできます。<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t正規表現パターンとその修飾子を記述してください。<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t例：\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<code>/(\\\\[a-zA-Z0-9]+\\[.*\\])+/gi</code>\n\t\t\t\t\t"],["Tester","テスター"],["\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPaste your text here to check the pattern.\n\t\t\t\t\t\tAll matched pattern will be highlighted.\n\t\t\t\t\t","\n\t\t\t\t\t\tここにテキストを貼り付けてパターンを確認します。\n\t\t\t\t\t\t一致するすべてのパターンがハイライト表示されます。\n\t\t\t\t\t"],["\n\t\t\t\t<h2>Under Construction</h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p>This area will be the place where automatic proofreader settings and options will be configured.</p>\n\t\t\t","\n\t\t\t\t<h2>工事中</h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p>このエリアは、自動校正設定とオプションを構成する場所になります。</p>\n\t\t\t"],["AI Assistant","AIアシスタント"],["\n\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"display: inline-block; padding-top:2em; margin-left: -1.5em;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon-mira-ai-assistant\" style=\"font-size: 6em;\"></i>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Hi! I'm MIRAI, your AI assistant for Translator++.👋</strong></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Just click my icon <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.basicUtils.openMiraiAssistant()\"><i class=\"icon-mira-ai-assistant\" style=\"font-size: 1.5em;\"></i></button> on your Home menu to chat with me. I can assist you with:</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Translation improvements and suggestions</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Proofreading and quality checks</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Setting up your translation workflow</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Creating automation scripts</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>And much more!</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Let's make your translation work easier and more efficient together!</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><i>PS. I'm still new, So, please be patient with me.🙇‍♀️ But I'm learning and improving every day!😉</i></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t","\n\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"display: inline-block; padding-top:2em; margin-left: -1.5em;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon-mira-ai-assistant\" style=\"font-size: 6em;\"></i>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>こんにちは！私はMIRAI、Translator++のAIアシスタントです。👋</strong></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>ホームメニューのアイコン<button type=\"button\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.basicUtils.openMiraiAssistant()\"><i class=\"icon-mira-ai-assistant\" style=\"font-size: 1.5em;\"></i></button>をクリックするだけで、私とチャットできます。私は以下のサポートができます：</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>翻訳の改善と提案</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>校正と品質チェック</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>翻訳ワークフローの設定</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>自動化スクリプトの作成</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>その他いろいろ！</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>一緒に翻訳作業をより簡単で効率的にしましょう！</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><i>PS. 私はまだ新しいので、どうかご辛抱ください。🙇‍♀️ でも、毎日学び、向上しています！😉</i></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t"],["AI Configuration","AI設定"],["Model Endpoint","モデルエンドポイント"],["The API endpoint URL for your AI model. For example: https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions","AIモデルのAPIエンドポイントURL。例：https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions"],["API Key","APIキー"],["Your API key for authenticating with the AI service. This will be stored securely.","AIサービスとの認証に使用するAPIキーです。安全に保存されます。"],["Model Name","モデル名"],["Select or enter the AI model to use. Models with tool support are recommended for best results.","使用するAIモデルを選択または入力してください。ツールサポートのあるモデルが最適な結果を得るために推奨されます。"],["File Association","ファイル関連付け"],["Extension","拡張子"],["Associate","関連付け"],["Set All","すべて設定"],["Unset All","すべて解除"],["Apply","適用"],["Update","更新"],["Auto update","自動更新"],["Automatically update Translator++ if possible.","可能であればTranslator++を自動的に更新します。"],["Allow reinstall the same version","同じバージョンを再インストールを許可"],["Allow Translator++ to reinstall the same version that has already been installed. Please keep this option disabled after you've installed the update, especially when your <b>Auto update</b> setting is on. Otherwise, your Translator++ will keep updating itself each time you open the program.","既にインストールされている同じバージョンのTranslator++を再インストールすることを許可します。特に<b>自動更新</b>設定が有効な場合は、更新をインストールした後はこのオプションを無効にしておいてください。そうしないと、プログラムを開くたびにTranslator++が自身を更新し続けます。"],["Use default browser to login","デフォルトブラウザを使用してログイン"],["Use your trusted system's default browser to login into your Patreon account. Unless this option is checked, Translator++'s embedded browser will be used.","信頼できるシステムのデフォルトブラウザを使用してPatreonアカウントにログインします。このオプションがチェックされていない限り、Translator++の組み込みブラウザが使用されます。"],["Multi threading","マルチスレッド"],["Number of thread","スレッド数"],["The number of child processes that are opened simultaneously.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t0 = disable multi threading. All process will be done by renderer process.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThe optimum amount usually is the number of your physical core - 1.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t","同時に開かれる子プロセスの数。<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t0 = マルチスレッドを無効化。すべてのプロセスはレンダラープロセスによって実行されます。<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t最適な数は通常、物理コア数 - 1です。"],["Backup","バックアップ"],["Enable backup","バックアップを有効にする"],["Automatically create backup every time you save your project.","プロジェクトを保存するたびに自動的にバックアップを作成します。"],["Backup level history","バックアップ履歴レベル"],["How many history of backup do you want to keep?","バックアップ履歴をいくつ保持しますか？"],["Log &amp; Debugging","ログ &amp; デバッグ"],["Log to file","ファイルにログを記録"],["Log to file instead of the default console window.<br>This is useful if you want to debug Translator++ and you don't have access to the console window. Enabling this option will impact the performance slightly. So, you want this option to be off all the time, except when you're debugging or reporting problems.<br>Logs are saved in data/logs/ folder.","デフォルトのコンソールウィンドウの代わりにファイルにログを記録します。<br>これは、Translator++をデバッグしたいがコンソールウィンドウにアクセスできない場合に便利です。このオプションを有効にすると、パフォーマンスがわずかに低下します。そのため、デバッグや問題報告時を除き、常にこのオプションをオフにしておくことをお勧めします。<br>ログは data/logs/ フォルダに保存されます。"],["Truncate log file each session","セッションごとにログファイルを切り詰める"],["When checked your log file will be truncated each time you re open the application.","チェックすると、アプリケーションを再起動するたびにログファイルが切り詰められます。"],["Application Settings","アプリケーション設定"],["Enable remote debugging","リモートデバッグを有効にする"],["Enables the Chrome DevTools remote debugging protocol on port 9222. This allows you to inspect and debug Translator++ using an external browser by navigating to <code>chrome://inspect</code>. This flag adds <code>--remote-debugging-port=9222</code> to the application startup arguments. A restart is required to apply changes.","ポート9222でChrome DevToolsリモートデバッグプロトコルを有効にします。これにより、外部ブラウザで<code>chrome://inspect</code>に移動してTranslator++を検査およびデバッグできます。このフラグは、アプリケーション起動引数に<code>--remote-debugging-port=9222</code>を追加します。変更を適用するには再起動が必要です。"],["Disable GPU","GPUを無効にする"],["Disables hardware GPU acceleration. This is useful if you experience visual glitches, crashes, or rendering issues on certain graphics hardware or drivers. This flag adds <code>--disable-gpu</code> to the application startup arguments. A restart is required to apply changes.","ハードウェアGPUアクセラレーションを無効にします。これは、特定のグラフィックスハードウェアやドライバで視覚的な不具合、クラッシュ、またはレンダリングの問題が発生する場合に便利です。このフラグは、アプリケーション起動引数に<code>--disable-gpu</code>を追加します。変更を適用するには再起動が必要です。"],["Dangerous Area","危険な領域"],["Interface Language","インターフェース言語"],["UI Language","UI言語"],["Set the language of the user interface. You can create your own localization if Translator++ is not available in your language. The language data are located inside www/lang folder.","ユーザーインターフェースの言語を設定します。Translator++があなたの言語で利用できない場合は、独自のローカライゼーションを作成できます。言語データは www/lang フォルダ内にあります。"],["Spell checker Language","スペルチェッカー言語"],["Set the default spell checker language.","デフォルトのスペルチェッカー言語を設定します。"],["Environment Variables","環境変数"],["Staging Directory","ステージングディレクトリ"],["Staging Directory is a hard cache of projects that are being worked on. A portion of the data from the raw materials are copied to this directory to be accessed the interpreter scripts.","ステージングディレクトリは、作業中のプロジェクトのハードキャッシュです。原材料の一部のデータがこのディレクトリにコピーされ、インタプリタスクリプトでアクセスされます。"],["Project creation","プロジェクト作成"],["Auto Load Common Reference","共通参照を自動ロード"],["Auto load common reference from .trans file.",".transファイルから共通参照を自動ロードします。"],["Project settings","プロジェクト設定"],["Progress Column Indices","進捗列インデックス"],["Here, you can specify which columns will be included in the project's progress calculation.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>The column index is a zero-based integer, where the leftmost column is 0.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>Use commas to specify multiple columns. For example: <code>2,3,4</code>.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br><b>Default: Blank</b>. If left blank, Translator++ will calculate progress from all available columns.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t","ここでは、プロジェクトの進捗計算に含める列を指定できます。<br>列インデックスは0から始まる整数で、左端の列が0です。<br>複数の列を指定するにはカンマを使用します。例：<code>2,3,4</code>。<br><b>デフォルト：空白</b>。空白のままにすると、Translator++は利用可能なすべての列から進捗を計算します。"],["<i class=\"selected icon-ok-circled\"></i>Enable/Disable","<i class=\"selected icon-ok-circled\"></i>有効/無効"],["<i class=\"icon-download-cloud-1\"></i>Install","<i class=\"icon-download-cloud-1\"></i>インストール"],["Install from a package","パッケージからインストール"],["Visit our website &amp; documentation : ","当社のウェブサイトとドキュメントを訪問："],["Fork Translator++ at : ","Translator++をフォーク："],["Support Translator++ at : ","Translator++をサポート："],["Join our discord channel at : ","Discordチャンネルに参加："],["*) If you're a patron, you should <a href=\"https://support.patreon.com/hc/en-us/articles/212052266-How-do-I-connect-Discord-to-Patreon-Patron-\" target=\"_system\" external=\"\">link your discord account on your Patreon profile</a>. You will get invited automatically, and there are benefits waiting for you!","*) パトロンの方は、<a href=\"https://support.patreon.com/hc/en-us/articles/212052266-How-do-I-connect-Discord-to-Patreon-Patron-\" target=\"_system\" external=\"\">PatreonプロフィールでDiscordアカウントをリンク</a>してください。自動的に招待され、特典が待っています！"],["Version Info","バージョン情報"],["Last checked at : ","最終確認日時："],["Check now!","今すぐ確認！"],["You have a pending update","保留中の更新があります"],["Update now","今すぐ更新"],["Your Translator++ is up to date 😃.","あなたのTranslator++は最新です😃。"],["Architecture","アーキテクチャ"],["License","ライセンス"],["Click here to read the license.","ライセンスを読むにはここをクリック。"],["Credits","クレジット"],["Localization","ローカライゼーション"],["About Third Party Software","サードパーティソフトウェアについて"],["\n\t\t\t\tThis software is using third party softwares that located at /3rdParty. These third party softwares hold their own licenses and \n\t\t\t\tare included solely for convenience of use and \n\t\t\t\tprovided “as is” without warranty of any kind, either expressed or implied and such software is to be used at your own risk.\n\t\t\t\t","\n\t\t\t\tこのソフトウェアは/3rdPartyにあるサードパーティソフトウェアを使用しています。これらのサードパーティソフトウェアは独自のライセンスを保持しており、\n\t\t\t\t利便性のためにのみ含まれ、\n\t\t\t\t明示または黙示を問わずいかなる保証もなく「現状のまま」提供され、そのようなソフトウェアは自己責任で使用されます。\n\t\t\t\t"],["Special Thanks","特別な感謝"],["Want to explicitly support Translator++ by putting your name on this section?","このセクションにあなたの名前を載せて、Translator++を明示的にサポートしませんか？"],["Click here to learn more about how to do that!","その方法について詳しく知るにはここをクリック！"],["Changelog","変更履歴"],["Feeds","フィード"],["Click connect button, to connect translator with Translator++ table","接続ボタンをクリックして、翻訳者をTranslator++テーブルに接続"],["working","作業中"],["Patreon level/Your current pledge this month in cent (1 USD = 100 lv)","Patreonレベル/今月の現在の寄付額（セント単位、1 USD = 100 lv）"],["Points/Your lifetime pledge+bonuses in cent (1 USD = 100 pts)","ポイント/生涯寄付額+ボーナス（セント単位、1 USD = 100 pts）"],["Filter...","フィルター..."]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText"],["idx/1/innerText","idx/25/innerText"],["idx/2/innerText","idx/38/innerText"],["idx/3/innerText"],["idx/4/innerText","idx/49/innerText"],["idx/5/innerText","idx/82/innerText"],["idx/6/innerText"],["idx/7/innerText"],["idx/8/innerText"],["idx/9/innerText"],["idx/10/innerText"],["idx/11/innerText"],["idx/12/innerText"],["idx/13/innerText"],["idx/14/innerText"],["idx/15/innerText"],["idx/16/innerText"],["idx/17/innerText"],["idx/18/innerText"],["idx/19/innerText"],["idx/20/innerText"],["idx/21/innerText"],["idx/22/innerText"],["idx/23/innerText"],["idx/24/innerText"],["idx/26/innerText"],["idx/27/innerText"],["idx/28/innerText"],["idx/29/innerText"],["idx/30/innerText"],["idx/31/innerText"],["idx/32/innerText"],["idx/33/innerText"],["idx/34/innerText"],["idx/35/innerText"],["idx/36/innerText"],["idx/37/innerText"],["idx/39/innerText"],["idx/40/innerText"],["idx/41/innerText"],["idx/42/innerText"],["idx/43/innerText"],["idx/44/innerText"],["idx/45/innerText"],["idx/46/innerText"],["idx/47/innerText"],["idx/48/innerText"],["idx/50/innerText"],["idx/51/innerText"],["idx/52/innerText"],["idx/53/innerText"],["idx/54/innerText"],["idx/55/innerText"],["idx/56/innerText"],["idx/57/innerText"],["idx/58/innerText"],["idx/59/innerText"],["idx/60/innerText"],["idx/61/innerText"],["idx/62/innerText"],["idx/63/innerText"],["idx/64/innerText"],["idx/65/innerText"],["idx/66/innerText"],["idx/67/innerText"],["idx/68/innerText"],["idx/69/innerText"],["idx/70/innerText"],["idx/71/innerText"],["idx/72/innerText"],["idx/73/innerText"],["idx/74/innerText"],["idx/75/innerText"],["idx/76/innerText"],["idx/77/innerText"],["idx/78/innerText"],["idx/79/innerText"],["idx/80/innerText"],["idx/81/innerText"],["idx/83/innerText"],["idx/84/innerText"],["idx/85/innerText"],["idx/86/innerText"],["idx/87/innerText"],["idx/88/innerText"],["idx/89/innerText"],["idx/90/innerText"],["idx/91/innerText"],["idx/92/innerText"],["idx/93/innerText"],["idx/94/innerText"],["idx/95/innerText"],["idx/96/innerText"],["idx/97/innerText"],["idx/98/innerText"],["idx/99/innerText"],["idx/100/innerText"],["idx/101/innerText"],["idx/102/innerText"],["idx/103/innerText"],["idx/104/innerText"],["idx/105/innerText"],["idx/106/innerText"],["idx/107/innerText"],["idx/108/innerText"],["idx/109/innerText"],["idx/110/innerText"],["idx/111/innerText"],["idx/112/innerText"],["idx/113/innerText"],["idx/114/innerText"],["idx/115/innerText"],["idx/116/innerText"],["idx/117/innerText"],["idx/118/innerText"],["idx/119/innerText"],["idx/120/innerText"],["idx/121/innerText"],["idx/122/innerText"],["idx/123/innerText"],["idx/124/innerText"],["idx/0/attr/title"],["idx/1/attr/title"],["idx/2/attr/placeholder","idx/3/attr/placeholder"]],"basename":"options.html","dirname":"/","extension":".html","filename":"options.html","path":"/options.html","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Click to login":0,"Translator &amp; Language":1,"Proofreader":2,"Assistant":3,"General":4,"Preferences":5,"Add-ons":6,"About":7,"User Information":8,"Login to your Patreon account to get access to the latest features and updates.":9,"<i class=\"icon-login\"></i> Login":10,"<i class=\"icon-login\"></i> Login with browser":11,"Welcome,":12,"Name":13,"Email":14,"Level <div class=\"infoHeadNote\">(Current subscription in USD cents)</div>":15,"Points <div class=\"infoHeadNote\">(Total lifetime subscription in USD cents)</div>":16,"Payment status <div class=\"infoHeadNote\">(Current payment status)</div>":17,"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 data-tran=\"\"><span class=\"blue\">Don't panic!</span></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5>And please read the following information.</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-tran=\"\">This flag indicates that Patreon has not yet successfully received the funds for your pledge. It's normal for the payment system to experience delays. Depending on your payment method and country of origin, delays can occur for up to 24 hours.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-tran=\"\">During this delay, you might see a debit from your credit card. Don’t worry—Patreon will retry at regular intervals to check if they have received your payment. This usually resolves itself within 24 hours.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-tran=\"\">If the issue persists beyond this period, please post in the <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/870491016891883570/1122329902637650010\" external=\"\">account-problem</a> thread on the Translator++ server on Discord. I will assist you as much as possible.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-tran=\"\">Please understand that to prevent fraud, <b><span class=\"userInfoPoints\">points</span> and <span class=\"userInfoLevel\">Level</span> will not be counted until your payment has been successfully received by Patreon</b>.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t":18,"<span class=\"blue\">Don't panic!</span>":19,"This flag indicates that Patreon has not yet successfully received the funds for your pledge. It's normal for the payment system to experience delays. Depending on your payment method and country of origin, delays can occur for up to 24 hours.":20,"During this delay, you might see a debit from your credit card. Don’t worry—Patreon will retry at regular intervals to check if they have received your payment. This usually resolves itself within 24 hours.":21,"If the issue persists beyond this period, please post in the <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/870491016891883570/1122329902637650010\" external=\"\">account-problem</a> thread on the Translator++ server on Discord. I will assist you as much as possible.":22,"Please understand that to prevent fraud, <b><span class=\"userInfoPoints\">points</span> and <span class=\"userInfoLevel\">Level</span> will not be counted until your payment has been successfully received by Patreon</b>.":23,"<i class=\"icon-logout\"></i> Logout":24,"Primary Translator":25,"Default Translator Engine":26,"\n\t\t\t\t\tThis Translator Engine will be used when you press <span class=\"keyboardHint\">Ctrl+g</span> at the selected cell(s) to <strong>g</strong>enerate translation at selected cell.\n\t\t\t\t":27,"Default Language":28,"\n\t\t\t\tThe default language settings across projects!<br>\n\t\t\t\tThe settings in the project's properties will override this value.\n\t\t\t":29,"Default Source Language":30,"Default Target Language":31,"Custom escape":32,"Patterns":33,"\n\t\t\t\t\t\tAll words that match the pattern below will not be translated by machine translators. \n\t\t\t\t\t\tThis section is suitable for hiding tags and scripts from translation engines. <br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tEach entry is a valid javaScript's of regular expression, function, or literal string that separated by a <b>comma</b>.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tCustom escape only worked for supported <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/docs/translator/code-escaping-algorithm/custom-pattern/\" class=\"externalLink\">escape algorithm</a>.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>Hint:</b>You can also ask ChatGPT to generate you regular expression. <br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPlease write the regex pattern along with its modifier.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tfor example :\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<code>/(\\\\[a-zA-Z0-9]+\\[.*\\])+/gi</code>\n\t\t\t\t\t":34,"Tester":35,"\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPaste your text here to check the pattern.\n\t\t\t\t\t\tAll matched pattern will be highlighted.\n\t\t\t\t\t":36,"\n\t\t\t\t<h2>Under Construction</h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p>This area will be the place where automatic proofreader settings and options will be configured.</p>\n\t\t\t":37,"AI Assistant":38,"\n\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"display: inline-block; padding-top:2em; margin-left: -1.5em;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon-mira-ai-assistant\" style=\"font-size: 6em;\"></i>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Hi! I'm MIRAI, your AI assistant for Translator++.👋</strong></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Just click my icon <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.basicUtils.openMiraiAssistant()\"><i class=\"icon-mira-ai-assistant\" style=\"font-size: 1.5em;\"></i></button> on your Home menu to chat with me. I can assist you with:</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Translation improvements and suggestions</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Proofreading and quality checks</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Setting up your translation workflow</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Creating automation scripts</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>And much more!</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Let's make your translation work easier and more efficient together!</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><i>PS. I'm still new, So, please be patient with me.🙇‍♀️ But I'm learning and improving every day!😉</i></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t":39,"AI Configuration":40,"Model Endpoint":41,"The API endpoint URL for your AI model. For example: https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions":42,"API Key":43,"Your API key for authenticating with the AI service. This will be stored securely.":44,"Model Name":45,"Select or enter the AI model to use. Models with tool support are recommended for best results.":46,"File Association":47,"Extension":48,"Associate":49,"Set All":50,"Unset All":51,"Apply":52,"Update":53,"Auto update":54,"Automatically update Translator++ if possible.":55,"Allow reinstall the same version":56,"Allow Translator++ to reinstall the same version that has already been installed. Please keep this option disabled after you've installed the update, especially when your <b>Auto update</b> setting is on. Otherwise, your Translator++ will keep updating itself each time you open the program.":57,"Use default browser to login":58,"Use your trusted system's default browser to login into your Patreon account. Unless this option is checked, Translator++'s embedded browser will be used.":59,"Multi threading":60,"Number of thread":61,"The number of child processes that are opened simultaneously.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t0 = disable multi threading. All process will be done by renderer process.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThe optimum amount usually is the number of your physical core - 1.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t":62,"Backup":63,"Enable backup":64,"Automatically create backup every time you save your project.":65,"Backup level history":66,"How many history of backup do you want to keep?":67,"Log &amp; Debugging":68,"Log to file":69,"Log to file instead of the default console window.<br>This is useful if you want to debug Translator++ and you don't have access to the console window. Enabling this option will impact the performance slightly. So, you want this option to be off all the time, except when you're debugging or reporting problems.<br>Logs are saved in data/logs/ folder.":70,"Truncate log file each session":71,"When checked your log file will be truncated each time you re open the application.":72,"Application Settings":73,"Enable remote debugging":74,"Enables the Chrome DevTools remote debugging protocol on port 9222. This allows you to inspect and debug Translator++ using an external browser by navigating to <code>chrome://inspect</code>. This flag adds <code>--remote-debugging-port=9222</code> to the application startup arguments. A restart is required to apply changes.":75,"Disable GPU":76,"Disables hardware GPU acceleration. This is useful if you experience visual glitches, crashes, or rendering issues on certain graphics hardware or drivers. This flag adds <code>--disable-gpu</code> to the application startup arguments. A restart is required to apply changes.":77,"Dangerous Area":78,"Interface Language":79,"UI Language":80,"Set the language of the user interface. You can create your own localization if Translator++ is not available in your language. The language data are located inside www/lang folder.":81,"Spell checker Language":82,"Set the default spell checker language.":83,"Environment Variables":84,"Staging Directory":85,"Staging Directory is a hard cache of projects that are being worked on. A portion of the data from the raw materials are copied to this directory to be accessed the interpreter scripts.":86,"Project creation":87,"Auto Load Common Reference":88,"Auto load common reference from .trans file.":89,"Project settings":90,"Progress Column Indices":91,"Here, you can specify which columns will be included in the project's progress calculation.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>The column index is a zero-based integer, where the leftmost column is 0.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>Use commas to specify multiple columns. For example: <code>2,3,4</code>.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br><b>Default: Blank</b>. If left blank, Translator++ will calculate progress from all available columns.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t":92,"<i class=\"selected icon-ok-circled\"></i>Enable/Disable":93,"<i class=\"icon-download-cloud-1\"></i>Install":94,"Install from a package":95,"Visit our website &amp; documentation : ":96,"Fork Translator++ at : ":97,"Support Translator++ at : ":98,"Join our discord channel at : ":99,"*) If you're a patron, you should <a href=\"https://support.patreon.com/hc/en-us/articles/212052266-How-do-I-connect-Discord-to-Patreon-Patron-\" target=\"_system\" external=\"\">link your discord account on your Patreon profile</a>. You will get invited automatically, and there are benefits waiting for you!":100,"Version Info":101,"Last checked at : ":102,"Check now!":103,"You have a pending update":104,"Update now":105,"Your Translator++ is up to date 😃.":106,"Architecture":107,"License":108,"Click here to read the license.":109,"Credits":110,"Localization":111,"About Third Party Software":112,"\n\t\t\t\tThis software is using third party softwares that located at /3rdParty. These third party softwares hold their own licenses and \n\t\t\t\tare included solely for convenience of use and \n\t\t\t\tprovided “as is” without warranty of any kind, either expressed or implied and such software is to be used at your own risk.\n\t\t\t\t":113,"Special Thanks":114,"Want to explicitly support Translator++ by putting your name on this section?":115,"Click here to learn more about how to do that!":116,"Changelog":117,"Feeds":118,"Click connect button, to connect translator with Translator++ table":119,"working":120,"Patreon level/Your current pledge this month in cent (1 USD = 100 lv)":121,"Points/Your lifetime pledge+bonuses in cent (1 USD = 100 pts)":122,"Filter...":123},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/scriptEditor.html":{"data":[["Run","実行"],["New Project (ctrl+n)","新規プロジェクト (ctrl+n)"],["Open (ctrl+o)","開く (ctrl+o)"],["Save file (ctrl+s)","ファイルを保存 (ctrl+s)"],["Save As (ctrl+shift+s)","名前を付けて保存 (ctrl+shift+s)"],["Open debugger (F12)","デバッガーを開く (F12)"],["Help","ヘルプ"],["Select file in the current workspace","現在のワークスペースでファイルを選択"],["file path","ファイルパス"],["Create shortcut of the current script","現在のスクリプトのショートカットを作成"]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText"],["idx/0/attr/title"],["idx/1/attr/title"],["idx/2/attr/title"],["idx/3/attr/title"],["idx/4/attr/title"],["idx/5/attr/title"],["idx/6/attr/title"],["idx/7/attr/title"],["idx/8/attr/title"]],"basename":"scriptEditor.html","dirname":"/","extension":".html","filename":"scriptEditor.html","path":"/scriptEditor.html","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Run":0,"New Project (ctrl+n)":1,"Open (ctrl+o)":2,"Save file (ctrl+s)":3,"Save As (ctrl+shift+s)":4,"Open debugger (F12)":5,"Help":6,"Select file in the current workspace":7,"file path":8,"Create shortcut of the current script":9},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/tableEditor.html":{"data":[["Reset","リセット"],["Clear","クリア"],["Search","検索"],["Help","ヘルプ"]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText"],["idx/1/innerText"],["idx/0/attr/title"],["idx/1/attr/title"]],"basename":"tableEditor.html","dirname":"/","extension":".html","filename":"tableEditor.html","path":"/tableEditor.html","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Reset":0,"Clear":1,"Search":2,"Help":3},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/trans.html":{"data":[["Start","開始"],["Home","ホーム"],["Translator","翻訳者"],["Objects","オブジェクト"],["Live translation","ライブ翻訳"],["Original","オリジナル"],["Raw","生データ"],["Row Properties","行プロパティ"],["Default translation","デフォルト翻訳"],["Context translation","コンテキスト翻訳"],["\n\t\tPath <a class=\"problemPath\"></a> is not accessible by PHP interpreter.<br>\n\t\tPlease rename the path and use only alphanumeric naming.\n\t","\n\t\tパス <a class=\"problemPath\"></a> はPHPインタープリターからアクセスできません。<br>\n\t\tパス名を変更し、英数字のみの命名を使用してください。\n\t"],["<i class=\"icon-pin\"></i><span>Location</span>","<i class=\"icon-pin\"></i><span>場所</span>"],["File :","ファイル："],["Row ID :","行ID："],["<i class=\"icon-th-2\"></i><span>Context</span>","<i class=\"icon-th-2\"></i><span>コンテキスト</span>"],["<i class=\"icon-users\"></i><span>Actors</span>","<i class=\"icon-users\"></i><span>アクター</span>"],["<i class=\"icon-key-inv\"></i><span>Key Text</span>","<i class=\"icon-key-inv\"></i><span>キーテキスト</span>"],["<i class=\"icon-translate-1\"></i><span>Best Translation</span>","<i class=\"icon-translate-1\"></i><span>最適翻訳</span>"],["File ID","ファイルID"],["Path","パス"],["Original Format","元の形式"],["Data Length","データ長"],["Translated","翻訳済み"],["General","一般"],["Language","言語"],["Staging","ステージング"],["Stats","統計"],["Advanced","詳細設定"],["Info","情報"],["Title","タイトル"],["File Location","ファイルの場所"],["Project ID","プロジェクトID"],["Built on","ビルド日"],["Editor Name","エディター名"],["Editor Version","エディターバージョン"],["Engine","エンジン"],["Parser","パーサー"],["Parser version","パーサーバージョン"],["Raw Material Location <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"The location of the original material. You should not modify anything inside this folder.\"></i>","素材の場所 <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"元の素材の場所。このフォルダ内の内容は変更しないでください。\"></i>"],["<i class=\"icon-attention red\"></i> Invalid path.<br>Some features will be disabled until this is fixed.","<i class=\"icon-attention red\"></i> 無効なパスです。<br>修正されるまで一部の機能は無効になります。"],["Translated Material Location <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"The location of the game that has been translated. The default location of the translation injection.\"></i>","翻訳素材の場所 <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"翻訳済みのゲームの場所。翻訳注入のデフォルトの場所です。\"></i>"],["Translator <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"Prefered translator for this project. If not defined, global setting will be used.\"></i>","翻訳者 <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"このプロジェクトで優先する翻訳者。未定義の場合はグローバル設定が使用されます。\"></i>"],["Translate From","翻訳元"],["Translate Into","翻訳先"],["Staging Path <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"Staging path is the location of some files required to export/build translations. Staging files generated when you created the project.\"></i>","ステージングパス <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"ステージングパスは、翻訳のエクスポート/ビルドに必要な一部のファイルの場所です。プロジェクト作成時に生成されたステージングファイルです。\"></i>"],["Objects <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"Number of objects/files available on the left pane\"></i>","オブジェクト <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"左ペインで利用可能なオブジェクト/ファイルの数\"></i>"],["Folders","フォルダ"],["Characters <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"Number of characters in the Original Text column\"></i>","文字数 <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"原文列の文字数\"></i>"],["Words <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"May display wrong value in languages that doesn't use spaces (ie. Japanese, Chinese).\"></i>","単語数 <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"スペースを使用しない言語（例：日本語、中国語）では誤った値が表示される場合があります。\"></i>"],["Total Rows","総行数"],["Translated row","翻訳済み行"],["Organic translation <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"Users filled directly into the grid. Which is a good sign. Can be human translation, can be edited MTL, etc.\"></i>","有機翻訳 <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"ユーザーが直接グリッドに入力したもの。良い兆候です。人間翻訳、編集済みMTLなどが含まれます。\"></i>"],["&nbsp;","&nbsp;"],["Overall progress <span class=\"percentDisplay\" data-field=\"percent\"></span>%","全体進捗 <span class=\"percentDisplay\" data-field=\"percent\"></span>%"],["On after export<i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"Run a javascript function after this project is successfully exported.\"></i>","エクスポート後に実行<i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranattr=\"title\" title=\"このプロジェクトが正常にエクスポートされた後にJavaScript関数を実行します。\"></i>"],["Display this information when the project is opened.","プロジェクトを開いたときにこの情報を表示します。"],["Select Export Mode","エクスポートモードを選択"],["Export to a folder","フォルダにエクスポート"],["Export pre-compiled game data to a folder<br>Folder structures are retained","事前コンパイルされたゲームデータをフォルダにエクスポート<br>フォルダ構造は保持されます"],["Export as a Zip file","Zipファイルとしてエクスポート"],["Export pre-compiled game data to a single zipped archive","事前コンパイルされたゲームデータを単一の圧縮アーカイブにエクスポート"],["RPGMakerTrans Patch Files","RPGMakerTransパッチファイル"],["Export to RPGMakerTrans formatted *.txt files in a folder","フォルダ内のRPGMakerTrans形式の*.txtファイルにエクスポート"],["Comma Separated Values","カンマ区切り値"],["Export to Comma Separated Values (csv) files in a folder","フォルダ内のカンマ区切り値（csv）ファイルにエクスポート"],["Office Open XML (.xlsx) Excel 2007 and above","Office Open XML (.xlsx) Excel 2007以降"],["Export to Microsoft Excel Spreadsheet (xlsx) files in a folder","フォルダ内のMicrosoft Excelスプレッドシート（xlsx）ファイルにエクスポート"],["BIFF 8 (.xls) Excel 97 and above","BIFF 8 (.xls) Excel 97以降"],["Export to Microsoft Excel Spreadsheet (xls) files in a folder","フォルダ内のMicrosoft Excelスプレッドシート（xls）ファイルにエクスポート"],["HTML Spreadsheet","HTMLスプレッドシート"],["Export to HTML files in a folder","フォルダ内のHTMLファイルにエクスポート"],["Open Document Format/OASIS (.ods)","Open Document Format/OASIS (.ods)"],["Export to ODS files in a folder","フォルダ内のODSファイルにエクスポート"],["Select Import Mode","インポートモードを選択"],["Import translation from another .trans file","別の.transファイルから翻訳をインポート"],["Open another Translator++ file<br>Apply translation into current project.","別のTranslator++ファイルを開く<br>現在のプロジェクトに翻訳を適用します。"],["Import translation from spreadsheets","スプレッドシートから翻訳をインポート"],["Import translation from various spreadsheets file<br>(.xls, .xlsx, .ods, .html, .xml, etc)","様々なスプレッドシートファイルから翻訳をインポート<br>(.xls, .xlsx, .ods, .html, .xmlなど)"],["Import translation from RPGMakerTrans Patch format","RPGMakerTransパッチ形式から翻訳をインポート"],["Import translation from RPGMaker Trans' patch files<br>(.txt)","RPGMaker Transのパッチファイルから翻訳をインポート<br>(.txt)"],["Source :","ソース："],["Select objects to import","インポートするオブジェクトを選択"],["Import mode :","インポートモード："],["Import translations","翻訳をインポート"],["Import data object","データオブジェクトをインポート"],["Destination :","宛先："],["Currently selected : ","現在選択中："],["Options :","オプション："],["Import the context translations","コンテキスト翻訳をインポート"],["Case insensitive","大文字小文字を区別しない"],["Overwrite target","ターゲットを上書き"],["Destination column : ","宛先列："],["Translation mode :","翻訳モード："],["Row by row translation","行ごとの翻訳"],["Line by line translation","行内の行ごとの翻訳"],["Select translation by context address","コンテキストアドレスで翻訳を選択"],["Just copy translation into the same row (No checking)","同じ行に翻訳をコピーするだけ（チェックなし）"],["Merge data","データをマージ"],["Import translation from spreadsheet into project","スプレッドシートからプロジェクトに翻訳をインポート"],["Import translation from any spreadsheet format (xls, xlsx, odx, html, csv, etc).","任意のスプレッドシート形式（xls、xlsx、odx、html、csvなど）から翻訳をインポート。"],["<b>The spreadsheet must have at least 2 columns.</b> The most important column is the first column (the leftmost column) containing the original texts. The following columns contain the translations. Translator++ will use the text in the rightmost cell that is not empty.","<b>スプレッドシートには少なくとも2列が必要です。</b>最も重要な列は、元のテキストを含む最初の列（左端の列）です。次の列には翻訳が含まれます。Translator++は、空でない最も右のセルのテキストを使用します。"],["Please click the radio button to select files/folder to import","インポートするファイル/フォルダを選択するにはラジオボタンをクリックしてください"],["Import file(s)","ファイルをインポート"],["Import folder","フォルダをインポート"],["Import translation from RPG Maker Trans into project","RPG Maker Transからプロジェクトに翻訳をインポート"],["<i class=\"icon-tpp\"></i><span data-tran=\"\">Select project type</span>","<i class=\"icon-tpp\"></i><span data-tran=\"\">プロジェクトタイプを選択</span>"],["Select project type","プロジェクトタイプを選択"],["Spreadsheet","スプレッドシート"],["Start a translation project from spreadsheet data (xls, xlsx, ods, xml, html, sylk, gnumeric, csv)","スプレッドシートデータ（xls、xlsx、ods、xml、html、sylk、gnumeric、csv）から翻訳プロジェクトを開始"],["Blank project","空白プロジェクト"],["Create a new .trans file from scratch.","新規に.transファイルを作成"],["<i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i><span data-tran=\"\">Spreadsheet</span>","<i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i><span data-tran=\"\">スプレッドシート</span>"],["Fetch type","取得タイプ"],["The first columns are translatable text, the rest of the column are predefined translations (Create a grid data that matches the original table)","最初の列は翻訳可能なテキスト、残りの列は事前定義された翻訳（元の表に一致するグリッドデータを作成）"],["All columns are translatable text","すべての列は翻訳可能なテキスト"],["Custom","カスタム"],["Custom Options","カスタムオプション"],["Which column do you want to fetch?","どの列を取得しますか？"],["Please specify which column you want to fetch and which column you want to put the translation into. <b>It is 0 based index (the first column is 0)</b>.","取得する列と翻訳を配置する列を指定してください。<b>0ベースのインデックスです（最初の列は0）</b>。"],["Column to be translated","翻訳対象の列"],["Column to put translation into","翻訳を配置する列"],["Action","アクション"],["Enable Row Header Text Column","行ヘッダーテキスト列を有効化"],["If enabled, the parser will process the following Row Header Text Column rule","有効にすると、パーサーは以下の行ヘッダーテキスト列ルールを処理します"],["Row Header Text Column","行ヘッダーテキスト列"],["If specified, the value in this column will be applied to the row header. This is useful for determining the current speaker or actor, etc. It is a zero-based index.","指定すると、この列の値が行ヘッダーに適用されます。現在の話者や役者などを判断するのに便利です。0ベースのインデックスです。"],["Options","オプション"],["Calculate cell value","セル値を計算"],["Cell value in the form of formula will be transpiled","数式形式のセル値は変換されます"],["Get formatted value","フォーマットされた値を取得"],["Process cell values after formatting. (For example the integer 100000 in certain locale will become USD 100,000)","フォーマット後にセル値を処理します。（例：特定のロケールでは整数100000がUSD 100,000になります）"],["Parse CSV in EXCEL format","EXCEL形式でCSVを解析"],["Force the parser to parse CSV in MS EXCEL way. (only for CSV files)","パーサーにMS EXCEL方式でCSVを解析させます。（CSVファイルのみ）"],["Skip the first <i>n</i> row(s)","最初の<i>n</i>行をスキップ"],["Use this option if you want to skip the row header.","行ヘッダーをスキップしたい場合にこのオプションを使用します。"],["Select File(s)","ファイルを選択"],["Select a directory","ディレクトリを選択"],["<i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i><span data-tran=\"\">Create a new Trans file</span>","<i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i><span data-tran=\"\">新しいTransファイルを作成</span>"],["Create a new Trans file","新しいTransファイルを作成"],["The title of this project","このプロジェクトのタイトル"],["Engine type","エンジンタイプ"],["Type of the engine","エンジンの種類"],["<i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i><span data-tran=\"\">Placeholder for something great at the near future!</span>","<i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i><span data-tran=\"\">近い将来の素晴らしいもののプレースホルダー！</span>"],["Placeholder for something great at the near future!","近い将来の素晴らしいもののプレースホルダー！"],["This module will be created when the patron count reach 500!","このモジュールはパトロン数が500に達すると作成されます！"],["\n\t\tA project with the same title <br>\"<span class=\"dialogGameTitle\"></span>\"<br> is already exist on the post processed cache.<br>\n\t\tYou can re-use this cache to shorten loading time significantly.\n\t","\n\t\t同じタイトル「<span class=\"dialogGameTitle\"></span>」のプロジェクトが<br>処理済みキャッシュに既に存在します。<br>\n\t\tこのキャッシュを再利用すると、読み込み時間を大幅に短縮できます。\n\t"],["If you are confused, you can always safely click <strong><a href=\"#\">\"Create new project\"</a></strong> button. ","混乱している場合は、いつでも安全に<strong><a href=\"#\">「新規プロジェクト作成」</a></strong>ボタンをクリックできます。"],["Existed cache","既存のキャッシュ"],["Select Translator","翻訳者を選択"],["Source column","ソース列"],["Which column is the source text to translate for?<br>(default is key column / leftmost column).","翻訳するソーステキストはどの列ですか？<br>（デフォルトはキー列 / 最左列です）。"],["Target column","ターゲット列"],["Which column is the translated text put into.<br>(Can not same with source column)","翻訳されたテキストが配置される列です。<br>（ソース列と同じにはできません）"],["Translator's Options","翻訳者のオプション"],["Also try to translate other object","他のオブジェクトも翻訳を試みる"],["If this option is checked then Translator++ will also try to translate other objects that you did not select that doesn't require machine translation. This is the default behavior in Translator++ version 2.3.23 or lower.","このオプションをチェックすると、Translator++は選択していない、機械翻訳を必要としない他のオブジェクトの翻訳も試みます。これはTranslator++バージョン2.3.23以下のデフォルト動作です。"],["Ignore if already translated","既に翻訳済みの場合は無視"],["If this option is checked then Translator++ will ignore any row that already has translations on its column.","このオプションをチェックすると、Translator++はその列に既に翻訳がある行を無視します。"],["Overwrite cells","セルを上書き"],["Overwrite target cells. If not checked, the cells will not be touched when not empty.","ターゲットセルを上書きします。チェックしない場合、セルが空でないときは変更されません。"],["Save project on each batch.","各バッチでプロジェクトを保存"],["Save your project on each batch completion.<br>This option is to avoid data loss when the application crashes due to running heavy tasks from the local translator application. You probably don't need this if you're running cloud based translator.","各バッチ完了時にプロジェクトを保存します。<br>このオプションは、ローカル翻訳アプリケーションからの重いタスク実行によるアプリケーションクラッシュ時のデータ損失を防ぐためです。クラウドベースの翻訳者を使用している場合は、おそらく必要ありません。"],["Play sound when completed.","完了時に音を鳴らす"],["Tags","タグ"],["Select Context(s)","コンテキストを選択"],["Manual Query","手動クエリ"],["Match all words","すべての単語に一致"],["Remove selected","選択したものを削除"],["Remove all but selected","選択したもの以外を削除"],["Select Context","コンテキストを選択"],["Source Column","ソース列"],["Target Column","ターゲット列"],["Maximum length","最大長"],["Export into","エクスポート先"],["What to do with tagged rows?","タグ付き行の処理方法"],["Select Color Tag","カラータグを選択"],["On the fly word wrap","動的なワードラップ"],["Inject all files (ignoring selection)","すべてのファイルを注入（選択を無視）"],["You're about to inject translation via <b>Inject all</b> button. This will inject translation regardless your selected object on the left pane. Use left pane's context menu if you want to inject selected object.","<b>すべて注入</b>ボタンで翻訳を注入しようとしています。これは左ペインでの選択にかかわらず翻訳を注入します。選択したオブジェクトを注入したい場合は、左ペインのコンテキストメニューを使用してください。"],["Select the source material to be translated","翻訳するソース素材を選択"],["\n\t\t\t\tSelect the specific material or content you wish to translate, such as a file, directory, or other relevant input. Make sure the chosen material is accessible and appropriately formatted for the corresponding parser.<br>\n\t\t\t\tBy default, some parsers use the staging directory as the source material.\n\t\t\t","\n\t\t\t\t翻訳したい特定の素材やコンテンツ（ファイル、ディレクトリなど）を選択してください。選択した素材がアクセス可能で、対応するパーサーに適切にフォーマットされていることを確認してください。<br>\n\t\t\t\tデフォルトでは、一部のパーサーはステージングディレクトリをソース素材として使用します。\n\t\t\t"],["Path is inaccessible.","パスにアクセスできません。"],["Target Directory","ターゲットディレクトリ"],["\n\t\t\t\tA copy of your translated application will be generated in this folder.\n\t\t\t","\n\t\t\t\t翻訳されたアプリケーションのコピーがこのフォルダに生成されます。\n\t\t\t"],["Field can not be empty!","フィールドを空にできません！"],["Target to apply translation","翻訳を適用するターゲット"],["\n\t\t\t\tPlease select executable file.\n\t\t\t","\n\t\t\t\t実行可能ファイルを選択してください。\n\t\t\t"],["Copy materials","素材をコピー"],["The copying options from Source Material to Target Directory. (experimental, not all engines are supported)","ソース素材からターゲットディレクトリへのコピーオプション。（実験的、すべてのエンジンでサポートされているわけではありません）"],["Word Wrap by Tags","タグによる折り返し"],["Directory name","ディレクトリ名"],["\n\t\t\t\tThe object will be grouped under this directory.<br>\n\t\t\t\tEnter star \"<code>*</code>\" to add a new <b>reference object</b>.\n\t\t\t","\n\t\t\t\tオブジェクトはこのディレクトリの下にグループ化されます。<br>\n\t\t\t\tアスタリスク \"<code>*</code>\" を入力して新しい <b>参照オブジェクト</b> を追加します。\n\t\t\t"],["Invalid directory  name","無効なディレクトリ名"],["Object name","オブジェクト名"],["\n\t\t\t\tThe name of the object.\n\t\t\t","\n\t\t\t\tオブジェクトの名前です。\n\t\t\t"],["Invalid object name","無効なオブジェクト名"],["New Project","新規プロジェクト"],["Save","保存"],["Save as...","名前を付けて保存..."],["Open...","開く..."],["Recent","最近"],["None...","なし..."],["Export Project","プロジェクトをエクスポート"],["To a folder","フォルダへ"],["As a zip file","ZIPファイルとして"],["To portable .tpp file","ポータブル .tpp ファイルへ"],["To RPGMakerTrans file (*.txt)","RPGMakerTransファイルへ (*.txt)"],["To CSV file","CSVファイルへ"],["To XLSX file","XLSXファイルへ"],["To XLS file","XLSファイルへ"],["To ODS file","ODSファイルへ"],["To HTML file","HTMLファイルへ"],["Import","インポート"],["Project from .tpp file","プロジェクトを.tppファイルから"],["Translation from .trans file","翻訳を.transファイルから"],["Translation Spreadsheet","翻訳スプレッドシート"],["Translation RPGMKTRANSPATCH Format","翻訳 RPGMKTRANSPATCH 形式"],["Automation","自動化"],["Batch translation","一括翻訳"],["Context tool","コンテキストツール"],["Batch word wrapping","一括改行"],["Trim","トリム"],["Auto padding","自動パディング"],["Tools","ツール"],["Third Party Application Installer","サードパーティアプリケーションインストーラー"],["Close project","プロジェクトを閉じる"],["Exit","終了"],["Start here","ここから始める"],["Start a New Project","新規プロジェクトを開始"],["Continue your work","作業を続ける"],["Open Project","プロジェクトを開く"],["Your recent translation","最近の翻訳"],["Tips for you","あなたへのヒント"],["Next tip! <span class=\"icon-angle-double-right\"></span>","次のヒント！ <span class=\"icon-angle-double-right\"></span>"],["The rightmost cell in a row will get the priority.","行の最も右のセルが優先されます。"],["You can't share your project with others with just a trans file. You need to generate a TPP file.","transファイルだけではプロジェクトを他の人と共有できません。TPPファイルを生成する必要があります。"],["Always make backups of your trans files.","常にtransファイルのバックアップを作成してください。"],["You can rename and reorder the column with the coulumn header's context menu.","列ヘッダーのコンテキストメニューで列の名前変更や順序変更ができます。"],["Always backup your game before working with Translator++!","Translator++を使用する前に、常にゲームのバックアップを作成してください！"],["If you encountered a feature that is not running normally, try restarting Translator++, it will fix the problem in the most cases.","機能が正常に動作しない場合は、Translator++を再起動してみてください。ほとんどの場合、問題が解決します。"],["Always create a backup of your game before patching with a translation.","翻訳でパッチを適用する前に、常にゲームのバックアップを作成してください。"],["Thank you for supporting Translator++.","Translator++のサポートありがとうございます。"],["Please check Translator++'s online documentation at","Translator++のオンラインドキュメントを確認してください："],["working","作業中"],["Open","開く"],["Save file","ファイルを保存"],["Save As","名前を付けて保存"],["Import Project","プロジェクトをインポート"],["Inject / apply all translation","すべての翻訳を適用"],["Execute Global Level Custom Script","グローバルレベルカスタムスクリプトを実行"],["Toggle Active Cell Info","アクティブセル情報の表示切替"],["Project Properties","プロジェクトのプロパティ"],["Get Help (F1)","ヘルプを表示 (F1)"],["Batch translation (crl+b)","バッチ翻訳 (Ctrl+B)"],["File list","ファイルリスト"],["Live Translation Pane","ライブ翻訳ペイン"],["Toggle selection","選択の切替"],["Invert selection","選択の反転"],["Add A New Object","新しいオブジェクトを追加"],["Connect to auto translator","自動翻訳に接続"],["Undock pane","ペインを切り離す"],["Collapse / restore left panel","左パネルの折りたたみ/復元"],["Add new key (alt+n)","新しいキーを追加 (Alt+N)"],["Import Here","ここにインポート"],["Add a note to this file","このファイルにメモを追加"],["Open search menu","検索メニューを開く"],["Toggle grid information","グリッド情報の切り替え"],["Object Properties","オブジェクトプロパティ"],["Automatically set selected original text to clipboard","選択した元のテキストを自動的にクリップボードに設定"],["Resize Font","フォントサイズ変更"],["Toggle word wrapping & Explicit white spaces","ワードラッピングと明示的な空白の切り替え"],["Use Monospace font","等幅フォントを使用"],["Remove all translation from this file","このファイルからすべての翻訳を削除"],["Remove this file from project","プロジェクトからこのファイルを削除"],["file path","ファイルパス"],["Quick find","クイック検索"],["Active cell's info","アクティブセルの情報"],["View original untranslated text","元の未翻訳テキストを表示"],["View raw data","生データを表示"],["View row properties","行プロパティを表示"],["Go to current cell","現在のセルに移動"],["Current coordinate","現在の座標"],["Word wraping (for non Japanese text)","ワードラッピング（非日本語テキスト用）"],["Speak original text (alt+,)","元のテキストを読み上げ（Alt+,）"],["Copy original text into current cell (ctrl+0)","元のテキストを現在のセルにコピー（Ctrl+0）"],["Default translation for all occurrence","すべての出現箇所のデフォルト翻訳"],["Translations by context","コンテキストによる翻訳"],["This cell has a comment","このセルにはコメントがあります"],["This cell has an organic content","このセルには有機的な内容があります"],["This cell has been visited","このセルは訪問済みです"],["This is the first time this cell has been visited","このセルが初めて訪問されました"],["Word wraping","ワードラッピング"],["Speak current translation text (alt+.)","現在の翻訳テキストを読み上げる（alt+。）"],["Current Cell Editor options","現在のセルエディターオプション"],["Clear context translation for current row","現在の行のコンテキスト翻訳をクリア"],["Get help about translation by context","コンテキストによる翻訳のヘルプを表示"],["Open menu","メニューを開く"],["Path not accessible","パスにアクセスできません"],["The location of the original material. You should not modify anything inside this folder.","元の素材の場所。このフォルダ内のものは変更しないでください。"],["The location of the game that has been translated. The default location of the translation injection.","翻訳済みのゲームの場所。翻訳注入のデフォルトの場所です。"],["Prefered translator for this project. If not defined, global setting will be used.","このプロジェクトの優先翻訳者。定義されていない場合は、グローバル設定が使用されます。"],["-use default-","-デフォルトを使用-"],["Staging path is the location of some files required to export/build translations. Staging files generated when you created the project.","ステージングパスは、翻訳のエクスポート/ビルドに必要な一部のファイルの場所です。ステージングファイルはプロジェクト作成時に生成されます。"],["Number of objects/files available on the left pane","左ペインで利用可能なオブジェクト/ファイルの数"],["Number of characters in the Original Text column","原文列の文字数"],["May display wrong value in languages that doesn't use spaces (ie. Japanese, Chinese).","スペースを使用しない言語（例：日本語、中国語）では誤った値を表示する場合があります。"],["Users filled directly into the grid. Which is a good sign. Can be human translation, can be edited MTL, etc.","ユーザーが直接グリッドに入力。良い兆候です。人間翻訳、編集済みMTLなどが考えられます。"],["Run a javascript function after this project is successfully exported.","このプロジェクトが正常にエクスポートされた後にJavaScript関数を実行します。"],["Import .TRANS into project",".TRANSをプロジェクトにインポート"],["Import Spreadsheet Options","スプレッドシートオプションをインポート"],["Import RPGMTransPatch Options","RPGMTransPatchオプションをインポート"],["Start a new project","新規プロジェクトを開始"],["Search project type...","プロジェクトタイプを検索..."],["Remove row","行を削除"],["Add row","行を追加"],["Project is exist","プロジェクトが存在します"],["Context Tool","コンテキストツール"],["Your list of context separated by new line","改行で区切られたコンテキストのリスト"],["Wrap text","テキストを折り返す"],["Export Options","エクスポートオプション"],["Tagging","タグ付け"],["Apply Translation","翻訳を適用"],["Add new Object","新しいオブジェクトを追加"]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText"],["idx/1/innerText"],["idx/2/innerText"],["idx/3/innerText"],["idx/4/innerText"],["idx/5/innerText"],["idx/6/innerText"],["idx/7/innerText"],["idx/8/innerText"],["idx/9/innerText"],["idx/10/innerText"],["idx/11/innerText"],["idx/12/innerText"],["idx/13/innerText"],["idx/14/innerText"],["idx/15/innerText"],["idx/16/innerText"],["idx/17/innerText"],["idx/18/innerText"],["idx/19/innerText"],["idx/20/innerText"],["idx/21/innerText"],["idx/22/innerText"],["idx/23/innerText"],["idx/24/innerText"],["idx/25/innerText"],["idx/26/innerText"],["idx/27/innerText"],["idx/28/innerText","idx/56/innerText"],["idx/29/innerText","idx/152/innerText"],["idx/30/innerText"],["idx/31/innerText"],["idx/32/innerText"],["idx/33/innerText"],["idx/34/innerText"],["idx/35/innerText"],["idx/36/innerText"],["idx/37/innerText"],["idx/38/innerText"],["idx/39/innerText","idx/41/innerText"],["idx/40/innerText"],["idx/42/innerText"],["idx/43/innerText"],["idx/44/innerText"],["idx/45/innerText"],["idx/46/innerText"],["idx/47/innerText"],["idx/48/innerText"],["idx/49/innerText"],["idx/50/innerText"],["idx/51/innerText"],["idx/52/innerText"],["idx/53/innerText"],["idx/54/innerText"],["idx/55/innerText"],["idx/57/innerText"],["idx/58/innerText"],["idx/59/innerText"],["idx/60/innerText"],["idx/61/innerText"],["idx/62/innerText"],["idx/63/innerText"],["idx/64/innerText"],["idx/65/innerText"],["idx/66/innerText"],["idx/67/innerText"],["idx/68/innerText"],["idx/69/innerText"],["idx/70/innerText"],["idx/71/innerText"],["idx/72/innerText"],["idx/73/innerText"],["idx/74/innerText"],["idx/75/innerText"],["idx/76/innerText"],["idx/77/innerText"],["idx/78/innerText"],["idx/79/innerText"],["idx/80/innerText"],["idx/81/innerText"],["idx/82/innerText","idx/106/innerText","idx/113/in